srīgurave namaḥ |

{atha śrīsarvānandanāthakṛta(-)sarvollāsasya

ullāsanirṇayaḥ} ||

prakṛterlakṣaṇaṃ śāstrardevatāmūrtikalpanaṃ |
ullāse prathame vakṣye nigamāgamalakṣaṇam || 1 ||

vakṣye'haṃ tantranāmāni dvitīyollāsakepi ca |
tricatuḥpañcamolāse sṛṣṭyutpattiṃ vadāmyaham ||  2 ||

ṣaṣṭhe sṛṣṭilayaṃ vakṣye saptame bhāvalakṣaṇam |
ācārañcāṣṭame vakṣye kumāryā lakṣaṇaṃ vidhim || 3 ||

vakṣye'haṃ navamollāse bhāvādināmalakṣaṇam |
daśame śrīgurordhyānamekādaśe'pi lakṣaṇam || 4 ||

dvādaśe vaiṣṇavācāraṃ tato bhaktiṃ trayodaśe |
vakṣye caturdaśollāse bali(-)lakṣaṇamuttamam || 5 ||

aṣṭāṅgayogasaṃsiddhiṃ vaiṣṇavācārameva ca |
vakṣye pañcadaśollāse śaivācāraṃ tathaiva ca || 6 ||

bibhāvau vīrapaśavorllakṣaṇaṃ pañcatattvakam |
tattvasyaivānukalpañca tilakañcaiva ṣoḍaśe || 7 ||

ullāse saptadaśake yantrarājasya lakṣaṇam |
śāktācārakramaṃ vakṣye vāmadakṣiṇabhedataḥ || 8 ||

nindakasya paśoścāpi aṣṭādaśe nirūpitam |
lakṣaṇaṃ sādhakānāñca divyacakrasya lakṣaṇam || 9 ||

vīracakrakramaṃ vakṣye ullāse'pyūnaviṃśatau |
cakrasthānamāsanañca cakramadhye praveśanam || 10 ||

vakṣye'haṃ devacakrasya lakṣaṇañcaiva viṃśatau |
jātyabhedaṃ cakramadhye tathā dravyanirūpaṇam || 11 ||

(kh)

guroḥ kṛpāprasādena taṃ vakṣye'pyekaviṃśatau |
dvāviṃśatikollāse pātrādhārau ca lakṣaṇau || 12 ||

ādya(-)tattvasya(-)māhātmyaṃ vakṣye'haṃ trayoviṃśatau |
dravyābhedaṃ śaktiśuddhiṃ caturviṃśatike'pi ca || 13 ||

pañcaviṃśatikollāse cādya(-)tattvasya śodhanam |
ānandabhairavadhyānaṃ tathaivānandabhairavīm || 14 ||

ṣaḍviṃśatau pravakṣyāmi saṃkṣepe dravyaśodhanam |
māṃsaṃ matsyañca mudrāñca lakṣaṇaṃ śodhanaṃ tathā || 15 ||

gurupādarajo dhyātvā vakṣye'haṃ saptaviṃśatau |
vakṣye'haṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śakteraṣṭāviṃśatike'pi ca || 16 ||

ūnaviṃśadikollāse vakṣye'haṃ śaktiśodhanam |
vidhānaṃ samvidā(-)pānamullāse triṃśadike'pi ca || 17 ||

śrīcakrasya ca pātrasya cādhārasya ca lakṣaṇam |
ekatriṃśadikolāse vakṣye nānāprakārakam || 18 ||

sādhakasya ca pātrāṇi dvātriṃśati nirūpaṇam |
vaṭukādivalistritriṃśadike parikīrtitaḥ || 19 ||

nyāsaṃ tarpaṇakaṃ karma catustriṃśati lakṣaṇam |
pañcatriṃśadike vakṣye prāthanaṃ pātravandanam || 20 ||

ṣaṭtriṃśati mahollāse niyamaṃ pātralakṣaṇam |
saptatriṃśadikollāse śrīgurordhyānalakṣaṇam || 21 ||

aṣṭaviṃśadikollāse madhudāna(-)pramāṇakam |
ūnacatvāriṃśadīti pañcamasya vidhānakam || 22 ||

catvāriṃśadikollāse vakṣye krīḍādilakṣaṇam |
ekacatvāriṃśadīti pañcamānāndalakṣaṇam || 23 ||

dvācatvāriṃśadīti sādhakānandalakṣaṇam |
ānandaṃ navapātrasya tricatvāriṃśadīti ca || 24 ||

(g)

caucatvāriṃśadullāse pañcamasya ca lakṣaṇam |
pañcacatvāriṃśadīti ānandastotramuttamam || 25 ||

abhiṣekakramaṃ vakṣye ṣaṭcatvāriṃśadīti ca |
saptacatvāriṃśadīti dakṣiṇācārabhāvakam || 26 ||

aṣṭacatvāriṃśadīti vāmācāraṃ viśeṣakam |
puṣpapramāṇaṃ tatraiva pañcadhā saptadheti ca || 27 ||

ūnapañcāśadullāse vidhānaṃ puṣpaśodhanaṃ |
vakṣye pañcāśadullāse lakṣaṇaṃ kulayoṣitām || 28 ||

ekapañcāśadullāse maithunasya ca lakṣaṇam |
dvāpañcāśadikollāse śaktijñānaṃ prakāśakam || 29 ||

tripañcāśadikollāse siddhāntācāralakṣaṇam |
catuḥpañcāśadulāse pūrṇānandaviśeṣakam || 30 ||

pañcapañcāśadullase pūrṇānandasya lakṣaṇam |
ṣaṭpañcāśadikolāse śaktyānandasya lakṣaṇam || 31 ||

saptapañcāśadullāse śaktimāhātmyamuttamam |
aṣṭapañcāśadullāse haṃsabījasya lakṣaṇam || 32 ||

dhyānatrasya māhātmyaṃ vakṣye'hamūnaṣaṣṭike |
divyācārakramaṃ vakṣye ṣaṣṭamullāse suniścitam || 33 ||

kaulācāra ekaṣaṣṭau kathito granthakṛdbudhaḥ |
prakṛterlakṣaṇaṃ yad yat svarūpañca dviṣaṣṭike || 34 ||

triṣaṣṭau brahmaṇaḥ jñānaṃ jīvanmuktastataḥ param |
catuḥṣaṣṭau samāptaśca granthollāsa(-)yathoditaḥ || 33 ||

[ityullāsa(-)nirṇayaḥ samāptaḥ] |




{sarvollāsatantram |

śrīsarvānandanāthaviracitam} |

[prathamollāsaḥ] |

śrīgurave namaḥ (kh: namaḥ parama devatāyai) |

praṇamya (g, gh: namāmi) prakṛtiṃ nityāṃ jagadātmasvarūpiṇīm |
sarvollāsaṃ mahollāsaṃ mahollāse vadāmyaham || 1 ||

nigamādāgamācchāstrād bhāvācāraṃ samuddhṛtam |
śrīsarvānandanāthoktaṃ śrīdevyāścaraṇāmbuje || 2 ||


gaṇeśatantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)


tvaṃ devi paramā nityā triguṇā triguṇātmikā |
prakṛterlakṣaṇaṃ kiñcittava sthāne vadāmyaham || 3 ||

ekādhikye guṇānāñcedvikṛtiḥ syānmaheśvari |
triguṇānāṃ samānānāṃ prakṛtiḥ sūkṣmarūpiṇau || 4 ||

same'pi nityā yā devī viṣame sādhyanityakā |
nityānityaprabodhārthaṃ heturjñeyaḥ parasparam || 5 ||

kecit (?) sthūlaṃ nityarūpaṃ kecit (?) sūkṣmaṃ prakalpayet |
nityānityaṃ jagat sarvamātmarūpeṇa bhāvitam || 6 ||

<p. 2>

ātmā ca parameśāni tridhārūpaṃ sanātanam |
paramātmā ca vāhyātmā jīvātmeti prakīrtitam || 7 ||

jīvātmā liṅgarūpī ca śuddhadīpaśikhākṛtiḥ |
tejodhyānaṃ mahadrūpaṃ tejīyaḥ sūkṣmarūpakam || 8 ||

hetunā bhāṣitaṃ yadyattattat sthūlaṃ maheśvari |
tejodhyānaṃ vinā kaścid (?) dhyānamātraṃ nacecchive || 9 ||

yathā dhṛtasya takrasya heturdughaṃ maheśvari |
sthūlasyāpi ca sūkṣmasya tejoheturdhruvantathā || 10 ||

mano'pi tejaḥ parame (!) sthūlamindriyabhāṣitam |
mano'tītaṃ sūkṣmamekamekamātraṃ nirañjanam || 11 ||

nirañjanaṃ sarvarūpaṃ sarvajñānasya kāraṇam |
sākṣivadbhāti tadbrahma prakṛtirvikṛtiḥ śive || 12 ||


atha nigamalakṣaṇaṃ yāmale (-)


nirgataḥ śaṅkarīvaktrād gataśca giriśānane |
mataḥ śrīvāsudevasya tasmānnigama ucyate || 13 ||


atha nigamākhyākathanam |


kalpasāraṃ kalpatattvaṃ kalpadrumamataḥparam |
purā proktā kalpalatā kalpānandañca (gh: kalpānandeti) pañcadhā || 
14 ||


athāgamalakṣaṇam |


āgataḥ śivavaktebhyo gataśca girijānanam (g: girijānane) |
mataḥ śrīvāsudevasya tasmādāgama ucyate || 15 ||

<p. 3> athāgamanigamaprakāśakathanam |


vāsudevo'pi tacchrutvāpyuvāca gaṇeśaṃ prati |
nandīśvarāya tadvākyaṃ nigamāgamasammatam || 16 ||

gaṇeśena pravaktavyaṃ yāmaleṣu prakāśitam |
evaṃ parasparaṃ vyāpta āgamonigamaḥ kṣitau || 17 ||

catuḥṣṭyāgamaḥ proktaḥ pañcadhā nigamaḥ śive |
yāmalañca caturdhoktaṃ tasmācchāstraṃ prakāśitam || 18 ||


atha yāmalotpattiḥ |


sūkṣme'pi nirmalā yā ca sthūle sā yāmalaḥ śive |
yāmaloktaṃ sthūlarūpaṃ sarvaśāstrasya bodhanam || 19 ||


atha śāstrotpattiḥ |


catuḥṣaṣṭyāgamaḥ proktaḥ pañcadhā nigamastathā |
yāmalañca caturdhoktaṃ tasmācchāstraṃ prakāśitam || 20 ||

nigamādāgamo jāta āgamād yāmalo bhavet |
yāmalādveda(-)saṃjātaṃ vedājjātaṃ purāṇakam || 21 ||

purāṇāt smṛti(-)saṃjātaṃ smṛteḥ śāstrāṇi yāni ca |
tāni gṛhṇāṇi yatnena cottamaṃ hi kramotkramāt || 22 ||


atha yugabhede śāstrācaraṇam |


satye śrutyuktakarmāṇi tretāyāṃ smṛtisammatam |
dvāpare ca purāṇāni kalāvāgamasammatam || 23 ||

āgamoktavidhānena kalau devān yajet sudhīḥ |
nahi devāḥ prasīdanti kalau cāndhavidhāntaḥ || 24 ||

<p. 4> atha śāstreṇa devatāyā mūrtinirūpaṇam |


paramātmāgamaḥ prokto vedo jīva udāhṛtaḥ |
purāṇānyaṅgaśāstrāṇi cāṅgaṃ pratyaṅgakaṃ smṛtiḥ || 25 ||

anyāni sarvaśāstrāṇi romādīni krameṇa ca |
śāstreṇa jñāyate rūpaṃ devatāyāḥ prabhedakam || 26 ||


nārāyaṇī tantre (-)


nigamātmā maheśāni paramātmāgamo dhruvam |
jīvātmā yāmalaṃ proktaṃ vāhyātmā vedarūpakam || 27 ||

aṅgāni ca purāṇāni aṅgasyāṅgaṃ smṛtiḥ priye |
anyāni yāni śāstrāṇi tanūruhāṇi pārvati || 28 ||

śāstreṇa devatārūpaṃ jāyate yugabhedataḥ ||


atha vedotpattikathanam |


brahmayāmasambhūtaṃ sāmavedamataṃ śive |
rudra(-)yāmalasaṃjātam (gh, ṅ: sambhūtam) ṛgvedāṃ paramaṃ 
mahat || 29 ||

viṣṇu(-)yāmalasambhūtaṃ yajurvedaṃ kuleśvari |
śakti(-)yāmalasambhūtamatharvaṃ paramaṃ mahat || 30 ||

sāmavedamataṃ satye tretāyāṃ ṛṅmataṃ śive |
dvāpareca yajurvedamartharvasya mataṃ kalau || 0 || 31 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse (-)
prathamollāsaḥ] || 1 ||




[dvitīyollāsaḥ] |

atha tantrākhyākathanam |

toḍale śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa lokānāṃ muktidāyaka (!)
adhunā śrotumicchāmi tantranāmānukīrtanam || 1 ||


śrīśiva uvāca (-)


śṛṇu devi mahābhāge dāso'haṃ tava kāmini |
tava snehena vaddho'smi tantrākhyāṃ kathayāmyaham || 2 ||

na vaktavyaṃ mahābhāge duṣkarme nāstike nare |
mama prāṇādhikaṃ tantraṃ lokānāṃ muktidāyakam || 3 ||

ananto (?) devadevī ca anantaṃ tantrameva ca |
gadituṃ naiva śaknomi brahmāṇḍānte'pi pārvati || 4 ||

tavājñayā maheśāni lokānāṃ trāṇahetave |
catuḥṣaṣṭīni (k, g: catuḥṣaṣṭyāni) (?) tantrāṇi mayaivoktāni kāmini 
|| 5 ||

kālītantraṃ muṇḍamālā(-)tārā(-)nirvāṇakāni ca |
śivasāraṃ vīratantraṃ liṅgārcana(-)latārcane || 6 ||

toḍalaṃ nīlatantrañca rādhātantraṃ maheśvari |
viśvasāraṃ bhairavākhyaṃ bhairavītantrameva ca || 7 ||

siddheśvaraṃ mātṛbhedaṃ samayātantrakaṃ śive |
guptasādhanatantrañca mātṛkātantrameva ca || 8 ||

<p. 6> māyātantraṃ mahāmāyā akṣayātantrakaṃ śive 
kumāryākhyāmahattantraṃ kulārṇavamataḥparam || 9 ||

kālikākulasarvasvaṃ kālikākalpatantrakam |
vārāhī yoginītantraṃ yoginīhṛdayaṃ śive || 10 ||

sanatkumāratantrañca tripurāsāratantrakam |
yoginīvijayaṃ bhadre mālinītantrameva ca || 11 ||

kukkuṭākhyaṃ mahattantraṃ śrīgaṇeśākhyatantrakam |
bhūtatantraṃ tathoḍḍīśaṃ kāmadhenu tathottamam || 12 ||

vīrabhadraṃ mahattantraṃ vāmakeśvarameva ca |
kulacūḍāmaṇitantraṃ bhāvacūḍāmaṇi priye || 13 ||

jñānārṇavañca varadātantracintāmaṇintataḥ |
kālīvilāsakaṃ tantraṃ haṃsatantraṃ maheśvari || 14 ||

cidāmbarataṭaṃ tantraṃ vijñāpanamataḥparam |
phetkāriṇīñca nityākhyaṃ tantramuttarasaṃjñakam || 15 ||

nārāyaṇīmahattantraṃ ūrddhvāmnāyakatantrakam |
jñānadvīpaṃ gautamīyaṃ tantraṃ niruttaraṃ śive || 16 ||

gāndharvaṃ kuñjikātantraṃ tantramuktāvalintataḥ |
vṛhat śrīkramatantrañca svatantraṃ tantrakaṃ śive || 17 ||

yonitantrañca kāmākhyāṃ tantraṃ proktaṃ varānane |
catuḥṣaṣṭyāni (?) tantrāṇi mayaivoktāni saṃprati || 18 ||

pratitantre paṭalāni catuḥṣaṣṭyāni (?) pārvati |
asaṃkhyāni ca tantrāṇi bhāvāni vividhāni ca || 19 ||

sarvaṃ yāmalasaṃgītaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭiprakārakam |
pradhānametadvijñeyaṃ caturyugamataṃ dhruvam || 0 || 20 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse (-)
dvitīyollāsaḥ] || 2 ||




[tṛtīyollāsaḥ] |

atha sṛṣṭyutpattikathanam (g: -prakaraṇam) |


jñānadvīpe śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)


deveśa prāṇanātheśa lokānāṃ muktidāyaka |
sṛṣṭipralayamāhātmyaṃ mama sthāne prakāśaya || 1 ||


śrīśiva uvāca (-)


sṛṣṭiṃ vinā maheśāni pralayaḥ ko bhaviṣyati |
pralayañca vinā devi kā sṛṣṭiścopajāyate || 2 ||

bījaṃ vinā na vṛkṣaḥ syādvināvṛkṣaṃ na bījakam |
tathā sṛṣṭi(-)layaṃ devi nityānityaṃ hi kalpanam || 3 ||

kalpanāyāṃ bhavet sṛṣṭiḥ kalpanāyāṃ layo bhavet |
sṛṣṭi(-)pralaya(-)māhātmyaṃ gadituṃ naiva śakyate || 4 ||

kiñcinmātraṃ pravaktavyaṃ jalabimbaṃ jale yathā |
tava snehena vaddho'haṃ kiñcinmātraṃ prakāśitam || 5 ||

nirākāraṃ mahāghoraṃ prakṛtiṃ puruṣātmakam |
sṛṣṭikāle'pi tadbrahma prakṛti(-)puṃsvarūpadhṛk (gh: prakṛtiḥ 
puruṣarūpadhṛka) || 6 ||

kṣaṇakākārarūpo'sau prakṛtiśca pumān śive |
kecidvadanti prakṛtiṃ kecicca puruṣaṃ śive || 7 ||


kecidvadanti yogīndrāḥ prakṛtiṃpuruṣātmakam |
tadbrahmāvācyaṃ vijñeyaṃ vācātītaṃ sunirmalam || 8 ||


<p. 9> mano'tītaṃ kriyātītaṃ vācātītaṃ maheśvari |
jñānārthaṃ sādhakasyāpi vadāmyekatvamāśritam || 9 ||

prakṛtyā jāyate sarvaṃ puruṣasyāpi lālasāt |
puruṣājjāyate sarvaṃ prakṛtyā api lālasāt || 10 ||

kāmodbhāvamadonmattā pūrṇānandasamāśritā |
puruṣādapi sraṣṭāhaṃ (?) viparītā vabhūva sā || 11 ||

mahākālī samākhyātā (k, kh: samākhyā sā) mahākālaḥ 
sadāśivaḥ |
mahākālīpralīno'tra mahākālaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 12 ||

mahākālapralīnātra mahākālī prakīrtitā |
vidyāvidyobhayorekā bhāvātītā maheśvarī || 13 ||

śaktibhāvaṃ samāśritya coktaṃ sṛṣṭiprakārakam |
sṛṣṭirūpaṃ śaktimātraṃ bhāvamātra (k, kh: bhāvamātraṃ) 
prabodhakam || 14 ||

śaktijñānaṃ bhāvamātramabhāvaṃ puruṣaṃ priye |
ubhayorekabhāvatvaṃ prakṛti(-)puruṣātmakam || 15 ||

dvitīyā tāriṇī jātā kāmārtā trāṇadāyikā |
patiṃ dehi jaganmātaḥ kāmabhāvena kāṅghitā || 16 ||

iti śrutvā mahādevaḥ svadehāt puruṣaṃ dadau |
taṃ prāpya sā mahāvidyā viparītā samāśritā (gh, ṅ: viparīta(-)
samāśritā) || 17 ||

tṛtīyā ṣoḍaśī jātā ṣoḍaśī vayasānvitā |
rājarājeśvarī vidyā sarvadevaprapūjitā || 18 ||

madirāpūrṇanayanā kāmabhāvasadānvitā |
patiṃ dehi mahākālī(-)kāraṇānandasaṃyutam || 19 ||

iti śrutvā mahādevi dakṣiṇāmūrtiravyayaḥ |
dakṣabhāgaṃ samāśritya sarvadā parisaṃsthitaḥ || 20 ||

<p. 9> pañcabhūtātmakaṃ yad yadvāmadakṣiṇabhedataḥ |
vāme ca ṣoḍaśī jñeyā dakṣiṇe puruṣo'vyayaḥ || 21 ||

nityānityamayaṃ brahma sṛṣṭirūpaṃ prakāśakam |
sādhakasya hitārthāya svānandārthe maheśvari || 22 ||

tripurādyā mahāvidyā cāṣṭabhāgena saṃsthitā |
bhuvaneśī bhairavī ca chinnamastā maheśvari || 23 ||

dhūmāvatī ca bagalā mātaṅgī kamalā śive |
ityaṣṭaśaktisaṃyuktaścāṣṭabhāgaḥ sadāśivaḥ || 24 ||

dakṣiṇādikrameṇaiva cāṣṭabhāgaḥ samāvṛtaḥ |
iti te kathitaṃ kānte sṛṣṭyutpattiprakārakam |
yasya vijñānamātraṃ hi jīvanmuktasya kāraṇam || 25 ||

vibhinne kṣaṇakākāre tāriṇī trāṇadāyinī |
madirāghūrṇanayanā madanākāṅkṣitā sadā || 26 ||

kāmānando mahādevo nāmākṣobhyasamāśritaḥ |
tasyā yoniṃ samāsādya śṛṅgārasṛṣṭimān sadā (g: mudā ) || 27 ||

bhāvātītā mahākālī tāriṇībhāvasaṃyutā |
tripurā sṛṣṭirūpā ca tridhaikaikā (gh: tridhaikātmā) tridhā śive || 28 
||

kālikā bījarūpā ca nīlārūpā ca tāriṇī |
sundarī sṛṣṭirūpā ca sṛṣṭirūpamidaṃ priye || 29 ||


rādhātantre sṛṣṭyutpattikathanam |


pūrṇānande mahāghore prakṛtiḥ puṃsamāvṛtā |
kṣaṇakākārarūpā sā bhāvātītā samāśritā || 30 ||

ātmendriyasukhaṃ devi (k: devaṃ ) svātmamātrapramāṇakam |
uvāca paramā śaktiḥ śṛṅgāraṃ kuru me priya || 21 ||


<p. 10> iti śrutvā mahādeva uvāca prakṛtiṃ prati |
tasyākṛṣṭo'pyahaṃ (kh: tenākṛṣṭo'pyahaṃ) devi śṛṅgāraṃ kuru 
me priye || 32 ||

tasyāstasya ca vākyena vādhitaṃ (k, g: vādhituṃ) na parasparam |
tatkṣaṇāt sā mahāśaktiḥ kṛṣṇo'bhūt parameśvarī || 33 ||

dṛṣṭvā kṛṇantu (gh: kṛṣṇasya) puṃrūpaṃ rādhā'bhūt 
parameśvaraḥ |
rādhāṃśena pumān jñeyaḥ kṛṣṇāṃśāt śaktirūpadhṛk (gh: 
kṛṣṇāṃśe nārī(-)rūpiṇī ) |
sṛṣṭirūpamidaṃ jñeyaṃ vaiṣṇavasya mataṃ dhruvam || 34 ||


atha tripurāsāratantre sṛṣṭyutpattikathanam |


mahākālī ghorarūpā dehacihnavivarjitā |
mahākālo'pyaṣaṣṭaśca (?) sisṛkṣābhāvamāśritaḥ (k: 
śiśubhāvasamāśritāḥ; kh: bhāvaśṛṅgārasamāśritāḥ) || 35 ||

mahākālyā mahāstotraṃ mantraṃ yantraṃ kriyānvitam |
balidānānvitaṃ devi puraścaraṇasaṃyutam || 36 ||

atha mahākālaviracitaṃ śyāmāstotram |

karpūraṃ madhyamāntyasvaraparirahitaṃ senduvāmākṣiyuktaṃ 
bījante mātaretattripuraharavadhu triḥkṛtaṃ ye japanti |

teṣāṃ gadyāni padyāni ca mukhakuharādullasantyeva vācaḥ 
svacchandaṃ dvāntadhārādhararucirucire sarvasiddhiṃ gatānām || 37 
||

ityādidvāviṃśatiślokenoktam |

iti śrutvā mahākālī vabhūva tripureśvarī |
paramāścarya(-)sat(-)śobhā trikuṭā triguṇānvitā || 38 ||


<p. 11> dṛṣṭvāpi sundarīrūpaṃ sundaro'bhūt sadāśivaḥ |
stotraṃ kuryāt (kh, ṅ: kṛtvā) vahuvidhaṃ mahābhāvasamāvṛtam || 
39 ||


atha sundarīstotram |


triguṇātmā trividhā ca trivindu tritvamāninī |
tribhuṣā ca trirūpā ca tripurāyai namonamaḥ || 40 ||

ityādiṣaṭślokenoktaṃ mahākāla(-)viracitaṃ tripurāstotram |
stotraṃ śrutvā mahādevī pūrṇānandena bhāṣitā |
svecchayā sā mahāvidyā tejīyastvā vivarddhinī || 41 ||

vīrabhāvo mahādevo dakṣiṇā mūrtiravyayaḥ |
yadā dakṣasamāsādyastadā sā dakṣiṇā parā || 42 ||

tasyā yoniṃ samāsādya saṃharedakhilaṃ jagat |
mahākālīmahākālī yonimadhye layaḥ priye || 43 ||

yonisthānaṃ hi vijñeyaṃ mahātripurasundarīm |
tasyāstrirekhā vijñeyā tripurātripurātmikā || 44 ||

tripure tripurādevī tripurārisamanvitā |
śūnyaṃ candraṃ vārṇañca tripuraṃ parikalpitam || 45 ||

vāṅmayā yā mahādevī kāmarūpāmayī ca sā |
śaktimātrasthitā nityā trikuṭeti mahākalā || 46 ||

sundarī sundaraṃ vyāpya sundaraḥ sundarīṃ yadā |
tadā sā tāriṇī vidyā mahāghorapareśvarī || 47 ||

madirāghūrṇanayanā kāmārtā kāmadāyinī |
dvitīyā sā mahāvidyā pūrṇabhāvena kāminī || 48 ||

patiṃ dehi jaganmātaḥ pañcamānandasaṃyutam |
iti śrutvā mahādevaḥ saṃkṣobhyañca parityajet || 49 ||

parasparañca saṃvyāpyamekadehaṃ dvidehakam |
ekātmābhāṅmahādevo dvitvātmā tāriṇī tadā || 50 ||

<p. 12> dvitvātmābhāṅmahādeva ekātmā tāriṇī tadā |
tatkṣaṇāt parameśāna ekabhāvadvibhākam |
stotraṃ kuryānmahādevyāstāriṇyāstrāṇadāyakam || 51 ||


atha tārāstotram |


tāriṇī trāṇadātrī syāttrāṇātmā trāṇabhāṣiṇī |
trāṇayuktā trāṇabhuktā trāṇabhuktā purātanī || 52 || ityādi |

stotraṃ śrutvā mahādevī tārā ghoratarā parā |
caturbhujā nīlavarṇā trinetrā śavavāhinī || 53 ||

dṛṣṭvaitattāriṇīrūpaṃ kālikā ghoradakṣiṇā |
caturbhujā kṛṣṇavarṇā trinetrā śavavāhanā || 54 ||

pañcāśadvarṇabhirmālāmuṇḍamālākṣamālikā |
dṛṣṭvaitat kālikāṃ vidyāṃ śrīvidyā tripurātmikā || 55 ||

caturbhujā raktavarṇā trinetrā pañcapūitā |
ādāntamadhyarahitā nityā sarvaprapūjitā || 56 ||

satyarūpā mahākālī satye pūjā mahāphalā |
tritārūpā sundarī syāt (g: syuḥ) tretāyāṃ phaladāyinī || 57 ||

dvāpare tāriṇī pūjyā dvāpareti ca tāriṇī |
kalau ca tridevā (kh: trideva) pūjyā kālīti tridevā (k, ṅ: tridevī) parā 
(gh: kalautu tripurāpūjyā kālīti tripurāparā ) || 58 ||

sundarīsaṃyutā kālī kālikā sundarīyutā |
ubhayormilitā tārā tāreti cobhayātmikā || 59 ||

nāmamātraṃ vibhedaṃ hi sādhakaḥ siddhihetave (gh: 
sādhakānāñca siddhaye) |
ekā vidyā trināmākhyā tamaḥ sattvaṃ rajastathā || 60 ||

trideveti tridhātmeti dvideveti dvidhātmikā |
eka deveti caikātmā kālītāreti sundarī || 61 ||

<p. 13> tridhātmanā bhavet sarvaṃ tejastejīya(-)nirmalam |
tridhaikātmā yadā jñātvā tadā mokṣaṃ layaṃ dhruvam || 62 ||

kriyātmāpi cātmabhinnaṃ dhyātvā sālokyabhāgbhavet |
tejīyaścaiva sārūpyaṃ sāyojyambā maheśvari || 63 ||

dhyātvā nirmalavadbhāsaṃ (gh: bhāvaṃ) sāyojyamvāpi mauktikam |
evaṃ caturvidhā (?) dhyāṃ caturyugamataṃ dhruvam (k: 
catuyugamataḥparam; kh: caturvargamataḥ param) || 64 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse
tṛtīyollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[caturthollāsaḥ] |

athānyaprakāreṇa sṛṣṭyutpattikathanam |


jñānārṇave śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)


yadā candraśca sūryaśca jalaṃ vasumatīpriya (!)
gaṅgādi nāsti tīrthādi viprādirjātibhedakaḥ || 1 ||

paśvācāraśca śaivaśca vīraśca divya eva ca |
siddhāntaścāpi kaulaśca etadbhāvaṃ naced yadā || 2 ||

utpattiḥ kena vā kutra kena vā kutracillayaḥ |
kathaya prāṇanātheśa sandeho yena naśyati || 3 ||


śrīśaṅkara uvāca (-)


gudaṃ liṅgaṃ hastapādau vākyañca parameśvari |
tyāgaṃ śṛṅgāramākarṣaṃ gamanaṃ stutigañjanam || 4 ||

śravaṇaṃ darśanaṃ ghrāṇaṃ sparśanaṃ rasavodhanam |
daśendriyamiti proktaṃ mana ekādaśaṃ priye || 5 ||

idaṃ śarīraṃ vijñeyaṃ vandhamokṣa (g: mukta) prabodhakam |
mano'pi naiṣṭhikaṃ yatra tatrendriyalayaṃ dhruvam || 6 ||

yathā vṛkṣādiṣu chāyā layamānā jalādiṣu |
jale naṣṭe punaśchāyā vṛkṣādiṣu pralīyate || 7 ||

tathendriyakriyānāśe punarmanasi līyate |
manasyutpadyate sarvaṃ bhāvamindiryasaṃyutam || 8 ||

layamānaṃ punastasmin bhāvamindriyavarjitam |
indriyasya gaterbhāvādācāro jāyate priye || 9 ||

<p. 15> ācāraśca kriyā jñeyā kriyayā kiṃ bhavennahi |
kriyāmātraṃ jagat sarvaṃ jagattasyāpi bījakam || 10 ||


śrīśaṅkaryuvāca (-)


ācāramūlā jātiḥ syādācāraḥ śāstramūlakaḥ |
devavākyaṃ śāstramūlaṃ devaḥ sādhakamūlakaḥ || 11 ||

kriyāmūlaḥ sādhakaśca kriyāpi phalamūlikā |
phalamūlaṃ sukhaṃ deva sukhamānandamūlakam || 12 ||

ānandaṃ jñānamūlañca jñānaṃ jñeyasya mūlakam |
tattvamūlaṃ jñeyamātraṃ tattvaṃ hi brahmamūlakam || 13 ||

brahmajñānamaikāmūlamaikyaṃ hi sarvamūlakam |
aikyaṃ hi parameśāna bhāvātītaṃ suniścitam || 14 ||

bhāvātītāt kathaṃ sarvaṃ pakāśaṃ bhāvamātrakam |
aṅkuraḥ syād yatra bīje tasmāvṛkṣaḥ praphullakaḥ || 15 ||

vināṅkureṇa bījo'bhūt vinākāmena kāmukaḥ |
dvayoryogaṃ vinā deva kiñcinmātraṃ na jāyate || 16 ||

ekamātre sthite deva dvitīyādi na jāyate |
dvitīyādisthite deva caikatvaṃ naiva jāyate || 17 ||

saṃkhyāmātraṃ mahādeva saṃkhyeyasya vivakṣitam |
saṃkhyeyasya mahādeva saṃkhyayasya vivakṣitam || 18 ||

asyādyamantaṃ kasmācca kathañcāpi prakāśaya |
ahaṃ tvaṃ ko mahādeva kathaṃ kasmādvadasva me || 19 ||


śrīśaṅkara uvāca (-)


bhāvaṃ hi sṛṣṭirūpaṃ syādabhāvaṃ sṛṣṭivarjitam |
bhāvābhāvavinirmuktamabhāvaṃ bhāvameva ca || 20 ||

bhāvātītamayaṃ bhāvaṃ bhāvaṃ bhāvātītaṃ param |
yathā darpaṇabimbeṣu pratibimbañca darśanam || 21 ||

<p. 16> tathā dvitvādikaṃ sarvaṃ bhāveṣvekeṣu dṛśyate |
dvitvamekatvasaṃyuktamekatvaṃ dvitvasaṃyutam || 22 ||

saṃkhyeyañca vinā saṃkhyā vijñātuṃ naiva śakyate |
dvitvabhāvaṃ vinaikatvaṃ kathamutpadyate śive || 23 ||

ekabhāvaṃ vinā kasmād dvitvabhāvaṃ prakāśitam |
parasparaṃ vinā vākyaṃ gadituṃ naiva śakyate || 24 ||

yathā dravyaṃ guṇāktañca guṇo dravyākta eva ca |
parasparaṃ vinā kiñcid jñānamātraṃ nacet kvacit || 25 ||

janakañca vinā janyo na janyo janakaṃ vinā |
phalaṃ vinā kriyā na syāt phalaṃ na syāt kriyāṃ vinā || 26 ||

tathā jñānañca jñeyañca parasparamapekṣitam |
jñānaṃ bhāvaṃ maheśāni jñeyaṃ bhāvavivarjitam || 27 ||

jñānaṃ jñeyañca yasyaikyaṃ tasya muktirakhaṇḍitā |
ekabhāvaṃ dvibhāvāktaṃ dvibhāvamekabhāvakam || 28 ||

ātmabhinnaṃ hi tvaṃmātramātmāhaṃ sarvarūpiṇam |
ahaṃ jñānaṃ vinā kvāpi tvaṃ jñānaṃ naiva jāyate ||
tvaṃ jñānañca vinā kvāpi ahaṃ jñānaṃ na jāyate || 29 ||

yathākāśaḥ sarvarūpaḥ sarvadravyeṣu saṃsthitaḥ |
tathāhaṃ tvaṃ sarvarūpaḥ sarvadravyeṣu saṃsthitaḥ || 30 ||

tvaṃ jñānaṃ khaṇḍamityuktaṃ pūrṇajñānamahaṃ dhruvam |
yathaitattena khaṇḍātmā varjite vyāpitaṃ jagat || 31 ||

ākāśasya na bhedaḥ syād ghaṭopalakṣito yathā |
tathāhaṃ tvaṃ dehalakṣo dehaṃ hi tanmayaṃ dhruvam || 32 ||

ghaṭe naṣṭe ghaṭākāśo yathākāśe pralīyate |
dehe naṣṭe tathāhaṃ tvaṃ paramātmani līyate || 33 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse caturthollasaḥ] || 4 ||




[pañcamollāsaḥ] |

athavānyaprakāreṇa sṛṣṭinirūpaṇam |


nirvāṇatantre (-)


satyaloke nirākārā mahājyotiḥ (-) svarūpiṇī |
māyayāchāditātmānaṃ kṣaṇakākārarūpiṇī || 1 ||

hastapādādirahitā candrasūryāgnirūpiṇī |
māyāvalkalasaṃtyajya (māyāvalkalamutsṛjya dvidhā bhinnā 
jaganmayīti prāṇatoṣaṇīdhṛtanirvāṇatantrīyapāṭhaḥ) dvidhā 
bhūtvā yadonmukhī || 2 ||

śivaśaktivibhāgena jāyate sṛṣṭikalpanā |
prathame jāyate puttro brahmasaṃjño hi pārvati || 3 ||


śrīkālikovāca (-)

śṛṇu puttra mahāvīra (gh: mahādhīra) vivāhaṃ kuru yatnataḥ |
etacchrutvā tato brahmā uvāca sādaraṃ priye || 4 ||

tvāṃ vinā jananī nāsti śaktiṃ me dehi sundarīm |
tacchrutvā jagatāṃ mātā svadehānmohinīṃ dadau || 5 ||

dvitīyā sā mahāvidyā sāvitrī paramā kalā |
asyāḥ saṅgaṃ samāsādya vedavistāraṇaṃ kuru || 6 ||

anāyāsaṃ sṛṣṭikartā bhavestvaṃ (bhava tvaṃ 
mudritanirvāṇatantre) mahīmaṇḍale |
dvitīye (dvitīyo prāṇatoṣaṇīdhṛto nirvāṇatantrīyapāṭhaḥ) jāyate 
puttro viṣṇuḥ sattvaguṇāśayaḥ || 7 ||

<p. 18> śrīkālikovāca (-)

śṛṇu puttra mahāvīra vivāhaṃ kuru yatnataḥ |

viṣṇuruvāca (-)


tava darśanamātreṇa niṣkāmī jāyate pumān || 8 ||

kathaṃ karomi he mātrmohinīṃ dehi me śive |
dehācchaktiṃ viniḥsṛtya (viniṣkṛṣya (-) (prāṇatoṣaṇīdhṛto 
nirvāṇatantrīyapāṭhaḥ)|) dadau tasmai ca kālikā || 9 ||

vaiṣṇavīṃ tāṃ mahāvidyāṃ śrīvidyāṃ paramśvarīm |
tāmāśritya mahāviṣṇuḥ pālayatyakhilaṃ jagat || 10 ||

tṛtīye (tṛtīyo -) jāyate puttro mahāyogī sadāśivaḥ |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā sā mahākālī tuṣṭiyuktā bhavettadā || 11 ||

śṛṇu puttra mahāyogin madvākyaṃ hṛdaye kuru |
tvāṃ vinā puruṣaḥ ko vā māṃ vinā kāpi kāmini |
atastvaṃ paramānanda vivāhaṃ kuru me śiva || 12 ||


śrīśiva uvāca (-)


yaduktaṃ mayi he mātastvāṃ vinā nāsti mohinī |
satyametajjaganmātarmāṃ vinā puruṣo na ca || 13 ||

asmin (-) dehe saṃsthite ca na karomi vivāhakam |
kuru dehāntaraṃ mātaḥ karuṇā yadi vartate || 14 ||

tatkṣaṇe sā mahākālī dadau bhuvanasundarīm |
ādibhūtā yathā kālī tathā bhuvanasundarī || 15 ||

<p. 19> tāmāśritya mahāyogī saṃharatyakhilaṃ jagat |
śaktiraṣṭavibhāgena bhāgaścāṣṭavidhā bhavet (gh: 
śambhoraṣṭavibhāgāśca śaktiścāṣṭavidhā bhavet (-) iti 
mudritanirvāṇatantrīyapāṭhaḥ | śaktivibhāgena 
śambhunāṣṭavidhobhavet) || 16 ||

kālikādyā mahāvidyā hyanena parameśvari |
iti te kathitaṃ kānte yathāsṛṣṭinirūpaṇam |
gopanīyaṃ prayatnena vidyotpattiryathā (k, g, ṅ: vidyutpattiryathā 
priye) priye || 17 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
pañcamollāsaḥ] ||




[ṣaṣṭhollāsaḥ] |

atha layaprakaraṇam |

jñānadvīpe śrīdevyuvāca (-)


kena rupeṇa vā svāmin layo'bhūt sṛṣṭirantataḥ (gh: kutracit) |
kathayasva mama sthāne (gh: kathaya prāṇanātheśa) yadi ta 
mayyanugrahaḥ || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca |

yathā jale jalaṃ devi kṣīre kṣīraṃ ghṛte ghṛtam |
aviśeṣaṃ tathā jñeyaṃ jīvātma(-)paramātmanoḥ || 2 ||

kṣīravarṇa (k: kṣīre varṇe) yathāpyekaṃ tathaikaṃ parameśvaram |
nānārupavatī gauḥ syāttathā (k: dugdhaṃ) nānātmako layaḥ || 3 ||

jīvātmā pañcabhūtātmā bāhyātmā tatsamāyutam |
bāhyātmā sthūlarūpañca jīvātmā sūkṣmabhāvakam |
sthūlasūkṣmobhayornāśe tadeva paramātmakam || 4 ||

ghaṭamadhye ghaṭākāśaṃ deheṣu dehinaṃ tathā |
yantramadhye yathā śabdaṃ dehe'haṃmātraśabdakam (gh, ṅ: 
deheṣu dehiśabdakam) || 5 ||

naṣṭe tasmin (gh: naṣṭepyete) yathākāśaśravaṇakākāravacchive |
vibhāgaṃ (gh: vibhāvaṃ) sṛṣṭimātraṃ hi layamānamabhedakam || 6 
||

<p. 51> śrīdevyuvāca (-)


kṣaṇākāraṃ hi yat proktamekeṣu dvitvalakṣitam |
kimarthaṃ (k: kiṃrūpaṃ) sṛṣṭirārambhaṃ kimarthaṃ (k: kiṃ 
rūpaṃ) nāśakartṛkam || 7 ||


mahānirvāṇatantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)


mahākālī parātmā ca kṣaṇakākārarūpiṇī |
māyayācchāditātmānaṃ tanmadhye samabhāvataḥ || 8 ||

mahārudraḥ sa evātmā mahāviṣṇuḥ sa eva hi |
mahābrahmā sa evātmā nāmamātravibhedakaḥ || 9 ||

ekamūrtistrināmāni brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ |
nānābhāvamano yasya tasya muktirna vidyate || 10 ||

brahmāṇḍāstatra jāyante lakṣaṃ lakṣaṃ sulocane |
tatra brahmā tatra viṣṇustatra rudraḥ pravinyaset || 11 ||

kecidvadanti sa brahmā kecidviṣṇuḥ prakathyate |
kecidvadanti rudraḥ sa eko devo nirañjanaḥ || 12 ||

ādyāśaktiyuto devaścakākārarūpakaḥ |
ānandaghanasaṃyuktaḥ (gh: -sandohaḥ) prabhuḥ prakṛtirūpadhṛk || 13 
||

nirguṇasyālayaḥ sākṣānmahākālyālayaḥ priye |
tatraiva vartate nityaścaṇakākārarūpakaḥ || 14 ||

tasya rūpaparaṃ nityaṃ parānandaparātparaṃ |
nityānandakarā devi kālikā dakṣiṇe sthitā || 15 ||

ādyāśaktirmahāmāyā devanirmāṇakāriṇī |
jāyate ca kṣitau vṛkṣo yathā pṛthvyāṃ pralīyate || 16 ||

toyāttu vudvudaṃ jātaṃ yathā toye pralīyate |
jalade taḍitutpattiryathā meghe pralīyate || 17 ||

<p. 22> tathā brahmādayo devāḥ kālikāyāṃ prajāyate (?) |
tathā pralayakāletu punastasyāṃ pralīyate (?) || 18 ||

śaktijñānaṃ vinā devi muktirhāsyāya kalpyate |
ekāṃśena bhavedbrahmā ekāṃśena janārdanaḥ || 19 ||

ekāṃśena bhavecchambhuḥ kālikāyāḥ sulocane |
aparā sā mahākālī nadyādīnāṃ samudravat || 20 ||

goṣpade ca yathā toyaṃ brahmādyā devatā stayā |
goṣpade kiṃ vijānīyāt samudrasya jalaṃ śive || 21 ||

tena brahmā na jānāti viṣṇuḥ kiṃ vetti śaṅkaraḥ |
sṛṣṭikartryā yadā kālyā pālyante ca surādayaḥ || 22 ||

tadā pralayakāletu punastasyāṃ pralīyate |
ato nirvāṇadā kālī puruṣasya ca śarmadā (gh: saṣvadā) || 23 ||

kṣaṇakākārarūpeṇa prakāśañca manomayam |
yathā sūryo jagadbhāti jñeyañca kṣaṇakaṃ tathā || 24 ||

ekā śaktirdvidhā bhūtvā madhye puruṣabhāṣitam |
punaḥ pralīna(-)kāle'pi dvidhaikaṃ puṃsagopitam || 25 ||

nityānitya(-)dvidhaikātmā (k: nityānityaṃyadakātmā) 
dvidhābhāvāśritaḥ pumān |
nityānityaṃ yadaikātmā tadaikaṃ brahmavigraham || 26 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse 
ṣaṣṭhollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[saptamollāsaḥ] |

atha bhāvapraśaṃsā (-)

nigama(-)kalpānande śrīśiva uvāca (-)

samuhyācārasaṅketaṃ bhāvasaṅketamevahi |
sūcitaṃ parameśāni kathayasvānukampayā || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)


sarvatantreṣu vidyāsu bhāvasaṅketamevahi |
tathāpi śaktitantreṣu viśeṣaṃ sarvasādhanam || 2 ||

sādhanaṃ bhāvamātraṃ hi bhāvena bhāvyavān bhavet |
ācāreṇa vinā bhāvaṃ kadācinnaiva jāyate || 3 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kasmādutpadyate bhāvaḥ kasmin (g, gh: kasmād) bhāvaḥ pralīyate |
bhāvavān phalabhāk kimbā kena vācāravān bhavet || 4 ||


śrīdevyuvāca (-)


bhāvastu mānaso dharmaḥ śabdasya hi kathaṃ bhavet |
kiñcid bhāvaṃ pravaktavyaṃ diṅmātradarśanaṃ yathā || 5 ||

yathekṣuguḍamādhuryaṃ rasanā jñāyate prabho |
tathā bhāvaṃ mahādeva manasā paribhāvyate || 6 ||

manasyutpadyate bhāvo manasīti pralīyate |
manasīti sthito bhāvaḥ punarmanasi līyate || 7 ||

<p. 24> yathā vṛkṣalatādyāśca sṛṣṭisthitilayaḥ kṣito |
tathā bhāvaṃ maheśāna manasyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 8 ||

toyājjātaṃ yathā bimbaṃ toyeṣu līyate priya |
manasyutpadyate bhāvaṃ līyamānaṃ manasyapi ||
kriyāktvadbhavedbhāvaḥ svarṇasya kuṇḍalādivat || 9 ||

āgamoktabhāva praśaṃsā (-)

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau śrīdevyuvāca (-)


deveśa prāṇanātheśa lokānāṃ bhāvadāyaka |
kena rūpeṇa loko'pi phalabhāg jāyate naraḥ || 10 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

bhāvaṃ vinā varārohe naiva śabdaṃ prakāśitam |
śabdamūlo bhavedbhāvo bhāvaṃ hi sarvamūlakam || 11 ||

bhāvājño'pi vakṣaḥ śrutvā kriyāmīṣmati yo naraḥ |
pumān strīveśadhārī ca yathāṅgaṃ bhaṅgavat śive || 12 ||

tasmācca parameśāni bhāvaṃ jñātvā kriyāñcaret |
bhāvaṃ vinā maheśāni phalabhāg jāyate yadi ||
napuṃsakasya kāntā kiṃ patyānandavivarddhinī || 13 ||

kriyāmūlo bhavedbhāvaḥ kriyāpi bhāvamūlikā |
kriyā(-)śakto bhāvayukto phalabhāk parameśvari || 14 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

mama prāṇādhiko deva stutinindāvivarjitaḥ |
bhāvamūlā kriyā proktā na bhāvena kriyā katham || 15 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kriyāyuktaṃ bhāvamūlaṃ kriyāpi bhāvamūlikā |
parasparaṃ vinā na syāt jñānaṃ jñeyaṃ yathāpriye || 16 ||

<p. 25> bahujāpāttathā homāt kāyakleśādivistarāt |
na bhavena mahādevi kriyāpi na phalapradā || 17 ||

kiṃ vīrasādhanairlakṣaiḥ kimākarṣaiḥ kulākulaiḥ |
kiṃ pīṭhapūjanenaiva kiṃ kanyābhojanādibhiḥ || 18 ||

svayoṣitpremadānena kiṃ pareṣāṃ tathaiva ca |
kiṃ jitendriyabhāvena kiṃ kulācārakarmaṇā |
yadi bhāvaviśuddhiḥ syānnasyāt phalaparāyaṇaḥ || 19 ||

bhāvena labhate muktiṃ bhāvena kulavarddhanam |
bhāvena gotravṛddhiḥ syādbhāvena kulaśodhanam || 20 ||

kiṃ nyāsavistareṇaiva kiṃ bhūtaśuddhivistaraiḥ |
kiṃ tathā pūjanenaiva yadi bhāvo na jāyate || 21 ||

kenaiva (gh: kenāpi) pūjyate vidyā na ca kena (gh: na kenāpi) 
prapūjyate |
phalābhāvācca deveśi bhāvābhāvaḥ prajāyate || 22 ||

bhāvanārasamāpanno bhaved yogī mahākaviḥ |
jaḍo'pi śuddhatāṃ yāti bhāvanārasatatparaḥ || 23 ||

śuddhāśuddhaṃ hi deveśi bhāvena labhate dhruvam |
bandhaṃ muktiṃ tathābhāvaṃ bhāvena labhate'pi ca || 24 ||

paśuṃ vīrañca divyañca kaulañca parameśvari |
bhāvena labhate sarvaṃ pāpaṃ puṇyañca niścitam || 25 ||

mānañcaivāpamānañca sukhaṃ (g, gh: hṛṣṭaṃ) duḥkhaṃ 
maheśvari |
jīvātmānaṃ parātmānaṃ bhāvena labhate'pi ca || 26 ||

ānandañca nirānandaṃ pānañcaivahyapānakam |
bhuktambā copavāsambā bhāvena labhate dhruvam || 27 ||

brāhmaṇaṃ kṣatriyaṃ vaiśyaṃ śudrañca parameśvari |
bhāvena labhate'pyetān bhāve'pyetān vinaśyati || 28 ||

laghuṃ guruṃ śivaṃ śaktiṃ pūjyaṃ pūjāñca pūjakam |
bhāvena labhate'pyetān bhāve'pyetān vinaśyati || 29 ||

<p. 26> śrīdevyuvāca (-)

bhāvamātraṃ jagat sarvaṃ sṛṣṭisthityantakārakam |
teṣāṃ madhye śreṣṭhabhāvaṃ mamasthāne prakāśaya || 30 ||


śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)


caturdhā bhāvamātraṃ hi caturdhācāramātrakam |
prakāśamātraṃ trividhaṃ bhāvācāraṃ maheśvari || 31 ||


atha caturdhā bhāvalakṣaṇam |


adhamā dehān bhāvanti jīvaṃ bhāvanti madhyamāḥ |
mokṣaṃ bhāvantyuttamāśca bhāvātītāstaduttamāḥ || 32 ||

adhamāḥ svakulācārāḥ śrutyācārāstu madhyamāḥ |
uttamā mokṣadācārāḥ svecchācārāstaduttamāḥ || 33 ||

adhamā pratimā pūjā japastotrādi(-)madhyamā |
uttamā nijapūjā (gh: mānasī pūjā) ca so'haṃ pujottamottamā || 34 
||

adhamā iha paśyanti parakālantu madhyamāḥ |
mokṣaṃ paśyantyuttamāśca nāpaśyantyuttamottamāḥ || 35 ||

adhamāḥ karmabhītāśca bhaktibhītāśca madhyamāḥ |
uttamā mokṣabhītāśca bhīto nāstyuttamottamāḥ || 36 ||

narajanmādhamā jñeyā devādijanma(-)madhyamāḥ |
jñānī janmottamaḥ mokto janma nāstyuttamottamaḥ || 37 ||

adhamo janmasaṃkhyāto janmajanma ca madhyamaḥ |
uttamaścaikajanmāpi janma nāstyuttamottamaḥ || 38 ||

adhamaṃ kṛtrimaṃ yantraṃ puṣpādiyantramadhyamam |
uttamaṃ yoniyantraśca sarvayantottamottamam || 39 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
saptamollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[aṣṭamollāsaḥ] |

atha trividhaprakārabhāvācāralakṣaṇam |

samayācāratantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)


bhāvastu trividho devi divya(-)vīra(-)paśu(-)kramāt |
ācārastrividho devi krameṇodāhṛto mayā || 1 ||

eka eva mahān bhāvo nānātvaṃ bhajate priye |
parādibhāvabhedena bhāvabhedastridhāpi ca |
ekabhāvaḥ paraṃ brahma sarvavighnapraṇāśakam || 2 ||


kumārītantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)


deva(-)deva mahādeva lokānāṃ hitakāraka |
ekabhāvaḥ kathaṃ deva mama sthāne prakāśaya || 3 ||

śrī śiva uvāca (-)

dvivarṣādadhikaṃ yāvat yāvadaṣṭābdakanyakā |
kumārī tatra vikhyātā yantra(-)tantraphalapradā || 4 ||

tasyāḥ ṣoḍaśaparyantaṃ yuvatī ca pracakṣate |
tatra bhāvaḥ prakāśo yaḥ sa bhāvaḥ paramo mataḥ || 5 ||

daśavarṣādhikā nārī ṣoḍaśābdaṃ maheśvari |
tāvad yuvatī vikhyātā tasyāṃ pūjā mahāphalā || 6 ||

ṣoḍaśābde kalāpūrṇā ṣoḍaśābde kalā sthitā |
tadante ṣoḍaśābde ca kalā sādhyakalā śive || 7 ||

<p. 28> śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa karuṇānātha mama prāṇādhika priya |
kalā kā parameśāna mama sthāne prakāśaya || 8 ||


śrīśiva uvāca (-)


yonisthānaṃ kalā jñeyaṃ kāmavāyuyutaṃ yadi |
kāmavāyumujjhitāyāḥ pūjane nāsti yogyatā || 9 ||

vibhāve paśubhāve ca gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
kumārīṃ pūjayeddevi kāmabhāvena (gh: vīrabhāvena) pūjayet || 0 || 
10 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse 
aṣṭamollāsaḥ] || 0 ||





[navamollāsaḥ] |

tatrāntare śrīdevyuvāca (-)


deveśa (itaḥ prabhṛti śamudrava" ityantaṃ ślokapañcakaṃ "gha" 
pustake nāsti | tatra pāṭho'yaṃ dṛśyate (-)
nārāyaṇītantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tridhācāraṃ tribhāvañca kaulācārasya kāraṇam |
paśvācāraśca vīraśca divyaḥ kaulo na saṃśayaḥ |
siddhāntaṃ vā maheśāni kaulabhāvaṃ samāśritam || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)
vaiṣṇavaścaiva śaivaśca śāktaśca parameśvara |
divyaḥ siddhantaḥ kaulaśca ṣaṭprakāraḥ kathaṃ vada || 2 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

paśvācāraṃ tridhā jñeyaṃ vīrācārastridhā priye |
caturdhā divyaḥ kaulaśca śakteśca puruṣasya ca || 3 ||
vaiṣṇavaḥ śaivo divyaśca kaulabhāvayutā paśuḥ |
dakṣiṇo vāmasiddhāntaḥ kaulayukto hi śāktakaḥ || 4 || ) 
prāṇanātheśa pārvatīprāṇavallabha |
ṣaḍācāraṃ caturbhāvaṃ kauljñānañca kiṃ vada || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

paśvācārastridhā jñeyo vīrācārastridhā śive |
pauruṣasya (k: pauruṣasya (-) puṃdevatāsādhakasyetyarthaḥ) ca 
śāktasya (k: śāktasya (-) śaktidevatāsādhakasyetyathaḥ) 
caturdhābhāvasaṃyutāt || 2 ||

<p. 30> paśubhāvayutāḥ kaulā vaidya(-)vaiṣṇava(-)śaivakāḥ |
vīrabhāvayutāḥ kaulāḥ siddhānto (ṅ: siddhantau) vāmadakṣiṇau || 3 
||

paśuśca dvividho devi sabhāvaśca vibhāvakaḥ |
vīraśca dvividho devi vibhāvaśca sabhāvakaḥ || 4 ||

evaṃ caturvidhā bhāvāḥ pañcamī divyabhāvakaḥ |
sarve kaulapathālambā nadyādīnāṃ samudravat || 5 ||

kaulaṃ hi parameśāni prakṛti(-)puruṣātmakam |
dvandvātītaṃ kriyātītaṃ kevalaṃ bhāvavarjitam |
kaulārthaṃ hi kriyāmātraṃ kauleṣu muktibhāg bhavet || 6 ||

atha kaulajñānasyakāraṇam |

jñāndvīpe (-)

sarvebhyaścottamā vedā vedebhyo vaiṣṇavottamaḥ |
vaiṣṇavāduttamaḥ śaivaḥ śaivācca śākta uttamaḥ || 7 ||

śāktaśca dvividho devi vāmadakṣiṇabhedataḥ |
dakṣiṇāduttamo vāmo vāmāt siddhanta uttamaḥ || 8 ||

siddhāntāduttamaḥ kaulaḥ kaulāt parataro na hi |
kaulācāraṃ sarvabījaṃ kaulācāramayaṃ jagat |
kaulācāraṃ bhāvamātraṃ kaulaṃ hi bhāvavarjitam || 9 ||

(g, ṅ: siddhāntau) etairācārairyogādhikārī nirūpito yathā (-)

pipīlikā kṣudravṛhacca maṇḍūkastiryak kapiḥ pakṣi (?) rajāgaro 
yathā |
śrutyādi cācāravaśādbhaviṣyati yogādhikāro kramaśaḥ 
pratiṣṭhaḥ ||

iti nāgabhaṭṭaḥ |

atha paśvācāraḥ |

samayācāratantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)


vedoktena yajeddevaṃ kāmasaṅkalpapūrvakam |
ya eva vaidikācāraḥ (ṅ: vaiṣṇavācāraḥ) paśvācāraḥ sa eva hi || 10 
||

na matsya (-) bhojanaṃ devi na striyaṃ manasā smaret |
paradravye na lobhaḥ syānna bhogaṃ manasā smaret || 11 ||

sindhutīre kānane vā parvate vā surālaye |
bilvamūle vivikte ca puṇyakṣetre suśobhane || 12 ||

devatā śuddhabhāvena dhyātavyā susamāhitaḥ (k: susamāhitaiḥ) |
na śūdradarśanaṃ kuryāt kauṭilyaṃ dūratastyajet || 13 ||

trisandhyāṃ pūjayeddevaṃ trisandhyāṃ japamācaret |
rātrau yantrañca mālāñca spṛśennaiva kadācana || 14 ||

vīrakāryakathālāpaṃ na kuryād gurunindanam |
nindanaṃ kalpanaṃ jñeyaṃ gurvantara(-)gururyadi |
yathātmakalpanaṃ jīvaṃ tattvajñānasya kāraṇam || 15 ||

gurutantre gurunindanam |

madhulubdho yathā bhṛṅgaḥ puṣpāt puṣpāntaraṃ vrajet |
jñānalubdhastathā śiṣyo gurorvurvantaraṃ vrajet || 16 ||

dīkṣāśikṣāvibhedena guruḥ syādvividhaḥ priye |
śikṣāguruṃ na kurvīta paśubhāvayuto yadi || 17 ||

paśubhāvayutā nārī patiṃ patyurna kalpayet |
tathā guruṃ paśurdevi gurorandhraṃ na kalpayet (gh: kārayet) || 18 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
navamollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[daśamollāsaḥ] |

gurutantre gurulakṣaṇam |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa namāmi caraṇāmbuje |
nānācārayuto loko vada kena bhaviṣyati || 1 ||

kena rūpeṇa deveśa paśvācāraṃ prajāyate |
vīraṃ divyañca kaulañca siddhāntaṃ kena tadvada || 2 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

guruśca parameśāni yadācārī bhavenmudā |
tadācārayuto mantrī bhaviṣyati yuge yuge || 3 ||

niruttare (-)

paśu(-)gurorlabdhamantrī (gh: mantralabdhaḥ) paśureva na saṃśayaḥ |
vīramukhānmantralabdho vīra eva na saṃśayaḥ || 4 ||

siddhāntānmantrasaṃlabdhaḥ siddhānto nātra saṃśayaḥ |
paśvācāraṃ vinā devi pañcatatvaṃ yutaṃ (gh: pañcatattvayutaṃ) 
śubham || 5 ||

paśvācārastu vijñeyaḥ pañcatattveṣu (gh: paratattveṣu) nindakaḥ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena paśordīkṣāṃ na kalpayet || 6 ||

pañcatattvaṃ vinā devi śaktimantraṃ vṛthā bhavet |
ata eva paśordīkṣāṃ vīrabhāvī na cācaret || 7 ||

paśūnāñced guruḥ śākto vīrāṇā`ncedguruḥ paśuḥ |
yathā vṛddhasya taruṇī (gh: ramaṇī) vṛddhāyāḥ kaiśaraḥ (?) (c: 
śaiśavaḥ) patiḥ || 8 ||

<p. 33> nigama kalpadrume (-)

na rūpamasyāpi na bhāvabhāvinī, rūpasya bhāvasya 
sadātmabhāvinaḥ |
yathā jalaṃ dravyaguṇena śaṅkara (!) nānāvivarṇaṃ hi guruśca 
lakṣaṇam || 9 ||

atha śāktagurupraśaṃsā |

kaulikānmantraṃ saṃgṛhya japakarmacaran hara |
yadi muktirna jāyeta tadā vākyaṃ vṛthā mama || 10 ||

paśordīkṣāṃ na kurvīta kuladharmaparāyaṇaḥ |
paśordarśanamātreṇa kaulikānāṃ kriyākṣayaḥ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena paśordīkṣāṃ vivarjayet || 11 ||

bhairavatantre (-)

sabhāvānāṃ vibhāvānāṃ paśūnāṃ parameśvari |
vīrabhāvānvito mantrī paśordīkṣāṃ vivarjayet || 12 ||

sabhāvānāṃ vibhāvānāṃ vīro dīkṣāṃ karotyapi |
kulanāthaṃ samāśritya punardīkṣāṃ samācaret || 13 ||

sabhāve dīkṣite mantre rogaśokabhayānakaḥ |
vibhāve dīkṣite mantre kevalo bhayamātrakaḥ || 14 ||

kulācārarato vipraḥ kulaśāstrārthatattvavit |
tanmukhāt śravaṇānmantraḥ sarvasiddhiprado bhavet |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena kulīnaṃ gurumāśrayet || 15 ||

atha gurulakṣaṇamāha (-)


sthūlastejastathā sūkṣmastridhāmātraṃ guruḥ śive |
tridhaikaṃ cintayed yastu bhāvātītaṃ guruṃ priye || 16 ||

<p. 34> kadācit sa sahasrāre mantradhyeyo guruḥ sadā |
kadācit hṛdayāmbhoje (g: -mbuje) kadācid dṛṣṭigocare || 17 ||

sūkṣmadhyānaṃ sahasrāre tejo dhyānaṃ hṛdi priye |
sthūladhyānaṃ bāhyadeśe trividha dhyānajaṃ phalam || 18 ||

atha śrīguroḥ sūkṣmadhyānam |

gurugītāyāṃ (-)

brahmānandaṃ paramasukhadaṃ kevalaṃ jñānamūrtim |
dvandvātītaṃ gaganasadṛśaṃ tattvamasyādilakṣyam || 19 ||

ekaṃ nityaṃ vimalamacalaṃ sarvadā sākṣibhūtam |
bhāvātītaṃ triguṇarahitaṃ sadguruṃ taṃ namāmi || 20 ||

nityaṃ śūddhaṃ nirābhāsaṃ nirvikāraṃ nirañjanam |
nityabodhaṃ cidānandaṃ guruṃ brahma namāmyaham || 21 ||


atha śrīgurostejodhyānam |

hṛdambuje (gh: hṛdyambuje) karṇikamadhāsaṃsthaṃ, 
siṃhāsanesaṃsthitadivyamūrtim |
dhyāyed guruṃ candrakalāvataṃsaṃ, saccit sukhābhīṣṭa 
varapradānam || 22 ||

śvetāmbaraṃ śvetavilepayuktaṃ muktākalābhūṣitadivyamūrtim |
vāmāṅga (g: vāmāṅka) pīṭhesthitadivyaśaktiṃ mandasmitaṃ 
pūrṇakṛpānidhānam || 23 ||

ānandamānandakaraṃ prasannaṃ jñānasvarūpaṃ nijabodhayuktam |
yogīndramīḍyaṃ bhavarogvaidyaṃ, śrīmadguruṃ nityamahaṃ 
namāmi || 24 ||

atha śrīguroḥ sthūladhyānam |

yadājñayā sthūlatejaḥ sūkṣmāṇi parameśvari |
tridhā dhyāne dhyānaniṣṭhaḥ sa guruḥ sthūlarūpakaḥ || 25 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvāllāse
daśamollāsaḥ] |




[ekādaśollāsaḥ] |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

tvadīyakṛpayā deva dhyānaṃ hi trividhaṃ śrutam |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi sadgurorlakṣaṇaṃ priya || 1 ||

atha sadgurulakṣaṇam |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tridhāmātraṃ gurordhyānaṃ tridhāpi sanmaheśvari |
sahasrāre hṛdmbhoje bāhye'pi parameśvari || 2 ||

sthūle tejasi sūkṣme'pi satśabdaṃ viniyojitam |
sacchandaṃ ca vinā bhadre guruśabdaṃ nacet kvacit || 3 ||

sadguruḥ parameśāni śuddhaveśamanoharaḥ |
sarvalakṣaṇasampūrṇaḥ sarvāvayava(-)śobhitaḥ || 4 ||

sarvāgamārthatattvajñaḥ sarvaśāstraviśāradaḥ |
loke sammohanakaro devatābhāvadarśakaḥ || 5 ||

ityādi lakṣaṇopetaḥ sadguruḥ kathitaḥ priye |
guruśca parameśāni kevalaḥ śreṣṭhabodhakaḥ |
śreṣṭhātiśreṣṭhaṃ sacchabdaṃ sauvarṇa kuṇḍalaṃ yathā || 6 ||

niruttare (-)

bhāvastu trividho devi divya(-)vīra(-)paśu(-)kramāt |
guravaśca tridhā proktāstathaiva mantradevatāḥ || 7 ||

kulaśāstraratā devi guravo vahavaḥ smṛtāḥ |
kulatattva(-)vihitajño gurureko hi durlabhaḥ || 8 ||

<p. 36> vāmakeśvare (-)

trividhācārasaṃyuktā guravo'pi hyanantakāḥ |
bhāvayuktaṃ varārohe bhāgyena labhate'pi ca || 9 ||

bhāgyena parameśāni sadguruṃ labhate yadi |
kuladīkṣāṃ tadā kuryād dṛṣṭvā śrutvā na kārayet || 10 ||

kulārṇave (-)

pustake likhitaṃ dṛṣṭvā kulācāraṃ karoti yaḥ |
nāśayanti kulaṃ tasya saṃkruddhā yoginīgaṇāḥ || 11 ||

guruṃ jñātvā bhāvayuktaścaredācārasammataḥ |
sveṣṭavidyā bhavet siddhirdehasya (gh: dehānāṃ) dehinaṃ yathā || 12 
||

dṛṣṭvācāraṃ na bhāvākto na guruñca kulañcaret |
vṛthācāro bhavettasya na vandhaṃ jalasecanam || 13 ||

guruṃ vinā maheśāni phalabhāg jāyate yadi |
kāntaṃ vinā puttravatī tadā kāntā bhaviṣyati || 14 ||

ata eva guruṃ kuryād yathābhāvavidhānataḥ |
tanmukhāt śravaṇāt kārye phalabhāg jāyate naraḥ || 15 ||

gurūpadiṣṭavidhinā kaulācāraparo naraḥ |
saṃpūjā paramāṃ devīṃ sa yāti paramāṃ gatim || 16 ||

guptasādhanatantre (-)

trayodaśa(-)guṇopeto gurureko hi durlabhaḥ |
teṣāṃ madhye guṇaikākto durlabho gururīśvari || 17 ||

trayodaśaguṇāsakto guruḥ sākṣāt sadāśivaḥ |
darśanāt mucyate pāpāt kriyāpi suphalā bhavet || 18 ||

<p. 37> śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kuleśa prāṇanātheśa lakṣaṇaṃ hi trayodaśam |
kathayasva mama sthāne yadi te mayyanugrahaḥ || 19 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

śānto dāntaḥ kulīnaśca vinītaḥ śuddhaveśavān |
śuddhācāraḥ supratiṣṭhaḥ śucirdakṣaḥ subuddhimān || 20 ||

āśramī dhyānaniṣṭhaśca mantratantraviśāradaḥ |
nigrahānugrahe śakto gururityavadhīyate || 21 ||

atha śāntaḥ |

yena kenāpi santuṣṭaḥ kriyāyāñca sudakṣakaḥ |
sa śānto hi hṛṣṭamanāḥ sarvadā deva(-)tatparaḥ || 22 ||

atha dāntaḥ |

bhaktābhakte jñānavākyaṃ sānandena prayacchati |
dayāyukto rāgamukto dānteti gurulakṣaṇam || 23 ||

atha kulīnaḥ |

kulācārī kulajñānī kulatattvapradāyakaḥ |
kulāgāre kriyāyuktaḥ (gh: -śakto) kulīno gururīśvari || 24 ||

atha vinītaḥ |

dayāvākyena deveśi jñānavākyaṃ muhurmuhuḥ |
abhaktabhaktijanako vinīto gurulakṣaṇam || 25 ||

<p. 38> atha śuddhaveśaḥ |

bhūṣaṇaṃ yasya devasya dhārayettasya bhūṣaṇam |
tadācārarato devi guruḥ syāt śuddhaveśavān || 26 ||

atha śuddhācāraḥ |

ācāraṃ yasya devasya tadācārī bhaved yadi |
stutinindāvinirmuktaḥ śuddhācāro guruḥ svayam || 27 ||

atha supratiṣṭhaḥ |

devatā śuddhabhāvena śuddhajñānena sevitā |
supratiṣṭho gururdevi sarvadānandapālakaḥ (gh: 
sarvānandapradāyakaḥ) || 28 ||

atha śucirdakṣaḥ |

anācārācārayukto nāsti tīrtheṣu vāsanā |
śucirdakṣo gururdevi sarvakāryeṣu dakṣakaḥ || 29 ||

atha subuddhimān |

jīvātmā parameśāni paramātmani līyate |
subuddhimān gururdevi so'haṃ jñānaṃ vinaśyati || 30 ||

athāśramī |

puttradārādisambandhaṃ sarvabhiṣṭasvarūpakam |
tasminnānandamāśritya āśramī gururīśvari || 31 ||

atha dhyānaniṣṭhaḥ |

trividhaṃ dhyānamāśritya ātmānaṃ pūjayed yadi |
sa guruḥ parameśāni dhyānaniṣṭho bhaved dhruvam || 32 ||

<p. 39> atha mantratantraviśāradaḥ |

mānasaṃ trāyate yastu manaḥ sandehanāśakṛt |
sa guruḥ parameśāni mantratantraviśāradaḥ || 33 ||

atha nigrahānugrahe śaktaḥ |

muktasya bandhadātṛtvaṃ bandhasya muktadāyakaḥ |
nigrahānugrahe śakto gururityavadhīyate || 34 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanātha(-)viracite sarvollāse
ekādaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[dvādaśollāsaḥ] |

atha vaiṣṇavācāraḥ |

sarvadharmān parityajā iṣṭabhaktiśca jāyate |
sa eva vaiṣṇavācāraḥ kāmasaṅkalpavarjitaḥ || 1 ||

samayācāratante (-)

vaiṣṇavaḥ paśubhāvena pūjayet parameśvaram |
śaktitantre varārohe paśubhāvo bhayaṅkaraḥ || 2 ||

paśubhāve yajeddevaṃ bhaktibhāvayutaḥ śive |
yadi syāt pūjayeddevīṃ vṛthā tasya pariśramaḥ || 2 ||

paśubhāve maheśāni mantravarṇasvarūpakam |
vīrabhāve'pi tanmantraṃ caturvargaphalapradam || 4 ||

paśubhāvāśrito mantrī yadi kālīṃ prapūjayet |
rauravaṃ narakaṃ yāti yāvadāhūtasaṃplavam || 5 ||

atha paśūnāṃ śaktyarcane niṣedhaḥ |

kulārṇave (-)

māṃsaṃ bhuktā surāṃ pītvā gatvā caiva rajasvalām |
pūjayet kālikāṃ devīmanyathā niṣphalā bhavet || 6 ||

abhuktā na yajeddevīṃ bhuktā devīṃ prapūjayet |
abhuktaḥ pūjanenaiva viṣṭhāyāṃ jāyate krimiḥ || 7 ||

jitendriyo haviṣyāśī śaktipūjāṃ na cācaret |
anyārcane mahādevi ceti bhāvena pūjayet || 8 ||

<p. 41> anyadevārcanaśraddhāmanyadevaprapūjanam |
kulastrīvīranindāñca paradravyāpahāraṇam |
strīṣu roṣaṃ prahārañca (k, g: nakartavyaṃ) varjayet parameśvari || 9 
||

picchilāyāṃ (-)

gurorājñāṃ samādāya śuddhāntaḥkaraṇo naraḥ |
sveṣṭadevaṃ stuvan bhāvyamanyadevaṃ na pūjayet || 10 ||

tīrtha(-)paryaṭanaṃ deva(-)pūjanaṃ tarpaṇādikam |
varjayet parameśāni guroranyaṃ na bhāvayet || 11 ||

atha vaiṣṇavasya samādhiḥ |

anyadevaṃ sveṣṭarūpaṃ rūpaṃ jñātvā kriyāñcaret |
darpaṇeṣu yathā bimbaṃ tathānyadevarūpakam || 12 ||

ekadevaṃ vinā devi nāsti devo mahītale |
ekasūryaṃ vinā sūryo nāstīha jagati yathā || 13 ||

bahupātre sthite toye bahusūrye yathā priye |
bahubhāve tathā devaṃ bahurūpeṣu dṛśyate || 14 ||

nigamatattve (-)

dharmasvarūpaṃ jagatāṃ sarvabījaṃ purātanam |
dharmaṃ tyaktvā mahādevi kimālambitamāsthitaḥ || 15 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

sarvadharmān parityajya ekadharmaṃ samāśrayan 
dharmātmano devatātma(-)svātmanoḥ paricintanam || 16 ||

sveṣṭavidyā dharmarūpā nityā svātmaprakāśinī |
yathā stanaṃ bālakasya pānaṃ dharmātmavarddhanam || 17 ||


[iti sarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
dvādaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[trayodasollāsaḥ] |

atha iṣṭabhaktiḥ |

nigamatattve śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tvaṃ devi paramā pūrṇā sarvasampatphalapradā |
kimiṣṭaṃ kāpi bhaktiḥ syāt mama sthāne prakāśaya || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

guruvaktre sthito devastadeveṣṭasvarūpakaḥ |
kriyāpi tasya vākye syāt kriyeti bhaktikalpanā || 2 ||

yā kriyā sāpi bhaktiḥ syād yā bhaktiḥ sā kriyāpi ca |
bhaktirūpā sveṣṭavidyā vinā bhaktiṃ na labhyate || 3 ||

vinā bhaktiṃ na tajjñānamato bhaktirudāhṛtā |
sā bhaktistrividhā deva cottamā madhyamādhamā || 4 ||

uttamā sāttvikī bhaktī rājasī bhaktirmadhyamā |
tāmasī bhaktiradhamā tridhā bhaktirmaheśvara || 5 ||

mānasī sāttvikī bhaktirvāhyabhaktiśca rājasī |
tāmasī dāmbhikī bhaktistāsāṃ bhedaṃ vadamyaham (k, g: teṣāṃ 
bhedamidaṃ śiva) || 6 ||

samayācāratantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa lokānāṃ hitakāraka |
bhāvabhedena kathaya sādhakasyāpi lakṣaṇam || 7 ||

<p. 43> śrīśiva uvāca (-)

sādhakā strividhāḥ proktāḥ sāttviko rājasaḥ priye |
tāmasaśca maheśāni teṣāṃ vakṣyāmi lakṣaṇam || 8 ||

atha sāttvika(-)sādhakalakṣaṇam |

antaḥśuddho vahiḥśuddhaḥ sadeśvara(-)parāyaṇaḥ |
sarveṣāṃ prāṇināṃ devi dayāyuktaḥ sa sāttvikaḥ |
sa sāttviko maheśāni sarvadā devatatparaḥ || 9 ||

atha rājasika(-)sādhakalakṣaṇam |

śraddhayātisuvastrādyairātmānaṃ devatāṃ yajet |
rāgeṇa sarvadā tuṣṭo rājasaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
sa rājaso maheśāni rāgātmā rāgakāṅkṣaṇaḥ || 10 ||

atha tāmasa(-)sādhakalakṣaṇam |

bahukrodhī jalpabhāṣī paradveṣī pravañcakaḥ |
aśraddhayā yajeddevaṃ tāmasaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 11 ||

kuveśaṃ devatāṃ kṛtvā śraddhayā'śraddhayā yajet |
kriyāyāṃ dakṣiṇāhīnaḥ so'pi tāmasalakṣaṇaḥ || 12 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kena rūpeṇa deveśa sādhako muktabhāg bhavet |
kathaya prāṇanātheśa yadi te mayyanugrahaḥ || 13 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

pūjāmūlāpi bhaktiḥ syād vinā pūjāṃ na bhaktibhāk |
sā pūjā trividhā proktā cottamā madhyamādhamā || 14 ||

<p. 44> sāttvikī trividhā pūjā rājasī trividhā śive |
tāmasī trividhā pūjā tāsāṃ bhedaṃ vadāmyaham || 15 ||

atha trividhasāttvikīpūjālakṣaṇam |

ahameva parā devī mayi sarvamidaṃ jagat |
sā pūjā sāttvikī jñeyā pūjāmadhyeṣu gopitā || 16 ||

devatanijarūpaṃ yat mānasaiścintayed hṛdi |
sā pūjā sāttvikī jñeyā madhyamā prāṇavallabhe (gh: kathitaṃ) || 
17 ||

mānasaiḥ pūjayeddevīṃ śraddhayā copacārakaiḥ |
sā pūja sāttvikī jñeyā cādhamā prāṇavallabhe || 18 ||

atha trividharājasīpūjālakṣaṇam |

ātmavat pūjayeddevīṃ śraddhayā copacārakaiḥ |
kāmasaṅkalparahitā pūjā rājasikottamā || 19 ||

upacārairyajeddevīṃ kevalaṃ prītihetave |
devyāḥ sā rājasī pūjā madhyamā prāṇavallabhe || 20 ||

ātmārthe vā parārthe vā śraddhayā pūjayet śivām |
kāmasaṅkalpasaṃyuktā pūjā rājasikādhamā || 21 ||

atha trividhatāmasīpūjālakṣaṇam |

ātmano'pi parasyāpi dāmbhikārthe yajet śivām |
śraddhānvitā kāmayuktā sā pūjā tāmasottamā || 22 ||

laukikārthe dāmbhikārthe saṅkalpena yajet śivām |
sā pūjā tāmasī jñeyā madhyamā prāṇavallabhe || 23 ||

<p. 45> svalābhāt parahiṃsārthe śraddhayā pūjayet śivām |
sā pūjā tāmasī jñeyā cādhamā prāṇavallabhe || 24 ||

śraddhāhīnā ca yā pūjā sā pūjā na phalapradā |
pūjāmūlā bhavedbhaktirbhaktimūlaṃ hi pūjanam |
parasparaṃ vinā na syāt jñānaṃ jñeyaṃ yathā priye || 25 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
trayodaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[caturdaśollāsaḥ]

atha balidānam |

jñānārṇave śrīdevyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva lokānāṃ jñānadāyaka |
bhāvabhedena kathaya balidānasya lakṣaṇam || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kaliśca trividhā devi sātvikī rājasī tamī |
balidānaṃ vinā devi pūjane nāsti yogyatā || 2 ||

pūjāsāraṃ mahādevi balidānaṃ yathāvidham |
balidānaṃ bhavet sāraṃ pūjane jñānvān yadi || 3 ||

ata eva mahādevi baliṃ dadyāt prayatnataḥ |
balidānaṃ vidhānena kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale || 4 ||

atha sātvikī baliḥ |

sātvikībalimākhyātāṃ māṃsaraktādivarjitām |
yato brahmamayaṃ dehaṃ ghātayet kena karmaṇā || 5 ||

satsattvaṃ sṛṣṭimātraṃ hi bhāvamātraṃ prakāśitam |
sattvevārambhakaṃ sṛṣṭiṃ balidānaṃ layaṃ śive || 6 ||

ata eva maheśāni sattvena balidānakam |
māṃsaraktādirahitaṃ balidānaṃ phalaṃ śubham || 7 ||

narāśvamedhaṃ madyañca kalau varjyaṃ dvijātibhiḥ (gh: 
vicakṣaṇaiḥ) |
prānihiṃsā nacet satye tretāyāṃ dvāpare śubham || 8 ||

<p. 47> narāśvamedhaṃ saṃvarjyaṃ kalau na jñānavāna yataḥ |
narānukalpaṃ mahiṣaṃ mahiṣasya ca chāgalam || 9 ||

chāgasya kalpanaṃ meṣaṃ meṣasya pakṣiṇaṃ śive |
pakṣiṇaścāpi (k, g, gh, ṅ: pakṣiṇasyāpi) matsyaṃ hi matsyasya 
kīṭamātrakam || 10 ||

anukalpaṃ kalau bhadre dravyābhāve parityajet || 11 ||

arcane mahiṣadāne'pi cāśvamedhaphalaṃ labhet |
phalbhāg jāyate mantrī baliṃ dadyād yathāvidhi |
balidānaṃ vinā devi hiṃsā sarvatra garhitā || 12 ||

tantracūḍāmaṇau (-)

eṇamapyavidhānena chedayenna kadācana |
vidhināpi dvijaṃ gāmbā hatvā pāpairna lipyate || 13 ||

tathāpi parameśāni jñānī naivāpi lubdhakaḥ |
balimātraṃ dvidhā jñeyaṃ tayorbhedaṃ śṛṇuṣva me || 14 ||

baliḥ pūjopahāraḥ syāt prāṇidānaṃ dvitīyakam |
balimādyaṃ nivṛtte tu pravṛttiḥ syāt paśuṃ priye |
balihīnā ca yā pūjā sā pūjā na phalapradā || 15 ||

atha rājsikabaliḥ |

rājasaṃ balimākhyātaṃ suveśaṃ rāgasaṃyutam |
māṃsaraktādisaṃyuktaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ viśeṣataḥ || 16 ||

kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ nādhikāṅgabhaṅgahīnamarogiṇam |
evaṃ datvā baliṃ pūrṇaṃ phalamāpnoti sādhakaḥ || 17 ||

śiśunā balidānena hanti putrañca caṇḍikā |
vṛddhenaiva gurujanaṃ (gh: guruṃ hanyāt) kṛśena bāndhavaṃ tathā 
|| 18 ||

<p. 48> dhanañcaivādhikāṅgena hīnāṅgena prajāntathā |
kāminīṃ śṛṅgabhaṅgena kāṇena bhrātaraṃ tathā || 19 ||

ghaṇṭikena bhavenmṛtyurvighnañca (gh: vighnasyāt) citramastake |
hataṃ mitraṃ tāmrapṛṣṭhe bhraṣṭaśrīḥ pucchahīnataḥ || 20 ||

muṇḍamālātantre (-)

māturmāyāśrito yāvattavacchiśumudāhṛtam (gh: śiśurudāhṛtaḥ) |
tasyāpi ghātane bhadre svātmaputtraṃ vinaśyati || 21 ||

nirvikāramayaṃ dehaṃ kadācinnaiva ghātayet |
vikāre śukra(-)sambhūte (sañjāte) ghātanaṃ vidhibodhitam (gh: -
bodhanam) |
śukralīne (gh: hīne)'pi vṛddhaṃ hi ghātanād gurughātanam || 22 ||

atha tāmasikabaliḥ |

tāmasastāmasaguṇairālasyādiyutaḥ priye |
na śraddhayā baliṃ dadyāt pūjādiṣu tathā priye || 23 |

sādhakānāṃ na te devi kevalaṃ nāmamātrakam |
balidānaṃ vṛthā tasya kevalaṃ prāṇi (gh: paśu-)ghātanam || 24 ||

tāmasaḥ sādhako devi kadācinnaiva naiva ca |
pūjāhīnasya bhraṣṭatvāt nāmamātrastu sādhakaḥ || 25 ||

balidānaṃ pradātavyaṃ yena tena kṛtena ca (gh: kena krameṇa ca) |
vidhānaṃ naiva kartavyaṃ balidānaṃ hi mātrakam || 26 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
caturdaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[pañcadaśollāsaḥ] |

vaiṣṇavo viṣṇubhaktañca viṣṇvātmātmā yadā bhavet |
tadā dhyānaṃ sadā kāryaṃ vaiṣṇavīṃ paramāṃ śivām || 1 ||

paśvācārasya yat śeṣaṃ śāktācārasya pūrvakam |
śaivācāramidaṃ proktaṃ paśvācāreṇa pūjayet || 2 ||

prasādaṃ cyambakādiñca tāntrikaṃ hi maheśvari |
vīrācāreṇa saṃpūjyaṃ pañcatattvena śaṅkari || 3 ||


atha śaivācaraḥ |


samayācāratantre (-)

aṣṭāṅgayogasaṃyukto yajeddevaṃ vidhānataḥ |
yāvajjñānaṃ (gh: dhyānaṃ) samādhiḥ syāttāvat śaivaṃ 
pracakṣate || 4 ||

athāṣṭāṅgayogaḥ |

kālikākulasarasve (-)

yamaniyamāsanaprāṇāyāmapratyāhāradhyānadhāraṇasamādhi(-)
yogāṅgāṣṭāni pārvati || 5 ||

ādau yamalakṣaṇam |

ahiṃsā satyamasteyaṃ brahmacaryaṃ dayārjavam |
kṣamādhṛtiṃ (gh: prīti) mitāhāraṃ śaucañceti yamā daśa |
daśadhā lakṣaṇaṃ proktaṃ yogāṅgasya yamasya ca || 6 ||

<p. 50> atha niyamalakṣaṇam |

tapaḥ santoṣamāstikyaṃ dānaṃ devasya pūjanam |
siddhāntaśravaṇañcaiva hrīrmatiśca japāhutam |
daśadhā niyamaṃ proktaṃ yogāṅgasya ca pārvati || 7 ||

athāsanam |

1 | padmāsanaṃ svastikākhyaṃ bhadraṃ vajrāsanaṃ tathā |
vīrāsanamiti proktaṃ kramādāsanapañcakam || 8 ||

savyaṃ pādamupādāya dakṣorūpari vinyaset (gh: dakṣopari(-)
nyasettataḥ) |
tathaiva dakṣiṇaṃ savye copaviṣṭaṃ (gh: copaviśyaṃ) vidhānataḥ |
padmāsanamiti proktaṃ japapūjādiṣu priye || 9 ||

2 | jānubhyāmantare samyak kṛtvā pādatale ubhe (gh: śubhai) |
ṛjukāyo viśenmantrī svastikaṃ tat pracakṣate || 10 ||

sīmanyāḥ pārśvayornyasyād gulpayugmaṃ suniścitam |
vṛṣaṇādhaḥ sthitau pādau pāṇibhyāṃ parirakṣayet |
bhadrāsanamidaṃ proktaṃ yogibhiḥ parikalpitam (g, gh: sārakalpitaṃ) 
|| 11 ||

urau pādau krame nyasya kṛtvā pratyaṃmukhāṃgulīm |
karau nirudhyā(gh: nidadhyāt)dākhyātaṃ vajrāsanamudīritam || 12 ||

ekapādamadhaḥ kṛtvā vinyasyorau tathetaram |
ṛjukāyo viśenmantrī vīrāsanamudīritam || 13 ||

atha prāṇāyāmaḥ |

prāṇāyāmaṃ vinā devi pūjane nāsti yogyatā |
prāṇāyāmañcāsanañca sarvācārasya sammatam || 14 ||

<p. 51> tripurāsāratante (-)

mūlādhāre kuṇḍalinī svayambhū nidritā yadā |
tadā kāryaṃ na kartavyaṃ kriyāmātre hi sundari || 15 ||

prāṇāyāmena sā devī sa devaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
nidrāṃ tyaktvā sveṣṭarūpaṃ dhārayet parameśvari || 16 ||


atha prāṇāyāmasya phalam |

mūlabījena bījena prāṇāyāmaṃ samācaret |
prāṇāyāmaṃ hi kathanaṃ devatāyāḥ svarūpakam || 17 ||

svarūpakathane deva svarūpaṃ darśanaṃ śive |
svarūpadarśanāt śīghraṃ svarūpañca svayaṃ bhavet || 18 ||

pramāṇāntaramāha gurugītāyām (-)

kīṭabhṛṅge varārohe yathā bhavati pārvati |
gurudhyānāttathā nityaṃ dehī brahmamayo bhavet || 19 ||

tripurāsāre (-)

prāṇāyāmaparo brahmā prāṇāyāmaparo hariḥ |
prāṇāyāmaḥ śaṅkaro'pi sṛṣṭisthitilayātmakaḥ || 20 ||

pūrako'pi bhavedbrahmā kumbhako'pi hariḥ svayam |
recako'pi svayaṃ rudraḥ prāṇāyāmaṃ guṇatrayam || 21 ||

kaniṣṭhānāmikāṃguṣṭhairyannāsāpuṭadhāraṇam |
prāṇāyāmaḥ sa vijñeyastarjanīmadhyame vinā || 22 ||

pūrakaṃ vāmanāḍyāpi ṣoḍaśena japena tu |
kumbhakaṃ madhyanāḍyāpi catuḥṣaṣṭyā japena tu |
recanaṃ dakṣanāḍyāpi tadarddhajapasaṃkhyayā || 23 ||

<p. 52> tantrāntare (-)

pūrayet ṣoḍaśairvāyuṃ dhārayettaccaturguṇaiḥ (kh: dhārayettu 
catuguṇaiḥ; gh: kumbhayecca caturguṇaiḥ) |
recayet kumbhakārddhena aśaktyā (gh: yaḥ śaktyā) tatturīyakam || 24 
||

kumbhakaṃ pūrakaṃ recamevaṃ (tadaśaktau taccatuśrameva (ga, 
gha)|) prāṇasya saṃyamaḥ |
iḍāyāṃ pūrayedvāyuṃ dhārayeddakṣanāsikām || 25 ||

suṣumnāyāṃ kumbhayecca nāsāpuṭañca dhāraṇam |
piṅgalāyāṃ recayecca dhāraṇād vāmanāsikām || 26 ||

niruttare (-)

prāṇāyāmaṃ dviṣaṭkena pratyāhāraḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
pratyahāradviṣṭkena jānīyāddharaṇaṃ śubham || 27 ||

dhāraṇaṃ dvādaśaṃ proktaṃ dhyānaṃ dhyānaviśāradaḥ |
dhyānairdvādaśakaireva samādhirabhidhīyate |
samādhimatha (gh: samādheratha) karmāṇi karoti na karoti vā || 28 ||

kevalaṃ kumbhakāddevi (gh: kumbhakāddha'pi) kiṃ na sidhyati 
bhūtale |
khecaratvaṃ samādhitvaṃ kāle mṛtyurvinaśyati || 29 ||

tripurāsāre samādhiḥ |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa sadā tattvapradāyakaḥ |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi samādhisthasya lakṣaṇam || 30 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

śaivo'pi śivabhaktaśca śivātmātmā yadā bhavet |
tadā dhyānaṃ sadā kāryaṃ śivaṃ śāntaṃ jaganmayam || 31 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
pañcadaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[ṣoḍaśollāsaḥ] |

atha vibhāvapaśulakṣaṇam |

anukalpairyajeddevīṃ vedamārgeṇa sādhakaḥ |
paśvācāramidaṃ proktaṃ vibhāvasya mataṃ śive (gh: priye) || 1 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau |

atha madyānukalpam |

gokṣīraṃ vahninā pācyaṃ karjurasya rasaṃ priye |
guḍaṃ tasya madyatulyaṃ tāmbūlaṃ cūrṇasaṃyutam || 2 ||

vyañjanaṃ lavaṇairyuktaṃ āmānnaṃ ghṛtasaṃyutam |
kharjurasya rasañcaiva (ṅ: guḍhaṃ) śarkaraṃ gavyasaṃyutam (gh, ṅ: 
parameśvari) |
mahoṣodbhavaṃ madyatulyaṃ vibhāvasya mataṃ paśoḥ (gh, ṅ: 
lavaṇaṃ saindhavaṃ vinā) || 3 ||

atha māṃsānukalpam |

godhūmaṃ lohitaṃ cārdraṃ tilaṃ śvetaṃ maheśvari |
śaratpkvaṃ vrīhiṇañca lohitaṃ vrīhiṇaṃ śive |
(gh: madyatulyaṃ māṃsakhaṇḍaṃ kuṣmāṇḍaṃ parikīrtitam) 
kuṣmāṇḍaṃ māṃsavajjñeyaṃ vibhāvasya mataṃ paśoḥ (g: śive) 
|| 4 ||

atha matsyānukalpam |

nārikelaṃ śrīphalañca dhātrīphala(-)harītakīm |
dagdhañcet parameśāni paśormatsyaṃ hi kalpanam || 5 ||

<p. 55> mudrānukalpam |

vinā lavaṇatoyābhyāṃ bharjitaṃ vrīhiṇaṃ śive |
mudrānukalpaṃ parame vibhāvasya mataṃ paśoḥ || 6 ||

atha maithunānukalpam | (atra (gha) (-)pustakīyaḥ pāṭhaḥ, (-)
paśūnāṃ maithunaṃ devi svakare yntrakalpanam |
tattvamuddhṛtya yatnena vinā parvādinā śubham ||
bhakṣayet tatparaṃ dravyaṃ mūlena manunā śive |
pañcatattvaṃ vinā devi devīmantraṃ vṛthā bhavet ||
etaddravyaṃ na devaṃ hi na peyaṃ hi kvacit śive |
vedoktena yajeddevaṃ vibhāvasya mataṃ paśoḥ ||)

paśūnāṃ maithunaṃ nāsti cintanaṃ parikalpitam |
sahasrāre mahāpadme śivaśaktisamanvitam || 7 ||

tenāmṛtena parame tarpayet paradevatām |
yatstuṣṭā bhagavatī svātmabimbaprakāśinī || 8 ||

pañcatattvaṃ vinā devi devīpūjā vṛthā bhavet |
vedoktena yajeddevaṃ vibhāvasya mataṃ paśoḥ || 9 ||

atha vibhāvavīralakṣaṇam |

picchilāyāṃ śrīdevyuvāca (-)

mahādeva mahāyogin tattvajñānamayaṃ vapuḥ |
vīrācāraṃ vibhāvasya mama sthāne prakāśaya (g, gh: vada prabho) || 
10 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

vīrācārasya kathane śaṅkābhūnmama mānase |
kadācinnaiva vaktavyaṃ pāṣaṇḍe nāstike nare || 11 ||

<p. 56> mamaiva prāṇasarvasvaṃ vīrabhāvaṃ kuleśvari (gh: 
maheśvari) |
vīrabhāvaṃ vinā devi devīpūjā vṛthā bhavet || 12 ||

atha vibhāvavīraḥ |

na karoti mahādevi prakṛtyacārasaṃśayāt |
mānasaikavibhāvena pañcatattvena pūjayet || 13 ||

athavā cānukalpairvā pūjayet parameśvarīm |
anukalpairyajeddevīṃ tantramārgānusārataḥ |
vīrācāramidaṃ proktaṃ vibhāvasya mataṃ śive (ṅ: śāktānāṃ 
sukhamokṣadam) || 14 ||

mānasaiḥ pañcatattvaiśca pūjāṃ kuryācca mānasaiḥ |
pañcatattvasyānukalpairvāhye devīṃ prapūjayet || 15 ||

atha pañcatattvapramāṇam |

vīratantre (-)

madyaṃ māṃsa tathā matsyaṃ mudrā maithunameva ca |
pañcatattvamidaṃ proktaṃ śāktanāṃ sukhamokṣadam || 16 ||

atha madyānukalpam |

picchilāyāṃ (-)

nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsye takraṃ guḍasamanvitam |
ārdrakaṃ guḍasaṃyuktaṃ siddhānnaṃ dagdhadugdhakam |
madyānukalpaṃ parame (!) caturvargaphalapradam || 17 ||

niruttare (-)

brāhmaṇo vīrabhāvena surāṃ pītvā japenmanum |
tadabhāve'pi go(-)kṣīraṃ dvijo dadyād yuge yuge || 18 ||

<p. 57> tāmbūlaṃ tāmrakūṭañca tvaritā tāḍitā tathā |
ahipheṇaḥ kharjurasaḥ dhūstūraṃ samvidā tathā |
ete cāṣṭau surāḥ proktāḥ sādhakānandadāyakāḥ || 19 ||

atha māṃsānukalpam |

lavaṇārdrakapinnākastilagodhūmamāsakāḥ |
lasūnañca maheśāni māṃsapratinidhiḥ smṛtaḥ || 20 ||

atha matsyānukalpam |

matsyābhāve dagdhadravyaṃ cānukalpaṃ yuge yuge |
mudrābhāve'pi kṣaṇakaṃ bharjitaṃ parameśvari || 21 ||

iti mudrānukalpam |

atha pañcamānukalpam |

vṛhadyonitantre (-)

sādhakaḥ kulaniṣṭhaśca yadi yoniṃ na pūjayet |
kruddhā bhagavatī tasya niṣphalaṃ japapūjanam || 22 ||

yonyabhāve maheśāni yonirūpāparājitā |
pūjayet sādhakaḥ śreṣṭho yonipūjāphalāptaye || 23 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

yoniḥ proktāḥ purā deva sarvasya sukhamokṣadā |
tasyābhāve kathaṃ deva cānukalpāparājitā || 24 ||

kasmāj jātamidaṃ puṣpaṃ kena vā pūjanaṃ vada |
maithunaṃ kena deveśa tattvaṃ kena vada prabho || 25 ||

vṛhadyonitantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)

śikhipucchāntare yoniṃ saṃsthāpya prakṛtiryadā |
kṛṣṇo'bhūt parameśāni tadā jātāparājitā || 26 ||

<p. 58> śikhipucchād viniḥsṛtya yonirjātā mahītale |
yonicihnaṃ sthitaṃ tatra devi kāmakalātmikam || 27 ||

viṣṇukrāntaṃ samāsādya latārūpo'bhavaddharaḥ |
yonisvarūpaṃ tat puṣpaṃ devyāḥ prītikaraṃ param || 28 ||

tatpuṣpaṃ parameśāni raktacandanacarcitam |
pūjayed vīrabhāvī ca yonipūjāphalaṃ labhet || 29 ||

hayāripuṣpagarbhastha (gh: -garbhamadhyasthaṃ) śivaliṅgena pārvati |
maithunaṃ jāyate tena śaktyābhāve'pi sundari || 30 ||

parapuṣpe kṣiped gandhaṃ tatra puṣpaṃ kṣipet param |
tasmāduddhṛtya tattvañca tarpayet paradevatām || 31 ||

svamūrddhni tarpaṇaṃ kṛtvā pibedānandabhāg yadi |
aparāitāyā māhātmyaṃ gadituṃ naiva śakyate |
mahāpīṭhamayaṃ puṣpaṃ sarvadevasya durlabham || 32 ||

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

svaliṅgaṃ karavīreṣu saṃsthāpya puruṣottamaḥ |
rādhikābhūnmahādevaḥ śṛṅgārānandahetave || 33 ||

prakṛterlakṣaṇaṃ yadyat śikhipucche maheśvari |
ātmayonimimāṃ jñātvā svamūrddhni dhārayeddhariḥ || 34 ||

viśvasāre (-)

śukraraktānukalpam |

śukrai raktairmaheśāni pūjayet parameśvarīm |
tadabhāve cānukalpaiḥ sādhakābhīṣṭasiddhaye (gh: -dāyake) || 35 ||

raktābhāve cānukalpaṃ raktānulepanaṃ priye |
śukrabhāve cānukalpaṃ sugandhaṃ malayodbhavam || 36 ||

<p. 59> cānukalpāt cānukalpaṃ caturvargaphalapradam |
dvayoryogānmaheśāni kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale || 37 ||

mahāpuṣpasyānukalpaṃ kalpaṃ puṣpaṃ manoharam |
lalāṭe dhāraṇād bhadre śivatulyo na saṃśayaḥ || 38 ||

rādhātantre (-)

śaivaḥ śākto gāṇapatyo vaiṣṇavaḥ parameśvari |
puṣpeṇa tilakaṃ bhāle sadeva rūpavān bhavet || 39 ||

pratyakṣaistilakairdevi (!) śivasāyujyameva ca |
anukalpaiśca tilakaiḥ sārūpyameti sundari || 40 ||

atha tilakapramāṇam |

vāmarekhātmikā brahmā dakṣarekhā sadāśivaḥ |
madhyasthāne vasedviṣṇuḥ tatsthānaṃ naiva lepayet || 41 ||

nirvāṇatantre (-)

nirākāro mahāviṣṇuḥ sākāro'pi kṣaṇe kṣaṇe |
yadā sākārarūpo'sau dvibhujo muralīdharaḥ || 42 ||

rādhātantre (-)

nādarūpā kuṇḍalinī tanmūle sthitiḥ sarvadā |
tadūrddhe bindurūpā ca mūlā tripurasundarī || 43 ||

kevalaṃ rudhireṇāpi bindumātraṃ niyojayet |
kuṇḍalī mūlabhāge'pi tilakaṃ triguṇātmakam || 44 ||

savye vāme tathā madhye tilakasya maheśvari |
jāhnavī yamunādevī vāgdevī sarvadā sthitā || 45 ||

tripuṇḍraṃ dhārayet śaivaḥ śāktaśca vartulaṃ śive |
ūrddhapuṇḍraṃ gāṇapatyaḥ sādhakasyāpi lakṣaṇam || 46 ||

<p. 60> jñānadvīpe (-)

prathame cānukalpaiśca pratyakṣaiśca dvitīyake |
evaṃ krameṇa deveśi sādhako'pi kriyāñcaret || 47 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
ṣoḍaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[saptadaśollāsaḥ] |

atha yantrapramāṇam |

varadātantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

tatprasādānmahādeva vibhāvasya mataṃ śrutam |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi yantraprastāvamuttamam || 1 ||

sabhāvasya paśoryantraṃ vibhāvasya paśoḥ priya |
vīrasyāpi vibhāvasya sabhāvasya vada prabho || 2 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

dehākāraṃ sthūlarūpaṃ paśoryantraṃ sureśvari |
kṛtrimaṃ svakṛtaṃ yantraṃ vibhāvasyānukalpanam || 3 ||

vibhāvasyāpi vīrasya yantraṃ puṣpādikalpanam |
vīrasya yantraṃ vijñeyaṃ yoniyantraṃ (g, gh: -rūpaṃ) prakāśitam || 
4 ||

<p. 61> yantraṃ vinā maheśāni pūjane nāsti yogyatā |
ata eva maheśāni kuryāt yantrānukalpanam || 5 ||

yantradvayaṃ na kartavyaṃ tatha mūrtidvayaṃ priye |
ghaṭadvayaṃ na kuryeyuḥ sādhakāḥ siddhihetave || 6 ||

tantrāntare (-)

ekārcane'pyekadevamekavāraṃ prapūjayet |
ekayantraṃ kalpanīyaṃ dvikalpe dvitvapūjanam || 7 ||

mātṛkābhede (-)

janmasthānaṃ mahāyantraṃ yadi kuryāttu sādhakaḥ |
tatra mūrtiṃ na kuryāttu kadācidapi mohataḥ (g, ṅ: mohitaḥ | ataḥ 
paraṃ "ka" pustake pāṭho'yamatirikto dṛśyate (-) yadi mūri 
prakuryāttu tantrayantraṃ na kārayet |") || 8 ||

yadi kuryāttu mohena yajed vāradvayaṃ priye |
dviguṇaṃ balidānaṃ syād dviguṇaṃ pūjanaṃ tataḥ || 9 ||

dviguṇañca japenmantraṃ dviguṇaṃ homamācaret (gh: homayettataḥ) 
|
anyathā viphalā pūjā viphalaṃ balidānakam |
sarvaṃ hi viphalaṃ yasmād yantraṃ tasmānna kārayet || 10 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa paramānanda jñānavijñānadāyaka |
arcane vandane stotre yantrākhyāṃ kathaya prabho || 11 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

ābrahmastambaparyantaṃ kalpanaṃ yantramātrakam |
tava snehena vaktavyaṃ viśeṣasya viśeṣakam || 12 ||

<p. 62> atha viśeṣayantrākhyākathanam |

śālagrāme mano yantre pratimāyāṃ ghaṭe jale |
pustikāyāñca gaṅgāyāṃ śivaliṅge prasūnake || 13 ||

atha yantre pūjāphalam |

śālagrāme śataguṇaṃ manau lakṣaguṇaṃ labhet |
yantre lakṣaguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ mūrtau lakṣaṃ sulocane || 14 ||

ghaṭe caikaguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ jale caikaguṇaṃ priye |
pustikāyāṃ sahasrantu gaṅgāyāṃ tatsamaṃ phalam || 15 ||

śiliṅge hyanantaṃ hi vinā pārthivaliṅgake |
puṣpayantre maheśāni pūjanāt sarvasiddhibhāk || 16 ||

śālagrāme ca pūjāyāṃ na likhed yantramuttamam |
manau sthite maheśāni na likhed yantramuttamam |
pramāyāñca pūjāyāṃ na likhed yantramuttamam || 17 ||

tantrāntare (-)

likhyayantre kṛte bhadre cānyayantraṃ na kalpayet |
yantre kṛte mahādevi likhyayantraṃ na kalpayet || 18 ||

janmasthānaṃ mahāyantraṃ devatāmūrtibhedakam |
ekārcane'pyekayantraṃ yantre'pyekārcanaṃ śubham || 19 ||

jñānadvīpe (-)

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

pūjādhāraṃ mahāyantraṃ parivārān yajettataḥ |
yantrābhāve maheśāna parivārān yajet kutaḥ || 20 ||

<p. 63> śrīśiva uvāca (-)

pratimāyāñca purato ghaṭaṃ saṃsthāpya yatnataḥ |
parivārān yajettatra ghaṭe tu parameśvari || 21 ||

yantrādhiṣṭhātṛdevānāṃ ghaṭavaktre prapūjayet |
samastadevatārūpaṃ ghañca parikalpayet |
suradrumasvarūpo'yaṃ ghaṭo'yaṃ paricintayet || 22 ||

kulārṇave (-)

kevalaṃ pratibimbeṣu ghaṭamātraṃ prakalpayet |
patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ dūrvāṃ toyayuktaṃ ghaṭaṃ nyaset || 23 ||

varadātantre (-)

maṅgalārthaṃ yadā devi ghaṭaṃ hi parikalpayet (g: kalpanañcaret) |
tatra pūjā na kartavyā yantrānukalpanaṃ vinā || 24 ||

atha pratyakṣānukalpayorlakṣaṇam |

nigamānande śrīdevyuvāca (-)

pratyakṣe saṃsthite yantre cānukalpaṃ na kalpayet (gh: kārayet) |
anukalpe sthite yantre pratyakṣañcāpi kalpayet || 25 ||

svayaṃ yatra kriyāśakto nāstyanyatra prakalpanam |
tathā yantre'pi pratyakṣe karaṇīyaṃ parityajet || 26 ||

anukalpe sthite yantre cānukalpaṃ nacet kvacit |
pratyakṣe saṃsthite yantre pratyakṣaṃ naiva kalpayet || 27 ||

<p. 64> śrīśiva uvāca (-)

pratyakṣañcānukalpañca kathayasva maheśvari |
ādyabījamayī nityā (gh: vidyā) tvāṃ vinā ko vadet priye || 28 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

yasmin dravye mahādeva (!) bhramajñānaṃ prajāyate |
taddravyaṃ paramaṃ jñātvā taddravyasyānukalpanam || 29 ||


[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse
saptadaśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||




[aṣṭādaśollāsaḥ] |

atha śāktācāraḥ |

niruttare (-)

śaktiyukto'pi śāktaḥ syāt śaktipūjanatatparaḥ |
śaktidevīṃ vinā devi nānyadevaṃ vicintayet || 1 ||

pañcamena yajet śaktiṃ pañcatattvena pūjayet |
śāktācāramidaṃ jñeyaṃ (j: deva) sarvācārasya sammatam (c, j: ca 
smṛtaḥ) || 2 ||

śāktācāraṃ vinā devi anyācāraṃ śavaṃ yathā |
tataśca parameśāni śāktācāraṃ hi bījakam || 3 ||

<p. 95> kāmabandhasya (gh, j: karmabandhasya) muktāsi muktasya 
bandhadāyinī |
tataśca parameśāni śāktācāraṃ hi bījakam || 4 ||

śāktācāra(-)nindakasya saṅgaṃ saṃtyajya yatnataḥ |
mayoktenaiva mārgeṇa kulakāryaṃ samācaret || 5 ||

atha saṃsargatyāgaḥ |

cikitsakānāṃ viprāṇāṃ strīṇāṃ vicchedakāriṇām |
gaṇakasya ca saṃsargaṃ sarvadā varjayet priye || 6 ||

cumbakasyāpi dhūrtasya saṃsargaṃ parivarjayet |
paśūnāñcaiva saṃsargaṃ vīrāṇāṃ bhrāntacetasām |
kāmukānāñca saṃsargaṃ sarvadā parivarjayet || 7 ||

yatheṣṭācāraśīlānāṃ nindakasya janasya ca |
gurubhaktivihīnānāṃ śaktidveṣakarasya ca |
satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyaṃ tatsaṃsargaṃ parityajet || 8 ||

(ślokārddho'yaṃ cha(-)ja(-)pustakayordṛśyate, nānyatra) (mayoktenaiva 
mārgeṇa kulakāryaṃ samācaret)
paśusaṅgaṃ parityajya vīrasaṅgaṃ samācaret (j: samāśrayet) |
śāktaśca dvividho devi vāmadakṣiṇabhedataḥ || 9 ||

atha dakṣiṇācāraśāktalakṣaṇam |

samayācāratantre (-)

svadharmanirato bhūtvā pañcatattvaiḥ prapūjayet |
sa eva dakṣiṇācāraḥ śivo bhūtvā yajet parām || 10 ||

<p. 66> atha svadharmalakṣaṇam |

bhairavatantre (-)

yasya yasya ca varṇasya yadācāraṃ maheśvari |
svadharma tadvijānīyāt śrutyuktaṃ parikīrtitam || 11 ||

niruttare (-)

dvijātīnāñca sarveṣāṃ dvidhā vidhirihocyate |
divā ca pāśavaṃ karma rātrau karma ca kīlikam || 12 ||

puraścaryādikaṃ karma dvividhaṃ bhāvabheditaḥ |
rātrau pūjāṃ sadākuryād divā kuryācca vaidikīm |
divā rātrau yajed devīṃ yathoktaphaladaṃ bhavet |
pūjanaṃ lakṣaguṇitaṃ niśāyāṃ nirjane śive || 15 ||

divārcanaṃ śataguṇaṃ niśāyāñca sahasrakam |
niśīthe lakṣaguṇitaṃ pūjayed gopanānvitaḥ || 16 ||

muṇḍamālātantre (-)

divārcanaṃ paśūnāṃ hi vīrāṇāñca niśārcanam |
niśīthe pañcamenāpi pañcatattvena vārcayet || 17 ||

atha vīralakṣaṇam |

madyaṃ māṃsañca matsyañca mudrāñca maithunaṃ priye (j: śive) 
|
vīrācāramidaṃ proktaṃ sādhakasyāpi bījakam || 18 ||

<p. 67> pañcatattvena saṃpūjya ātmānaṃ devatāṃ śive |
pañcamānandasaṃyuktaḥ pañcatattveṣu lipsitaḥ || 19 ||

pañcamīṃ pañcatattvena pūjayejjagadambikām |
vīrācāramidaṃ proktaṃ sādhakasyāpi bījakam || 20 ||

atha vīrācāragopanam |

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

divābhāge yajeddevīṃ lokācārakrameṇa ca |
lokācāraṃ vinā devi gopanaṃ naiva jāyate |
gopanāt kāryasiddhiḥ syāt prakāśāt siddhidā bhavet || 21 ||

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

prakāśāt siddhihāniḥ syāt prakāśācca daridratā |
ata eva maheśāni prakāśaṃ naiva kārayet || 22 ||

gopanīyaṃ prayatnena svayoniriva pārvati |
gopayecca paśoragre vīrāgre naiva gopayet || 23 ||

kulārṇave (-)

guptaṃ pratyakṣakaṃ kṛtvā (k, kh, g, gh, c: pratyekakaṃ kṛtvā) 
vicaranti ca sādhakāḥ |
prakāśāt siddhihāniḥ syād guptāt siddhirna saṃśayaḥ || 24 ||

nijasādhakamadhye tu na goptavyaṃ kadācana |
gupte'pi siddhihāniḥ syāt prakāśāt siddhimān bhavet || 25 ||

niruttare (-)

divyānāñcaiva vīrāṇāṃ phaladaṃ gopanāt śive |
vīrāgre gopanāddevi rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet || 26 ||

gopanācca paśoragre siddhibhāg yāti sādhakaḥ |
vīrāgre gopanāt sarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 27 ||

na paśorālaye kuryānna paśordṛṣṭi(gh: jñāna)(-)gocare |
na paśoḥ sannidhāne'pi paśoreva na darśayet || 28 ||

pūjādravyaṃ pānadravyaṃ paśunā vīkṣitaṃ yadi |
tad dravyaṃ jalataḥ kṣiptaṃ (j: kṣiptvā) japeddevyā mahāmanum || 29 
||

jñānārṇave (-)

paśunā vīkṣitaṃ dravyaṃ na devyai vinivedayet |
kulapūjāṃ kuladravyaṃ kulastrīkulasaṅgamam |
gopanīyaṃ paśoragre prakāśānmaraṇaṃ bhavet || 30 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
kena rūpeṇa vā svāmin paśorvīrasya lakṣaṇam || 31 ||

anayorlakṣaṇaṃ deva mama sthāne prakāśaya |
iti te prārthitaṃ deva yadi te mayyanugrahaḥ || 32 ||

atha paśuvīralakṣaṇam |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

pañcadhā paśavaḥ proktā steṣāṃ bhedamimaṃ śṛṇu (gh: priye) |
dhūrtaṃ śaṭhaṃ cumbakañca mukharaṃ dāmbhikaṃ śive || 33 ||

ete ca paśavaḥ proktā ścānyācāraṃ na jāyate |
anyācārakṛto yena tadvadāmi priyambade (j: varānane) || 34 ||

vaidikāt tāntrikād bhraṣṭo narake pacyate dhruvam |

<p. 69> athavā pānabhraṣṭo yaḥ sa eva paśulakṣaṇaḥ |
eteṣāṃ jñānamātreṇa kaulikasya kriyākṣayaḥ || 35 ||

tantrāntare (-)

yaḥ śāstravidhimullaṅghya vartate kāmacārataḥ |
sa paśuḥ parameśāni pacyate narake dhruvam || 36 ||

kumārī tantre (-)

kulakarmaprasaṅgastu paśūnāṃ purataḥ śive |
kadāccinnaiva kartavyaḥ (j: vaktavyam) śūdrasya vedapāṭhavat || 37 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha(-)viracite sarvollāse
aṣṭādaśollasaḥ] || 0 ||



[ūnaviṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha sādhakalakṣaṇam |

kulārṇave śrīdevyuvāca(-)

lakṣaṇaṃ vīrabhāvasya kiṃ vāpyācārakaṃ (ch, ja: 
kimapyācārakaṃ) śiva |
jñāpitaṃ paramānanda mama sthāne prakāśaya || 1 ||

madyapānena jānīyāt sādhakasyāpi lakṣaṇam |
tatpānaṃ trividhaṃ proktaṃ divya(-)vīra(-)paśu(-)kramāt || 2 ||

<p. 70>

divyo devyugrataḥ pānaṃ vīro visarjanāt param (gh: 
mudrāsamanvitaḥ) |
svecchayāpi paśoḥ pānamiti pānamudāhṛtam || 3 ||

bhakti(-)muktipradaṃ divyaṃ vīraṃ bhakti(-)samanvitam |
paśupānaṃ narakadamiti pānaphalaṃ śṛṇu || 4 ||

divyo'pi vīrabhāvo'pi prāṇānte'pi kuleśvari |
paśupānamakartavyaṃ śaktibhaktyāśritaḥ pivet || 5 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

svecchāpānaṃ mahādeva mama sthāne prakāśaya |
kena rūpeṇa vā deva devyagre pānabhāg naraḥ || 6 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

cakrabhinne caret pānaṃ svecchāpānaṃ prakīrtitam |
sā svecchā dvividhā jñeyā'jñānijñānivibhedataḥ || 7 ||

ajñānī mādakaṃ pānaṃ svānande jñānināmapi |
cakraṃ kṛtvā pivenmadyaṃ cakraṃ hi śaktisaṃyutam || 8 ||

atha cakralakṣaṇam |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

cakrasya lakṣaṇaṃ kiñcit mamasthāne prakāśaya |
phalaṃ kiṃ prāṇanātheśa kathaya (gh: vadaya) siddhihetave || 9 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

śrīcakre sevato (gh, ch, j: sevanāt) madyaṃ kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale |
āyurvalaṃ (gh: vittaṃ) yaśo vṛddhiḥ ṣaṭkarmasādhanaṃ priye (g, gh, 
j: ṣaṭkarmasya ca sādhanam; ch: ṣaṭkarmaṇo'pi sādhanam) || 10 ||

<p. 71>

mokṣaṃ vittaṃ tathā puṣṭiṃ śrīcakrāllabhate'pi ca |
bhogena labhate muktiṃ siddhiṃ śrīcakrasevanāt || 11 ||

cakramadhye maheśāni mūlamantraṃ japettu yaḥ |
ekavārajapenaiva lakṣavāraphalaṃ labhet || 12 ||

carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ tathā lehyaṃ peyaṃ bhogaṃ maheśvari |
cakramadhye prakartavyamanantaphalamīritam |
cakrañca dvividhaṃ proktaṃ divya(-)vīra(-)mataṃ śive || 13 ||

atha divyacakrapramāṇam |

devyā yuktaṃ divyacakraṃ bhayalajjāvivarjitam |
darśanāt kāmasiddhiḥ (gh: kārya-) syād vīro bhavati sparśanāt || 14 
||
sevanācca bhavenmuktiḥ siddhāntācārasammataḥ |
divyacakramidaṃ proktaṃ vīracakraṃ tataḥ śṛṇu || 15 ||

śaktidehe sthitaṃ cakraṃ vināśaktiṃ na cakravān |
ata eva maheśāni śaktiyuktaṃ (j: śaktiyuktaḥ) pivenmadhu || 16 ||

nigamakalpe śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

divyacakre divyaśaktiṃ ramaṇena prapūjayet |
vīracakraṃ ramet (gh, j: yajet) śaktiṃ gandhapuṣpādināpi vā || 17 ||

rāgadveṣavinirmuktaṃ kevalaṃ svātmahetave |
divyacakramidaṃ proktaṃ vīracakraṃ tataḥ (ch, j: idaṃ) śṛṇu || 18||

sveṣṭadevaṃ yajettatra pañcatattvena pārvati |
pañcamīṃ (ch, j: pañcamī) pañcatattvena taccakraṃ vīrabhāṣitam || 
19 ||

<p. 72>

kulārṇave (-)

yatrāsti bhogo na ca tatra mokṣo,
yatrāsti mokṣo na ca tra bhogaḥ |
śivāpadānbhojayugārcakānāṃ,
bhogaśca mokṣaśca karastha eva || 20 ||

yāṣmadyapāyī sa dvijo na kaścit,
yo vipra uktaḥ sa pivecca madyam |
śivāpadāmbhojayugārcakānāṃ
bhogena madyena karasthamuktiḥ || 21 ||

yo bhedamārgī na bhavet sa śākto,
yaḥ śāktako devi kvacinna bhedaḥ |
śivāpadāmbhojayugārcakānāṃ
bhede'pyabhedo hi karastha eva || 22 ||

pañcayukto bhavet śāktaḥ pañcame jñānavān yadi |
tadā (g: yadā) cakre maheśāni pivenmadyaṃ ramet striyam || 23 ||

śaktijñānaṃ mahītkṛṣṭaṃ nirvāṇaprathamāṃkuram |
śrīcakre'pi pivenmadyaṃ śaktiyuktaṃ maheśvari || 24 ||

atha vīracakralakṣaṇam |

kukkuṭatantre (-)

vīracakraṃ tridhā jñeyaṃ caturdhā paśunā saha |
cottamaṃ madhyamaṃ jñeyaṃ cādhamañcādhamādhamam || 25 ||

ekā śaktiryatra devi eko hi sādhako yadi |
cakromamidaṃ jñeyaṃ sā kālī sa ca śaṅkaraḥ || 26 ||

<p. 73>

(gh, j: pāṭho'yaṃ pustakayordṛśyato, nānyatra (siddhivartma śṛṇu 
prājñe yat kṛtvā siddhimāpnuyāt |
ekāṃ śaktiṃ samānīya ekaikaḥ sādhakaḥ sadā || 27 ||

pūjayed bahuyatnena pañcatattvena kaulikaḥ |
evaṃ kṛtvā labhet siddhiṃ nānyasya dṛṣṭigocare || ) 28 ||

triśakyākto yadā (j: yatra) devi tiṣṭhati (gh: varttate) ca trisādhakaḥ |
madhyamaṃ cakravijñeyaṃ (j: cakramākhyātaṃ) sa vīraḥ sāpi 
bhairavī || 29 ||

ṣaṭsādhako yatra cakre ṣaṭśaktistiṣṭhati priye |
adhamaṃ cakravijñeyaṃ sā sādhyā sa ca sādhakaḥ || 30 ||

etadbhinnaṃ paśoścakraṃ ninditaṃ śaktivarjitam |
śaktihīnañca yatcakraṃ kevalaṃ madakaṃ śive || 31 ||

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

sādhakairgaṇitāṃ śaktiṃ mahācakre niveśayet |
madhyame navaśaktiñca hīne'pi śaktimātrakam || 32 ||

śaktihīnaṃ yadā cakraṃ paśucakraṃ maheśvari |
tasmin cakre sādhako'pi kadācinna praveśayet || 33 ||

madhu māṃsaṃ mauthunañca cakraṃ na kārayet |
śrīcakre maithunaṃ bhadraṃ śivatvaṃ yāti sādhakaḥ || 34 ||

cakrāntare ca ramaṇāt sādhako'bhūnmaheśvari |
vīracakramidaṃ proktaṃ devacakraṃ tataḥ śṛṇu || 35 ||

<p. 74>

atha devacakralakṣaṇam |

peyaṃ madyaṃ dehamāṃsaṃ jalajaṃ matsyakaṃ śive |
mudrāpi cānyadravyāṇi saṅgamaṃ pañcabhautikam |
sṛṣṭirūpaṃ mahācakraṃ śrīcakraṃ parameśvari || 26 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse unviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[viṃśollāsaḥ]

atha śrīcakrasya sthānanirupaṇam |

samayācāratantre (-)

ekānte nirjane ramye deśe vādhā(-)vivarjite |
tatra sthāne careccakraṃ yatra syād devatāgṛha || 1 ||

athavā devatāsthāne tīrthādiṣu maheśvari |
devatāvṛkṣamūleṣu sthānaṃ kuryāt prayatnataḥ || 2 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

śaktigehaṃ svagehañca veśyālayamanāmayam |
sādhakasya gṛhaṃ bhadre śrīcakrasthānamuttamam || 3 ||

guroḥ sthānaṃ gurorājñāṃ jñātvā sthānaṃ prakalpayet |
athavā yasya yatsthānaṃ tasyājñayā prakalpayet || 4 ||

yasyājñayā caret cakraṃ tatrodvegaṃ bhaved yadi |
tadudvegasya yatpāpaṃ tatpāpaṃ tatra gacchati || 5 ||

<p. 75>

atha śrīcakrāsanapramāṇam |

jñānārṇave (-)

śavāsanaṃ vinā devi vīrakāryaṃ na cācaret |
śavāsanādhikaṃ jñeyaṃ latāgehapraveśanam || 6 ||

śavābhāve maheśāni viṣṭaraṃ parikalpayet |
yonyabhāve maheśāni trikoṇañcāsanaṃ śubham || 7 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

śavāsanaṃ vinā devi vīrakāryaṃ na cācaret |
śavābhāve viṣṭaraṃ hi vīrāsanamudīritam || 8 ||

śavāsane śaktikāryaṃ śaktiyukto maheśvari |
śavaikamāsanaṃ bhadre viṣṭaraṃ yugmamāsanam || 9 ||

śavayugmaṃ na kartavyameke'pi (ch: eko'pi; j: eko hi) yugalaṃ sthitam 
|
ata eva maheśāni viṣṭaraṃ yugmakalpanam |
anyāsanaṃ catuṣkoṇaṃ trikoṇaṃ parikalpitam || 10 ||

tantrāntare (-)

kāmyārthaṃ kambalañcaiva mokṣañca raktakambalam |
kṛṣṇājine jñānasiddhirmokṣañca vyāghracarmaṇi || 11 ||

kuśāsane mantrasiddhirnātra kāryavicāraṇā |
etadbhinnañcāsanaṃ hi citracitrādi (j: citrācitrādi) saṃyutam || 12 ||

citrāsanaṃ hi raktena trikoṇaṃ sumanoharam |
nānāvarṇena saṃyuktaṃ vicitrañcāsanaṃ śubhe |
viṣṭaraṃ tatra saṃsthāpya niyataṃ śaktikalpitam || 13 ||

<p. 76>

guptasādhanatantre (-)

ekānte nirjane ramye deśe vādhāvivarjite |
praśaste'pyāsane rakte vicitre vā manohare || 14 ||

sukhāsane samāsīnaḥ prāṅmukho vāpyudaṅmukhaḥ |
tṛptyarthaṃ devatānāñca kūryādvīrāsanaṃ śive || 15 ||

vīrāṇāṃ dakṣiṇānāñca vīrāsanamudīritam |
vāmasiddhāntadivyānāṃ svecchāsanamudīritam || 16 ||

niruttare (-)

ko vidhiḥ ko niṣedho'pi kaulānāñcāsanaṃ priye |
vāmasiddhāntadivyānāṃ niyamaṃ naiva kalpitam || 17 ||

anyeṣāñcāsanaṃ kuryāt śuddhiṃ kṛtvopaveśanam |
ekānte nirjane ramye deśe vādhāvivarjite || 18 ||

āsanaṃ tatra saṃsthāpya sādhayet manunā śive |
rudhireṇa varārohe trikoṇañcāsane (j: āsane) likhet || 19 ||

catuṣkoṇañcāsanaṃ hi trikoṇaṃ yonimaṇḍalam |
bhūcakramāsanaṃ jñeyaṃ gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ || 20 ||

yajedādhāraśaktiñca athavā kamalāsanam |
yajedādhāraśaktiñca kamalāntaṃ tridhā śive || 21 ||

nigamakalpalatāyāṃ śrīśiva uvāca (-)

śuddhārthaṃ paramaṃ mantraṃ bahudhā prakaṭīkṛtam |
ājanma koṭyāṃ tanmantraṃ jñāpituṃ naiva śakyate || 22 ||

<p. 77>

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

bhāvaṃ vinā maheśāna kiñcinnaiva prakāśitam |
prakāśite'pi yoniḥ syāt śuddhiḥ syād yonilekhanāt |
nātinīcaṃ nāti coccaṃ śrīcakre cāsanaṃ priya || 23 ||

atha cakreśvaraniyamaḥ |

yāmale (-)

pūjābhiṣekasaṃyuktaḥ kulaśāstrārthatattvavit |
devatā(-)guru(-)bhakto'pi śaktiyuktaḥ kriyānvitaḥ || 24 ||

tāmbūlapūritamukho dhūpāmodasugandhitaḥ |
raktānulepairgandhaiśca suveśairbhūṣito guruḥ || 25 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

rudrākṣamālādhārī ca śvetagandhena lepitaḥ (j: bhūṣitaḥ) |
raktacandanasaṃyukto raktapuṣpavibhūṣitaḥ || 26 ||

brāhmaṇānāmabhāvo'pi kṣatriyo'pi gururbhavet |
tadabhāve'pi vaiśyaḥ syānnatu śūdraḥ kadācana || 27 ||

ācāryo'pi bhavet śūdro'pyabhiṣekakṛto yadi |
anyeṣāñcābhiṣekāṇāṃ devatārūpiṇaḥ priye (gh: śive) |
teṣāṃ kareṇa pānañcedabhiṣeko bhavet priye || 28 ||

atha cakramadhyepraveśalakṣaṇam |

gautamīye (-)

cakreśvaro vīrabhāvo sastrīkaḥ praṇamet bhuvi |
madyabhāṇḍaṃ kare kṛtvā cāsane copaveśayet || 29 ||

<p. 78>

kṛtvā vīrāsanaṃ mantrī pūjādravyaṃ samānaye |
nāti nīcaṃ nāti coccaṃ caturaṃgulimadhyagam |
tatrāsane vasenmantrī devadhyānaparāyaṇaḥ (gh: 
devatādhyānatatparaḥ) || 30 ||

uṣṇatīkṣṇaguṇopetaṃ madyaṃ durgandhavarjitam |
dhṛtvā (j: dhyātvā) praṇamya prathamaṃ śrīcakreṣu praveśanam || 
31 ||

vāmakare ca ramaṇīṃ dakṣiṇe madhyabhāṇḍakam |
ātmapātraṃ śaktikare śrīcakreṣu praveśanam || 32 ||

cakreśvaro'pi yadrūpe cakramadhye praveśayet |
tadrūpe (gh, j: tadrūpaḥ) sādhakaḥ sarvaścakramadhye praveśayet || 
33 ||

pūjādravyaṃ pānadravyaṃ kare kṛtvā sulocane |
śaktihaste pānapātraṃ svavāme śaktidhāraṇam || 34 ||

nigamatattve (-)

vīrānandayutā śaktiryadi cakreśvarī bhavet |
taccakraṃ parameśāna devacakraṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 35 ||

kare vāme madyabhāṇḍaṃ dakṣiṇe ramaṇaṃ (j: paramaṃ) śivam |
śrīcakreṣu praveśyā sā bhaya(-)lajjā(-)vivarjitāḥ || 36 ||

taccakre parameśāna dravyaśuddhiṃ na kārayet |
tasyāḥ saṃsparśanādeva (ch, j: tasyāṅgasparśanādeva) 
dravyaśuddhistu tatkṣaṇāt || 37 ||

pratipātre maheśāna bhage liṅgaṃ vicintayet |
pātrādvinduṃ samādāya prakṣiped yonimaṇḍale || 38 ||

cakreśvarī mahāhṛṣṭā yadi yoniṃ prakāśayet |
gandhāpuṣpairdhūpadīpaiḥ kāraṇena prapūjayet || 39 ||

<p. 79>

ramaṇañca tataḥ kuryāda yadi syādramaṇānvitā |
ramaṇānte maheśāna bhagavāri pivenmudā || 40 ||

tadabhāve jalaṃ peyaṃ kāraṃ vindusaṃyutam |
śaktiyantraṃ jalaṃ jñeyaṃ yato māyāprabodhakam || 41 ||

tattoyaṃ rudhirāktañced retāktañced guṇatrayam |
brahma jñeyaṃ yoniraktaṃ toyaṃ tasyā janārdanam |
śukraṃ tasyā mahādevaṃ tadabhāve'nukalpanam (ch: tadabhāvād-) 
|| 42 ||

kuśidaṃ bhagaraktañca śukrañca malayodbhavam |
bhagavārīti toyañca triguṇāktaṃ tridevatā || 43 ||

bhāgyena labhate deva cakre cakreśvarīṃ yadi |
taddehaṃ mama dehañca puṃdehañca sadāśivam || 44 ||

tatra cakre sthitā śaktirmama rūpā maheśvara |
sādhakastava tulyo'pi devacakre manohare || 45 ||

anyacakre maheśāna bahuvighnaṃ prajāyate |
devacakraṃ devacakraṃ devacakraṃ kalau yuge || 46 ||

devacakrasya māhātmyaṃ gaditṃ naiva śakyate |
svecchayā gāna(-)pānañca maithunañca sukhoditam || 47 ||

storañca japakāryañca sarvaṃ svecchāsukhoditam |
ata eva maheśāna devacakraṃ kalau yuge || 48 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse viṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ekaviṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha śrīcakre jātyabhedaḥ |

tārātantre (-)

ārambhe bhairavīcakre sarve varṇā dvijottamāḥ |
nivṛtte bhairavaucakre sarve varṇāḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 1 ||

jātibhedaṃ vimūḍhātmā śrīcakre'pi karoti yaḥ |
narake duṣkare ghore patatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 2 ||

vāmakeśvare (-)

cakramadhye vimūḍhātmā jātibhedaṃ karoti yaḥ |
caṇḍīkopād bhavennaṣṭaṃ kāntiḥ puṣṭirbalaṃ yaśaḥ || 3 ||

madirāyāṃ maithuneṣu jātibhedaṃ na cācaret |
maithunasya mahāsaukhyaṃ bījaṃ madyañca sundari || 4 ||

bahunāpi kimuktena cakramadhye maheśvari |
madrūpāḥ puruṣāḥ sarve tvadrūpā yoṣitaḥ priye || 5 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

bahugāvo'pi tiṣṭhanti yathaikarajjuvandhitāḥ |
tathā narāśca tiṣṭhanti jātipāśena vandhitāḥ || 6 ||

madyāsinā jātipāśaṃ saṃchedya śaktivākyataḥ |
śrīcakre'pi pivenmadyaṃ jātibhedaṃ parityajan || 7 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

jātimātraṃ sūkṣmabodhaṃ jātīyaṃ sthūlabodhakam |
sūkṣmasya kena vā naṣṭaṃ cotpattiḥ kena vā punaḥ || 8 ||

<p. 81>

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

śrīcakrasya jagat sarvaṃ yasya cetasi bhāsitam |
hrāsavṛddhī na ced jāte ramāyāṃ niśināthavat || 9 ||

madyaśaktiyute cakre hrāsavṛddhiḥ kṣaṇe kṣaṇe |
cakrasya hrāsavṛddhyākte jāterhrāsasya (g, j: -hrāsaśca) vṛddhitā || 
10 ||

narasya jātipāśasya parastrī mātṛvat śive |
jātibhraṣṭasya kāntāpi madhyabhuk ramaṇī śive || 11 ||

madyabhuk ramaṇīṃ tyajyāṃ kevalāṃ jananīṃ parām (j: ramaṇī 
tyajyā kevalā jananī parā) |
pūjayettāṃ maheśāni ramaṇaṃ naiva kārayet || 12 ||

anyā yā mātṛtulyā sā śrīcakre ramaṇī parā |
pūjayecca ramet śaktiṃ tasyāstasyāpi (g, gh: tasya tasyāpi) harṣataḥ || 
13 ||

jātinaṣṭe kutra kārye tasya doṣo bhaviṣyati |
śrīcakre parameśāni jātipāśaṃ parityajet || 14 ||

yadi cakre maheśāni jātipāśaṃ samāśritaḥ |
vṛthāpānaṃ bhavettasya kevalaṃ jātināśakam || 15 ||

atha śrīcakre dravyanirūpaṇaṃ |

samayācāratantre (-)

hetuṃ (gh: hetuṃ māṃsaṃ pāyasañca dadhi(-)dugdha(-)ghṛtaṃ priye) 
māṃsaṃ tathā dugdhaṃ payo dadhi ghṛtaṃ priye |
nānāvyañjanasaṃyuktamannaṃ saṃsthāpya yatnataḥ || 16 ||

piṇyākaṃ laśunaṃ bhadre śarkarā madhu piṣṭhakam |
bhakṣaṇañca viśeṣañca sandeśaṃ vividhaṃ priye || 17 ||

<p. 82>

matsyaṃ māṃsañca mudrāñca vīradravyaṃ manoharaṃ |
śrīcakre sthāpayeddevi devatātṛptihetave || 18 ||

guptasādhana tantre (-)

kuṅkumaṃ śuddhasindūraṃ candanaṃ rocanāgurum |
karpūraṃ yāvakaṃ bhadre śrīcakre sthāpayet priye (g, ch: priyaṃ) || 
19 ||

nānā sugandhi(-)dhūpena citāmodo yathā bhavet |
tataśca dhūpa(-)patrāṇi śrīcakre viniyojayet || 20 ||

carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ tathā lehyaṃ peyaṃ kāṃsye suśobhitaṃ |
paramānnañca takrañca suvāsita(-)jalaṃ priye || 21 ||

vīra tantre(-)

kaṭvamlakaṃ tiktarasaṃ vahūni vyañjanāni ca |
ghṛtena jñāvitaṃ māṃsaṃ vividhaṃ sthāpayet priye || 22 ||

haṃsabījaṃ tathā kṣīraṃ lavaṇañca piṇyākakaṃ |
laśūnaṃ śrīcakramadhye sthāpayedārdrakaṃ priye || 23 ||

kālikākulasarvasve (-)

ārdrakaṃ dagdhamīnañca cūrṇaṃ trikaṭusya ca |
lājāṃścipiṭakañcaiva śrīcakre viniyojayet || 24 ||

atha śrīcakre dravyasthāpanaṃ |

paṅktyākāreṇa saṃsthāpya dravyāṇi vividhāni ca |
śodhitaṃ paramaṃ dravyaṃ kāṃsya(-)pātreṣu saṃsthitaṃ |
paṅktyākāre cakramadhye sthāpayet parameśvari || 25 ||

<p. 83>

kulatattvasāre (-)

kāṃsya pātre sthitaṃ dravyaṃ bhojanīyaṃ maheśvari |
śodhitaṃ vidhivat sarvaṃ paṅktyākāre niyojayet || 26 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ekaviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[dvāviṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha śrīpātraniyamaḥ |

kālīkalpe (-)

vaśyākarṣaṇakāryeṣu hemapātraṃ suśobhitam (g, gh: suśobhanaṃ) 
|
śāntike puṣṭike (j: pauṣṭike) kārye rājataṃ kārayet priye || 1 ||

lauha pātraṃ vijānīyāt māraṇoccāṭane śive |
sarvakāryeṣu kartavyaṃ viśvāmitraṃ kuleśvari || 2 ||

tāmra pātraṃ kāṃsya pātraṃ pātraṃ pittala sambhavaṃ |
vilva pātraṃ mahāpātraṃ sarvakārye praśastakam |
kārya bhede pātrabhedamabhede sthita pātrakam (c, ch, j: 
abhedasthitapātrakam) || 3 ||

atha śrīpātrasthāpana (-) lakṣaṇam |

tārā(-)tantre (-)

trikoṇaṃ maṇḍalaṃ bhūmau catuṣkoṇaṃ likhettataḥ |
tatrādhārantu saṃsthāpya śrīpātraṃ sthāpayettataḥ || 4 ||

<p. 84>

atha śrīpātrādhāra lakṣaṇam |

caturdhā dhārakaṃ proktaṃ tripadambā catuṣpadam |
ṣaṭpadambā maheśāni padañcāṣṭa prakīrtitam |
padasaṃkhyāñca koṇañca maṇḍalaṃ kārayet priye || 5 ||

atha pañcatattva kathanam |

nirvāṇatantraṃ śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deva deva (g, gh: nāsti) mahādeva tattvañca tattvadāyaka |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi tattvajñānañca tadvada || 6 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tattvajñānāni (ch, j: tattvajñānasya) kathane śaṅkā cenmama 
mānase |
yena tattva prasādena viṣṇustattvaguṇāśrayaḥ (ch, j: 
sattvaguṇāśrayāḥ) || 7 ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi brahmābhūcca pitāmahaḥ |
tattvajñānaprasādena śambhuḥ saṃhārakārakaḥ || 8 ||

anye muktāśca ye sarve to'pi tattvaprasādataḥ |
tattvajñānaṃ vinā devi muktirhāsyāya kalpate || 9 ||

tattvajñānaṃ vinā bhadre niṣphalaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi tattvaṃ parama durlabham || 10 ||

śrutvā gopaya yatnena sva yoniriva pārvati |
madyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ mudrāñca maithunaṃ śive || 11 ||

pañcatattvamidaṃ proktaṃ nirvāṇa prathamāṃkuram |
aiśvaryaṃ paramaṃ hṛṣṭaṃ madya(-)pānena śailaje || 12 ||

<p. 85>

māṃsabhakṣaṇamātreṇa naro (ch, j: sākṣāt) nārāyaṇo bhavet |
matsyabhojanamātreṇa kālīpratyakṣatā bhavet || 13 ||

mudrāsevanamātreṇa bhūpūjyo viṣṇurūpadhṛk |
maithunena mahāyogī mama tulyo na saṃśayaḥ || 14 ||

nigamakalpadrume śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kevalenādyayogena sādhako bhairavo bhavet |
dvitīyena ca tattvena mahābhairavatāṃ vrajet || 15 ||

tṛtīyena ca tattvena sādhakaḥ śivarūpadhṛk |
caturthena ca tattvena rudrarūpadharaḥ svayam |
pareṇa paratāṃ yāti tava (gh, j: mama) tulyoḥ na saṃśayaḥ || 16 ||

atha pañcatattvasya phalam |

nirvāṇatantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

tattvaikaṃ parameśāna pañcadhā kena tadvada (k, g, c, ch: bhūdvada) 
|
asya bhāvaṃ phalaṃ kiñca pañcadhāpyekadhā ca kim || 17 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tattvaikaṃ parameśāni pañca tasyāpi (j: tattvasya) kāraṇam |
kāryaṃ nānāmataṃ yasya nānārūpaṃ hi kāraṇam || 18 ||

kāraṇañca bhavet kāryaṃ kāryaṃ hi kāraṇaṃ yathā |
astrasya kāraṇaṃ lauhaṃ lauhasyāstraṃ hi kāraṇam || 19 ||

pipāsā kāraṇaṃ vāri vāriṇaḥ syāt pipāsakam |
kāryabhede kāraṇasya devi bhedaṃ hi kalpanam || 20 ||

<p. 86>

ekatra pañcatattvāni yatraiva milanaṃ (j: vimalaṃ) bhavet |
tatraivāhaṃ pragacchāmi te narāḥ matsamāḥ sadā (c, j: 
matsyamāṃsasadāḥ) || 21 ||

ye narāḥ sādhubhāvāśca tattvajñānaparāyaṇāḥ |
jīvanmuktāśca te devi brāhmaṇāśca na cānyathā || 22 ||

yathā toyaṃ toyamadhye līyate parameśvari |
tathaiva tattvasevāyāṃ līyate paramātmani || 23 ||

iti te kathitaṃ kānte tattvajñānaṃ vimokṣadam |
yena vijñānamātreṇa mokṣasiddhirna saṃśayaḥ || 24 ||

kṣitiṃ vinā yathā nāsti sthitireva maheśvari |
toyaṃ vinā yathā nāsti pipāsānāśakāraṇam || 25 ||

tamohantā yathā nāsti bhāskareṇa vinā priye |
vinā vahniprayogeṇa yathā kiñcinna pacyate || 26 ||

vinā candreṇa deveśi sudhāvṛṣṭirna jāyate |
mahodgarbhaṃ vinā kānte cotpattirnaiva jāyate |
tattvajñānaṃ vinā devi tathā muktirna jāyate || 27 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse dvāviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[trayoviṃśollāsaḥ] |

kulārṇave śrīmahādevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa namāmi caraṇāmbuje |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi tattvādyaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ mahat || 1 ||

<p. 87>

athādyatattva lakṣaṇam |

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

tatvādyaṃ parameśāni sarvatattvasya bījakam (j: kāraṇaṃ) |
bījaṃ vinānyatattvaṃ yat diṅmūḍhasyāpi pūrvavat || 2 ||

ata eva surāḥ sarve hetuñcāmṛtakalpitāḥ (j: kalpitam) |
amṛtaṃ bhogamāpanne mṛtabhāvaṃ vimuhyitāḥ (j: vimuhyati) || 3 ||

svarge yadamṛtaṃ proktaṃ tadeva laukikī surā |
surāñca (j: surāyāḥ) bhogamāpanne suratvañca bhaviṣyati || 4 ||

ata eva dvijāḥ sarve madyosaktā yuge yuge |
madyabījaṃ maheśāni vṛkṣānandaṃ (gh, j: brahmānandaṃ) 
prakalpayet || 5 ||

nṛtyagītātmikā śākhā vākyamātraṃ dalaṃ śive |
mahāśaktiḥ puṣparūpā maithunaṃ phalarūpakam || 6 ||

śukrapātaṃ mahābījaṃ sṛṣṭimātraṃ hi kāraṇam |
vṛkṣasvarūpaṃ taddravyaṃ (gh, j: tadrūpaṃ) śaktiyuktaṃ bhaved 
yadi || 7 ||

mātṛkābheda tantre (-)

brāhmaṇasya mahāmokṣaṃ madyapānena śailaje |
brāhmaṇaḥ parameśāni yadi pānādikañcaret |
tatkṣaṇāt śivarūpo'sau satyaṃ satyaṃ priyambade || 8 ||

madyapānaṃ vinā devi tattvajñānaṃ na labhyate (ch, j: tajjñānaṃ 
na hi labhyate) |
ata eva hi vipraśca surāpānaṃ sadācaret (gh, j: samācaret) || 9 ||

vedamātājapenaiva brāhmaṇo nahi śailaje |
brahmajñānaṃ yadā devi tadā brāhmaṇa ucyate || 10 ||

<p. 88>

toye toyaṃ yathālīnaṃ taijase taijasaṃ yathā (j: yathā tejasi taijasam) |
bhagne ghaṭe yathākāśaṃ mahākāśe (k, gh: yathākāśe) pralīyate |
tathaiva sadyabhug vipro līyate paramātmani || 11 ||

kulārṇave śrīmahādevyuvāca (-)

deveśa parameśāna jñānājñāna pradāyaka |
vedasya varjitaṃ madyaṃ kathamuktaṃ sadāśiva || 12 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

surāpānānmahāpāpaṃ vedādiṣu nirūpaṇam (j: nirūpitaṃ) |
ata eva kriyāśaktairmadyaṃ tyājyaṃ yuge yuge || 13 ||

āvayoḥ piśitaṃ māṃsaṃ madyañcaiva maheśvari |
varṇāśramocitaṃ dharmaṃ na vicārya pivanti ye |
bhūtāḥ pretāḥ piśācāśca te narā brahmarākṣasāḥ || 14 ||

madyapāne mahādoṣaṃ vedādiṣu nirūpaṇam |
tathāpi muktibhāgvipro madyapānaṃ (j: madyapānāt) yuge yuge || 15 
||

na deyaṃ hi na peyaṃ hi satyaṃ satyaṃ yuge yuge |
tathāpi brāhmaṇāḥ sarve madyapāneṣu lālitāḥ || 16 ||

athādyatattvasyadoṣoddhāraḥ |

jñānārṇave śrīśiva uvāca (-)

vṛthāpānaṃ yaḥ kurute surāpānaṃ taducyate |
sa mahāpātakī caiva vedādiṣu nirūpaṇam || 17 ||

ata eva hi viprendro vṛthāpānaṃ nacācaret |
vṛthāpāne mahāpāpaṃ sarvaśāstrasya sammataḥ || 18 ||

<p. 89>

jñānasya kāraṇaṃ madyaṃ madyaṃ jñānasya nāśakam |
vāyunā jvalito'gniśca vāyunā layavān yathāṃ || 19 ||

devatārthe pivenmadyaṃ svānandārthe pived yadi |
tatpānaṃ kāraṇaṃ pānaṃ tadanyad viṣabhakṣaṇam || 20 ||

yenaiva viṣakhaṇḍena mriyante sarvajantavaḥ |
tenaiva viṣakhaṇḍena viṣaṃ nāśayate bhiṣak || 21 ||

jñānasya kāraṇaṃ masyaṃ jñānaṃ mukteśca kāraṇam |
muktyākāṃkṣī pivenmadyaṃ tadanyaḥ pātakī bhavet || 22 ||

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

gaṅgātu kāraṇaṃ vāri madyaṃ parama kāraṇam |
śodhitañcedaśuddhañcet svargaṃ narakadāyakam || 23 ||

janmādau parameśāni bahupuṇyārjjitena ca |
muktyarthe kāraṇaṃ pānaṃ jñānārthe'pi maheśvari || 24 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse trayoviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[caturviṃśollāsaḥ] |

kālikākalpe (-)

śrīcakraṃ ramaṇīyuktaṃ hetunā tat prakāśitam |
hetorabhāve śrīcakraṃ pūrṇānandaṃ nacet kvacit || 1 ||

ramaṇīrahitaṃ cakraṃ śrīcakraṃ ramaṇīyutam |
anyaddravyaṃ hi śrīcakre śaktivākyānusārataḥ || 2 ||

<p. 90>

tantrāntare (-)

śrīcakraṃ svagṛhaṃ jñātvā (k, g, c: kṛtvā) svayaṃ cakreśvaro 
bhavet |
cakreśvarīṃ striyaṃ kṛtvā kāryakarmāṇi cācaret || 3 ||

etajjñānaprabhāveṇa kiṃ na sidhyati pārvati (j: bhūtale) |
tadgṛhāt kāraṇenāpi pūjayet parameśvarīm |
etadbhinnantu taddhetuṃ (j: yaddhetuṃ) śuddhiṃ kṛtvā tu pūjayet || 4 
||

atha dravyabhedakathanam |

samayācāratantre (-)

dravyañca (gh: madyañca) trividhaṃ proktaṃ māṃsañca trividhaṃ 
śive |
uttamaṃ madhyamaṃ jñeyaṃ cādhamaṃ parikīrtitam || 5 ||

svamandirodbhavaṃ dravyaṃ cottamaṃ khalu pārvati |
śaṇḍikāgārasambhūtaṃ madhyamaṃ parikīrtitam |
anyajātyudbhavaṃ dravyaṃ (gh: anyajātisamudbhūtaṃ) cādhamaṃ 
parikīrtitam || 6 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

ānandārthe pivenmadyaṃ ānandaṃ muktidāyakam |
tasyottamañcādhamañca madhyamaṃ kena tadvada || 7 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kālasya doṣo nāstyeva kriyāmukte na doṣabhāk |
tathā doṣo nāsti hetoḥ karaṇīyasya doṣajam || 8 ||

śukrādhāraṃ yoni (-) randhraṃ puruṣasya sukhoditam |
śukrapāte yathā doṣaṃ kāraṇasya tathā śive || 9 ||

<p. 91>

śāktasya kāraṇaṃ pāne nāsi doṣo maheśvari |
sādhakasya kriyābhedāttāvubhau doṣabhāginau || 10 ||

sarvānandapradaṃ toyaṃ samānaṃ parameśvari |
tathāpi rogiṇo dehe tajjalaṃ duḥkhadāyakam || 11 ||

tathā madyaṃ duḥkhadeyamajñānasyāpi dehinaḥ |
sālokyañcaiva sārūpyaṃ sāyujyañca maheśvari (ch, j: sāyujyaṃ 
parameśvari) || 12 ||

adhamānmadhyamād devi cottamaṃ sevanāt phalam |
madyeṣu śaktau doṣo'sti kevalājñānino vacaḥ || 13 ||

ataśca jñāninaḥ sarve piveyuḥ svecchayā madhu |
ajñānasya kriyāmūlaṃ kriyāyāḥ śuddhamūlakaṃ || 14 ||

śodhitaṃ ramaṇīmadyaṃ trivargaphaladāyakam |
svecchayāpi pivenmadyaṃ jñānī ca muktibhāg bhavet |
tatrāpi śaktisaṃyuktaṃ madyaṃ kaivalyadāyakam || 15 ||

tārātantre (-)

śaktibhāg maithunāsakto jñānabhāg muktikāṃkṣikaḥ |
jñānabhāk kāraṇāsaktastasmānmadyaṃ pivenmudā || 16 ||

aśodhitau yoni madyau mahāpāpakarābubhau |
śodhitau cet yonimadvyau sarvapāpapraṇāśakau || 17 ||

madyañca kāraṇaṃ yoneryonirmadyasya kāraṇam |
cittaśuddhe (gh: śuddhe śuddhaṃ mahādevi 
śuddhābhāve'pyuśuddhakam) sarvaśuddhaṃ 
śuddhābhāve'pyaśuddhakam || 18 ||

aśodhitaṃ pivenmadyaṃ ramaṇañcāpyaśidhitam |
pāne'pi narakaṃ yāti ramaṇaṃ maraṇaṃ bhavet || 19 ||

<p. 92>

tripurāsāre śaktiśuddhiḥ |

ādau kuryāt śaktiśuddhiṃ kāraṇañca tataḥ param |
śaktiṃ vinā maheśāni kāraṇaṃ maraṇaṃ samam |
śaktijñānaṃ kāraṇena tataḥ śaktiñca śodhayet || 20 ||

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

ādau kuryāt śaktiśuddhiṃ kāraṇaṃ tadanantaram (j: kāraṇañca 
tataḥ param) |
śaktyai datvā pivenmadyaṃ śuddhiṃ kuryāt krameṇa ca || 21 ||

śaktiśuddhiñcaredādau paśusādhakasādhikā |
śodhayitāpi tāṃ śaktiṃ śrīcakreṣu praveśayet || 22 ||

atha paśuśaktilakṣaṇam |

kulacūḍāmaṇau śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa sarvabhūte sanātana |
paśuśaktiñca kāṃ proktāṃ mama sthāne prakāśaya || 23 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

puṣpahīnā paśoḥ śaktirvīrasya puṣpasaṃyutā |
prathame puṣpitā nārī ubhayoḥ pūjitā parā || 25 ||

prathame puṣpitāṃ nārīṃ yena bhāvena pūjayet |
tadbhave bhāvitā śaktiḥ sādhakaḥ siddhihetave (gh: sādhakasya ca 
siddhaye) || 25 ||

ramaṇārthe kṛtā śaktī ramaṇaṃ vīralakṣaṇam |
ata eva mahādevi sapuṣpā vīrapūjitā || 26 ||

apuṣpāyāḥ paśoḥ pūjyā pūjyā vīrasya (j: vīrapūjyā tu) puṣpitā 
|
puṣpitāpi paśoḥ pūjyā paśuñced vāñchitā yadi || 27 ||

<p. 93>

pūjane śuddhitā (j: śodhitā) śaktiḥ sarvācārasya (g: 
sarvaśāstrasya) sammatam |
śaktirūpā mahāśaktau ramaṇārthe gṛhe sthitā || 28 ||

yadarcanena santuṣṭā śuddhitā (j: śodhitā) kāminī tadā |
madyaṃ śaktimaśuddhañcet śuddhaṃ kuryāttadarcane (k, g, c, ch: 
kuryārcane śive) || 29 ||

atha paśuvīrayoḥ śaktiśuddhiḥ |

aśodhitāṃ śaktiyantraṃ kadācinnaiva laṅghayet |
śodhitāṃ yonimāśritya ramed vīrastadantataḥ || 30 ||

paśūnāṃ ramaṇīśuddhiṃ pañcagavyena kārayet |
vīrāṇāṃ pañcatattvena retasā kevalena vā || 31 ||

nirvāṇatantre (-)

retaḥ pavitraṃ paramaṃ śaktermokṣasya kāraṇam |
pūjāhīnā ca yā nārī japahīnā ca yā punaḥ || 32 ||

dhṛtvā sādhakaretaśca sā nārī kālikā svayam |
bhrāntistatra na kartavyā yadi muktiñca kāṃkṣatiḥ || 33 ||

yā nārī bhaktisaṃyuktā sā gā kālikā tanau |
sādhakañca śivaṃ kṛtvā (gh: sādhakasya śivaṃ jñātvā) 
vīparītena toṣaṇāt || 34 ||

nigamānande (-)

dinatrayaṃ parityajya dine ṣoḍaśa madhyake |
pañcagavyena saṃśuddhiṃ ramaṇañcācaret tataḥ || 35 ||

puṣpaṃ dṛṣṭvā yadā deva tadā tattvena pūjayet |
śukrāktarūdhireṇaiva pūjayediṣṭadevatām || 36 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse caturviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[pañcaviṃśollāsaḥ]

athāśuddhamadyasya doṣakathanam |

gautamīye (-)

aśodhitaṃ hi yandyaṃ mahāpāpakaraṃ param |
śodhitaṃ tatparaṃ madyaṃ pāpanāśakaraṃ param || 1 ||

avidhānena yatpānaṃ paśupānamudīritam |
tatpānaṃ parameśāni kevalaṃ duḥkhadāyakam || 2 ||

kulārṇave śrīdevyuvāca (-)

madyapāne vidhānaṃ kiṃ kathaya prāṇavallabha |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tava snehena vaddho'haṃ vidhānaṃ kathayāmyaham |
śuddhaṃ kṛtvā pivenmadyaṃ devatāprītipūrvakam || 3 ||

atha madyaśuddhiḥ |

kālikākulasarvasve (-)

upaviśyāsane śuddhe (j: mantrī) prāṅmukho vāpyudaṅmukhaḥ |
sanmukhe vāmabhāge vā maṇḍalaṃ caturasrakam || 4 ||

tatra saṃsthāpayet kumbhaṃ devatāprītipūrvakam |
svakīyavāmabhāge tu ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vindumadhyagam || 5 ||

caturasraṃ likhed bhūmau gandhapuṣpeṇa pūjayet |
ādhāraśaktiṃ māyādyaṃ ṅeyutaṃ parameśvari (gh, j: ṅeyutañca 
namo'ntakam) || 6 ||

<p. 95>

mantrastu |

hrīṃ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ |

tatra kumbhaṃ hi saṃsthāpya pūjayenmanunā śive |
praṇavaṃ vahnibījañca ṅeyutaṃ vahnimaṇḍalam |
daśakaletipadaṃ dattvā (ch: kṛtvā) tadante cātmane namaḥ || 7 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ raṃ (gh, j: maṃ) vahnimaṇḍalāya daśakalātmane namaḥ |
tatrādhāre sthitaṃ kumbhaṃ bhūṣayedraktavastrakaiḥ |
kalase pūjayedvīraḥ sakalaṃ sūryamaṇḍalam || 8 ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya aṃ sūryamaṇḍalāya ca |
dvādaśeti padaṃ dattvā namo'nte'pi kalātmane || 9 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ aṃ sūryamaṇḍalāya dvādaśakalātmane namaḥ |
tatastu kāraṇaṃ divyaṃ ghaṭe'pi sthāpayettataḥ || 10 ||

veṣṭitaṃ raktavastreṇa raktapuṣpeṇa bhūṣitam |
maṇḍale kalase dravye vahnyarkasomamaṇḍalam |
vibhāvya manasā mantrī pūjayedbahuyatnataḥ || 11 ||

atha kalasapramāṇam |

toḍale (-)

yonyākāraṃ mukhaṃ bhadre vartulaṃ vā manoharam |
khaṇḍitaṃ sphuṭitaṃ bhagnaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ parityajet || 12 ||

<p. 96>

nāti hrasvaṃ nāti dīrghaṃ sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ priye (gh: 
rajatodbhavaṃ) |
tāmraṃ vā bhūmayaṃ vāpi kevalaṃ lauhavarjitam || 13 ||

madyena pūrayet kumbhaṃ mūlamantraṃ samuccaran |
tatra madhye yajed vīraḥ sakalaṃ somamaṇḍalam || 14 ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya uṃ somamaṇḍalāya ca |
ṣoḍaśeti padaṃ dattvā namo'nte'pi kalātmane || 15 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ uṃ somamaṇḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane namaḥ |
darbhaiḥ saṃtāḍya taddravyaṃ huṅkāreṇāvaguṇṭhitam |
pradarśeyeddhenumudrāṃ vaṃ varṇena ca sādhakaḥ || 16 ||

namo gandhaṃ samādāya oṃkāreṇa pradāpayet |
hsauḥ hkṣau(/) namo jñātvā hsauḥ saṃlikhya kāraṇe || 17 ||

akathādikrameṇaiva trirekhāṃ parikalpayet |
halakṣañca likhet koṇe hsauḥ hkṣau(/) tasya (j: ca) madhyage || 18 ||

atha hsauḥ mantralakṣaṇam |

nārāyaṇītantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

vyañjanaṃ puruṣaṃ deva svarañca śaktimīritam |
eka (-) śaktau mahādeva dviliṅgaṃ kena saṃyutam || 19 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

ekaliṅgaṃ mahāsūkṣmaṃ ha(-)kāraṃ mantramadhyagam |
sa(-)kāraṃ sthūlaliṅgaśca hakārasyāpi madhyagam || 20 ||

caturdaśa(-)svareṇāpi dvidehamekadehakam |
svareṇa ṣoḍaśenāpi kalā ṣoḍaśa varddhitā || 21 ||

<p. 97>

kṣayapūrṇaṃ parityajya (k, g, c: parityajyaṃ) caturdaśa vibhūṣitam |
hsauḥ mantramidaṃ proktaṃ visargaḥ karmabhāṣitaḥ || 22 ||

nādasyārddhaṃ (gh, j: nādarūpaṃ) hakārārddhaṃ yantrasthānaṃ 
prakāśitam |
tatra madhye mahāliṅgaṃ hakārasyāpi śeṣakam || 23 ||

tasyādhaḥ śaktisaṃyuktaṃ sakāraṃ puṃstvabodhakam (j: 
pūrṇabodhakam) |
caturdaśa svaraṃ jñeyamubhayoḥ karāpādakam || 24 ||

trayodaśa karaṃ jñeyaṃ caturdaśa padaṃ śive |
visargaḥ parameśāni kāmātmānaṃ vicintayet || 25 ||

hakāreṇa sakārāktaṃ sakāreṇa hakārakam |
anayoḥ sūkṣmatā yatra praṇavo'bhūccaturdaśaḥ || 26 ||

vindvarddhaṃ bindumekañca vindvarddhañca kalā parā |
trivargasya dvitīyārṇaṃ kalānādena bhāṣitam |
tatramadhye mahāśūnyaṃ praṇavaṃvedabhāṣitam || 27 ||

nigamānande śrīśiva uvāca (-)

tvaṃ devi paramā nityā bhogamokṣapradāyikā (gh: pradāyinī) |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi hkṣau(/) mantrasya lakṣaṇam || 28 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

ha(-)kāraṃ śivabījaṃ hi ṣakāraṃ rajasātmakam |
ka(-)kāreṇa ṣakāraṃ hi kṣa(-)kāraṃ kāmalālitam (gh, j: 
kamalānvitam) |
caturdaśa(-)svaropetaṃ hkṣau(/) mantraṃ prakīrtitam |
śivaśaktimayaṃ mantraṃ rajobhāvena bhāṣitam |
ṣakāraṃ rajobhāvena ha(-)kāraṃ rajobhāṣitam || 30 ||

<p. 98>

triḥ śa(-)kāraṃ śaktirūpaṃ guṇatrayavibhūṣitam |
sattvaṃ rajastamo jñeyamekaśaktestridhā parā (j: strikāraṇam) || 31 ||

kulārṇave (-)

trikoṇaṃ tadvahirnyasya mantradvau daśadhā (ch, j: mantraṃ 
dvādaśadhā) japet |
mantrastu |

hrīṃ klīṃ paramasvāmini paramākāśaśūnyavāhini
candrasūryāgnibhakṣiṇi pātraṃ viśa svāhā |
ai(/) hrīṃ śrīṃ ānandeśvarāya vidmahe sudhādevyai(-)
dhīmahi tannorddha(-)nārīśvaraḥ pracodayāt |

tataḥ śāpamocanaṃ kuryāt |

oṃ ekameva paraṃ brahma sthūlasūkṣmamayaṃ dhruvam |
kacodbhavāṃ brahmahatyāṃ tena tenāśayāmyaham || 32 ||

oṃ sūryamaṇḍalasambhūte varuṇālayasambhave |
amāvījamaye devi śukraśāpādvimucyatām || 33 ||

oṃ vedānāṃ praṇavo bījaṃ brahmānandamayaṃ yadi |
tena satyena te devi brahmahatyāṃ vyapohatu || 34 ||

mantratrayaṃ ghaṭaṃ dhṛtvā paṭhitvāpi trivārakam |
kṛṣṇaśāpaṃ śukraśāpaṃ brahmaśāpaṃ vimocayet || 35 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

surāpānena deveśa devatvaṃ hi bhaviṣyati |
tataśca bījaṃ madyaṃ hi tatra śāpaṃ kathaṃ vada || 36 ||

<p. 99>

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

gautamīye (-)

amṛtaṃ śaktisaṃyuktaṃ śaktihīnaṃ hi mādakam |
śaktihīne madyapāne śukro brahmā janārdanaḥ || 37 ||

guṇaṃ dravyasya saṃbhrāmya śāpaṃ dadyāt sanātani |
tataśca parameśāni śāpaṃ tyajya pivenmadhu || 38 ||

pratyekaṃ daśadhā mantraṃ kāraṇe'pi japettataḥ |
śāpādimocanaṃ dravyaṃ devānāmapi durlabham || 39 ||

atha śāpamocanam |

brahmaśāpaṃ śukraśāpaṃ kṛṣṇaśāpaṃ maheśvari |
mocanārthe tridhā mantraṃ daśadhā kāraṇe japet || 40 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ vāṃ vīṃ vūṃ vaiṃ vauṃ vaḥ brahmaśāpavimocitāyai 
sudhādevyai namaḥ |
iti brahmaśāpamocanam |
oṃ śāṃ śīṃ śūṃ śaiṃ śauṃ śaḥ śukraśāpavimocitāyai 
sudhādevyai namaḥ | iti śukraśāpamocanam |
oṃ hrī(/) ai(/) hrī(/) śrīṃ krāṃ krīṃ krūṃ kraiṃ krauṃ kraḥ sudhe 
kṛṣṇaśāpaṃ mocaya, amṛtaṃ śrāvaya śrāvaya svāhā | (ch, j: 
klā(/) klī(/) klū(/) kla(/) klau(/) klaḥ iti ca pāṭhaḥ) iti kṛṣṇaśāpamocanam |

<p. 100>

vīra tantre (-)

ānandabhairavaṃ dhyātvā tathaivānandabhairavīm (gh: 
tathānandākhyabhairavīṃ) |
dravyamadhye gandhapiṣpairyajed vīrastrivārakam || 41 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse pañcaviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ṣaḍviṃśollāsaḥ] |

vīratantre tathaivānandabhairavī (-) |
dhyānaṃ me paramānandaṃ kathaya prāṇavallabha || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

athānandabhairavadhyānam |

sūryakoṭipratīkāśaṃ candrakoṭisuśītalam |
aṣṭādaśabhujaṃ devaṃ pañcavaktraṃ trilocanam || 2 ||

amṛtārṇavamadhyasthaṃ brahmapadmoparisthitam |
vṛṣāruḍhaṃ nīlakaṇṭhaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 3 ||

kapālakhaṭvāṅgadharaṃ ghaṇṭāḍamaruvādinam |
pāśāṅkuśadharaṃ devaṃ gadāmusaladhāriṇam || 4 ||

khaḍgakheṭakapaṭṭiśamudgaraṃ śūladaṇḍakam |
vibhrataṃ tomaraṃ muṇḍaṃ varadābhayapāṇikam || 5 ||

<p. 101>

lohitaṃ devadeveśaṃ bhāvayet sādhakottamaḥ |
iti dhyātvā dravyamadhye yajedānandabhairavam || 6 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ ha sa kṣa ma la va ra yūṃ ānandabhairavāya vaṣaṭ |
trivāraṃ pūjayedādau bhairavaṃ bhairavīṃ tataḥ |
bhairavī madyasaṃrupā bhairavānandarupakaḥ || 7 ||

athānandabhairavīdhyānam |

bhāvayecca surāṃ devīm (ch, j: sudhādevīṃ) 
candrakoṭyayutaprabhām (ch, j: candrakoṭisamaprabhāṃ) |
himamundendudhavalāṃ pañcavaktrāṃ trilocanām || 8 ||

aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ sarvānandakarodyatām |
grahasantīṃ viśālākṣīṃ devadevasya sammukhīm || 9 ||

iti dhyātvā trivāraṃ pūjayet |

mantrastu |

oṃ ha sa kṣa ma la va ra yīṃ sudhādevyai (ch: ānandabhairavyai) vauṣaṭ 
|
trivāraṃ pūjayeddevīṃ guṇatrayavibhedataḥ || 10 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

athavānyaprakāreṇa dravyaśuddhiṃ vadāmyaham |

nigamakalpadrume śrīśiva uvāca (-)

dravyaśuddhiṃ bahuvidhaṃ nānābhāvasya sammatam |
janmāntara śatenāpi jñāpituṃ naiva śakyate |
teṣāṃ madhye sādhako'pi kena vā sādhanañcaret || 11 ||

<p. 102>

atha sakṣepaśodhanam |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

dravyamadhye mātṛkārṇaṃ savindu sukhamokṣadam |
prativarṇaṃ vinduyuktaṃ bindunāda vibhūṣitam || 12 ||

vāmāvarte'pi (g: vāmāvartena) tadvarṇaṃ trikoṇeṣu maheśvara |
vilikhet trikoṇākāramakathādi (j: trikoṇarupam) krameṇa tu || 13 ||

vāmāvarte likhedvarṇaṃ pañcāśanmaṇimaṇḍalam |
ha la kṣaṃ tattrikoṇeṣu brahma viṣṇu śivātmakam || 14 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kasmin koṇe vased brahmā kasmin koṇe janārdanaḥ |
kasmin koṇe vaset śambhuḥ kathaya prāṇavallabhe || 15 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

ādikoṇe'pyadhobhāge brahmā ca sṛṣṭirupakaḥ (ch: -kārakaḥ) |
madhyakoṇe vasedviṣṇuḥ pālako'pi nirañjanaḥ |
antyakoṇe mahādevaḥ prakṛtyāpyekadehakaḥ || 16 ||

athānyaprakāradravyaśuddhiḥ |

vindurupaḥ śivo jñeyo nādarupāca caṇḍikā |
nādabindumayaṃ pīṭhaṃ dravyamadhye likhedbudhaḥ || 17 ||

trinādañca triśaktyāktaṃ trivindu tridevaṃ param (gh: trideva(-)priya; j: 
triśivaṃ priye) |
likhitvā cintayeddravyaṃ mṛtabhāva(-)vivarjitam || 18 ||

athānyaprakāramāha (-)

guroḥ prakāśaṃ yanmantraṃ nityaṃ japati sādhakaḥ |
tenaiva manunā deva dravyaṃ saptābhimantritam |
saptavārajapenaiva dravyaśuddhistu tatkṣaṇāt || 19 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse ṣaḍviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||



[saptaviṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha māṃsalakṣaṇam |

kularahasye (-)

aiśvaryadāyakaṃ madyaṃ maithunaṃ muktidāyakam |
ubhayoḥ kāraṇaṃ jñeyaṃ guṇatrayamahat (j: -mayaṃ) param || 1 ||

māṃsaṃ matsyaṃ hi mudrāñca triguṇaṃ parikīrtitam |
kāraṇasya kāraṇaṃ hi ramaṇasya mahat sukham (gh: guṇatrayamahat 
sukham) || 2 ||

māṃsañca trividhaṃ proktaṃ jalabhūcarakhecaram |
kapotakasya chāgasya kūrmasya parameśvari || 3 ||

trividhānyeva māṃsāni viyadbhūjalacarāṇi ca |
ānīya tāni yatnena devyāḥ santuṣṭahetave || 4 ||

<p. 104>

yāmale (-)

trividhānyeva māṃsāni viyadbhūjalacarāṇi ca |
ānīya tāni yatnena devyai coddiśya ghātayet || 5 ||

devyudeśe ghātanācca nāsti pātakamambike (j: pātakaṃ nāsti 
sundari) |
anyathā ghātanāddevi rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet || 6 ||

kulārṇave (-)

ātmārthe prāṇināṃ hiṃsā kadācinnoditā priye |
pitṛdaivatayajñeṣu prāṇihiṃsā vidhīyate || 7 ||

avidhānena yo hanyāt prāṇinaṃ (g, c: prāṇināṃ) parameśvari |
viṣame durgame ghore etatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 8 ||

animittaṃ tṛṇaṃ (k, g, ch: eṇaṃ) vāpi chedayenna kadācana |
devatārthe dvijārthe vā hatvā pāpairna lipyate || 9 ||

jñānadvīpe (-)

tṛṇaṃmapyavidhānena chedayenna kadācana |
devatārthe dvijārthe vā hatvā pāpairnalipyate || 10 ||

vidhināpi dvijaṃ gāmbā hatvā pāpairna lipyate |
tathāpi parameśāni jñānināṃ na śubhapradam |
pañcatattvasya māhātmyaṃ phalañca pañcadhā yataḥ || 11 ||

atha māṃsaśuddhiḥ |

maṇḍale sthāpitaṃ māṃsaṃ kiñciddravyaṃ pravikṣipet |
trivāraṃ paṭhanāt mantraṃ māṃsaśuddhistu tatkṣaṇāt || 12 ||

<p. 105>

mantrastu |

oṃ pratadviṣṇuḥ stavate vīryeṇa mṛgo na bhīmaḥ kucaro giriṣṭhāḥ |
yasyoruṣu triṣu vikramaṇeṣvadhikṣiyanti bhuvanāni viśvā || 13 ||

iti mantraṃ maheśāni māṃsopari tridhā paṭhet (gh: japet) |
madyayuktaṃ māṃsakhaṇḍaṃ śaktivaktre pradāpayet (gh: nivedayet) 
|| 14 ||

atha matsyalakṣaṇam |

kulatatvasāre (-)

illiśaṃ kabajīṃ śālaṃ vācāṃ śakunaproṣṭhikām |
sadgurañcaiva vodālaṃ rohitaṃ cottamaṃ priye || 15 ||

anyāni yāni matsyāni strīṇāṃ priyakarāṇi ca |
śodhitaṃ cet pradātavyaṃ śaktivaktre maheśvari || 16 ||

matsyaṃ māṃsaṃ pradātavyaṃ bharjitaṃ hi viśeṣakam |
tasmāt praśastakaṃ jñeyaṃ dagdhaṃ hi varavarṇini || 17 ||

tantrāntare (-)

māṃsaṃ matsyaṃ śodhitavyaṃ strīṇāṃ priyakaraṃ yadi (ja: param) 
|
śaktivaktre pradātavyaṃ kāraṇena samanvitam || 18 ||

atha mīnaśuddhiḥ |

oṃ tryambakaṃ yajāmahe sugandhiṃ puṣṭivarddhanam |
urvārukamiva bandhanān mṛtyormukṣīyamāmṛtāt || 19 ||

maṇḍale sthāpayenmīnaṃ prakṣipet kāraṇaiḥ (j: kāraṇe) priye |
trivāraṃ paṭhanānmantraṃ mīnaśuddhistu tatkṣaṇāt || 20 ||

<p. 106>

atha mudrālakṣaṇam |

brīhiṇaṃ bharjitaṃ (ch: bhuñjitaṃ) proktaṃ śarkarādyaiḥ 
suvāsitam |
yonipadmakadambeti lakṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitam || 21 ||

anyāni dravyāṇi bharjitatāni (ch: bhuñjitāni) maheśvari |
iti mudrā śodhitaṃ cet devyāḥ prītikarā parā || 22 ||

dhānyaṃ bhraṣṭaṃ vahniyogaiścarvaṇīyaṃ maheśvari |
iti mudrā kṛtā saṃjñā mahāmodapradāyinī || 23 ||

atha mudrāśuddhiḥ |

maṇḍale sthāpayenmudrāṃ prakṣipet kāraṇena tu |
mantradvayaṃ tridhā japtvā mudrāśuddhistu tatkṣaṇāt || 24 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ sadā paśyanti sūrayaḥ divīva 
cakṣurātam || 1 ||

oṃ tad viprāso vipanya vipanyavo jāgṛvāṃsaḥ samindhate, viṣṇoryat 
paramaṃ padam || 2 ||

iti mudrāśuddhiḥ ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvvollāse saptaviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[aṣṭāviṃśollāsaḥ] |

kulārṇave (-)

dravyabhārasahasreṇa māṃsabhāraśatena (c, ch(-)śatāni) ca |
vinā śaktiṃ na siddhyeta tasmāt śaktiṃ samāśrayet || 1 ||

atha śaktilakṣaṇam |

yāmale (-)

svaśaktiṃ para (gh, ch, j: vīra) śaktiṃ vā dīkṣitāṃ gurusannidhau |
tatra sthitā devatātmā sā śaktiḥ sarvapūjitā || 2 ||

śaktimānīya yatnena suśīlāṃ priyavādinīm |
gurīragre svavāme vā raktavastreṇa bhūṣitām |
tataśca sādhakaḥ śreṣṭho mūṣayedbahubhūṣaṇaiḥ || 3 ||

vṛhad yonitantre (-)

ānīya pramadāṃ kāntāṃ suśīlāṃ cāruhāsinīm |
gurubhaktiratāṃ devi kulasādhanatatparām || 4 ||

dīkṣitāṃ parakāntāṃ vā svakīyāmbā maheśvari |
tattvānandayutāṃ śaktiṃ paratattveṣu lālitām |
ānīya bahuyatnena jātibhedaṃ na cācaret || 5 ||

vivarjitaghṛṇālajjāṃ sarvadānandasaṃyutām |
athavā pānasaṃhṛṣṭāṃ cakramadhye samānayet || 6 ||

kālikākalpe (-)

sveṣṭadevīṃ yajet cakre svastriyaṃ sveṣṭabhāvinīm |
athavā strīsamīpe vā yantraṃ kṛtvā prapūjayet || 7 ||

<p. 108>

tantrāntare (-)

striyaḥ pūjā prakartavyā jñātvā sveṣṭasvarūpiṇīm |
tatsamīpe kṛtaṃ yantraṃ tadājñābhāvamānataḥ || 8 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

strīsamīpe yadā (gh: kṛtā) pūjā japaśca parameśvari |
kāmarūpāt śataguṇaṃḥ samudīritamavyayam || 9 ||

śaktidoṣaṃ na vaktavyaṃ yato devasvarūpiṇī |
kulaniṣṭhaśca vipraśca tasyāḥ śuddhiṃ na cācaret || 10 ||

svaśaktiśodhanaṃ nāsti caikātmāpyubhayoryataḥ |
śodhayet paraśaktiñca dvitvātmaikatvahetave || 11 ||

sādhyātmā (gh: sā sādhyā) sādhakātmā ced yadaikātmā 
bhavenmūdā |
tadā śuddhirna kartavyā gaṅgāghanajalaṃ (gh, j: 
gaṅgāyāmanadhaṃ) yathā || 12 ||

prāyaścittaṃ prakartavyaṃ gaṅgā yatra na tiṣṭhati |
śaktiśuddhiḥ prakartavyā yadaikātmā na cet śive || 13 ||

sādhyā sādhakayordevi yadaikātmā maheśvari |
ātmaśuddhe (j: ātmaśuddhiḥ) śaktiśuddhistasya siddhidūrataḥ || 14 ||

nigamakalpe śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

ekācārī ekabhāvī ekānandeṣu mohitaḥ |
śakterdoṣaṃ tadā kutra svayaṃ tatraiva saṃlayaḥ || 15 ||

ajñātvā kulatattvañca śaktiśuddhiṃ samācaret |
yasya jñānasya mātreṇa pūrṇānando bhaveddhruvam |
tasya śuddhiḥ kathaṃ bhadre manasā cintanaṃ (g: cintaya) yadi || 16 ||

<p. 109>

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kulasya dakṣiṇe vāme madhye ca parameśvara |
jāhnavī yamunā vāṇī (g: vāri) sadā bhātīti jñānataḥ || 17 ||

etairviśiṣṭā śaktiḥ syāt śarīraṃ devatāmayam |
sāśuddhiśced bhaveddeva tadāśuddhiśca devatā || 18 ||

ajñānināṃ sadā śuddhirmantrādinā maheśvara |
manasā cet na śuddhiḥ syānmantraśuddhiḥ sudūrataḥ || 19 ||

kālītantre (-)

adīkṣitā ca yā śaktiścakramadhye prapūjayet |
pūrṇacakraṃ nacet tatra pūrṇānandaṃ naced yataḥ || 20 ||

tasmāt sulakṣaṇāṃ śaktiṃ dīkṣitāñca prapūjayet |
praṇamya devatāvuddhyā bhogapātraṃ pradāpayet || 21 ||

bhogapātraṃ na dātavyaṃ vidhavāyai maheśvari |
uccastanīṃ kāmaratāṃ vidhavāñca prapūjayet || 22 ||

yo dadyād vidhavāhaste bhogapātraṃ maheśvari |
tasyā yoniṃ laṅghayitvā tattvaṃ devyai nivedayet || 23 ||

śaṅkayā parameśāni lajjayā nācaret kriyām |
ubhau ca duḥkhau parame paśupāśaniyantritau || 24 ||

vidhavāyoniramaṇaṃ kārayecca tadājñayā |
śukrapātaṃ prakartavyaṃ tasyā vākyānusārataḥ || 25 ||

yāvanna śukrapātaṃ hi vidhavāyonimaṇḍale |
tāvacca ramaṇaṃ kuryāt patanānte parityajet || 26 ||

<p. 110>

śukrapāte yadā śakterājñā naiva prajāyate |
nivedya kāraṇāktaṃ hi bhakṣayenmanunā śive || 27 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse aṣṭāviṃśatyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ūnatriṃśollāsaḥ] |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

śaktiṃ brahmamayīṃ sādhvīṃ nispṛhāṃ bhaktavatsalām (ch, j: 
bhaktivatsalāṃ) |
tasyā dīkṣā kathaṃ proktā vidhavā vā kathaṃ vada || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

ānandarahitā śaktirvidhā cāpyadīkṣitā |
ānandena bhavet pūjyā sānandā vīravanditā || 2 ||

tatra kṛtvā mahācakraṃ kareṇa (gh: kāraṇe) mārjayedvapuḥ |
dīkṣitā sadhavā jñeyā yadyānandasamāśritā || 3 ||

vīrabhāvayutā śaktiḥ śivapatnī maheśvari |
vīrabhāvayutaḥ śāktaḥ śiva eva na saṃśayaḥ |
śivo'hamiti saṃjñātvā śrīcakreṣu ramet śivām || 4 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

ātmānande mahādevi sarvānandamayaṃ jatat |
ātmaśuddhe jagat śuddhamaśuddhe cāpyaśuddhakam || 5 ||

<p. 111>

nārāyaṇītantre (-)

śaktiśuddhirna kartavyā yato brahma (k, kh, g, c: deva; j: devī) 
svarūpiṇī |
ātmā'śuddhe'pyaśuddhā sā sphāṭike rañjanaṃ yathā || 6 ||

tathāpi śuddhaṃ kartavyaṃ paśupāśaniyantritaḥ |
śakterdoṣaṃ mahādevi gṛhṇāti naiva sādhakaḥ || 7 ||

tava rūpāpi śaktiḥ syāt yato muktipradāyikā |
bhogamuktānvitaḥ śāktaḥ (gh, j: bhogamuktānvitā śaktiḥ) 
śakterdoṣaṃ na cācaret || 8 ||

śrīkālītantre (-) (gh, j: pustakayordṛśyate)  

strīdveṣo naiva kartavyo viśeṣāt pūjanaṃ striyām |
tāsāṃ prahāraṃ nindāñca kauṭilyamapriyantathā || 9 ||

sarvathāpi na kartavyamanyathā siddhirodhakṛt |
striyo devāḥ striyaḥ prāṇā eva vibhūṣaṇam || 10 ||

strīsaṅginā sadā bhāvyamanyathā svastriyāmapi |
taddhastāvacitaṃ puṣpaṃ taddhastāvacitaṃ jalam || 11 ||

taddhastāvacitaṃ dravyaṃ devatābhyo nivedayet |
mahācīnadrumalatāveṣṭitaḥ sādhakottamaḥ || 12 ||

rātrau yadi japenmantraṃ durlabhaṃ tasya kiṃ bhavet |
mahācīnadrumalatāveṣṭanena ca yatphalam || 13 ||

etasya ṣoḍaśāṃśena kalāṃ nārhanti te śavāḥ |
śavāsanādhikaphalaṃ latāgehe praveśanam || 14 ||

<p. 112>

bhogārthī śodhayet śaktiṃ bhogānandeṣu mohitaḥ |
ālāpād gātrasaṃsparśāt kāmānde'pi mohitā (j: kāmānandeṣu 
mohitaḥ) |
kāmānandaṃ vinā devi bhogamuktirna jāyate || 15 ||

jñānināñcedimāṃ śuddhimajñānināñca mantrajām |
tathāpi jñānināṃ madhye jñāna śreṣṭho'pi yo naraḥ |
śaktiśuddhirna kartavyā yataḥ sveṣṭamayī priye || 16 ||

atha śaktiśuddhiḥ |

prakṣālya gandhatoyaiśca dhūpayitvā sudhūpakaiḥ |
sindūrarañjitāṃ kṛtvā mūlamantraṃ likhed bhage || 17 ||

adīkṣitāḥ striyaḥ kuryāt sadyasaṃskāramambike |
mantradīkṣaḥ vidhānena śaktiśuddhistu tatkṣaṇāt || 18 ||

kulārṇave (-)

adīkṣitā vāmakarṇe māyābījaṃ samuddharet |
pūjayitvā maheśāni bhogapātraṃ pradāpayet || 19 ||

yāmaloktaśuddhiḥ |

śaktigātre svakalpoktanyāsajālaṃ samācaret |
raktapuṣpeṇa nirmañjya (gh: nirmajya) yonideśe niyojayet || 20 ||

oṃ namo vāgbhavaṃ bījaṃ māyālakṣmīṃ tataḥ param |
sambodhanāntaṃ tripurādevīti padamuddhṛtam (gh, j: -uddharet) 21 ||

imāṃ (ch: imāṃ śaktiṃ paritrāṇaṃ kru kuru mama śaktiṃ kuru 
kuru svāhā iti daśadhā japet) śaktiṃ tataḥ proktā pavitrīkuru 
śabdataḥ |
mama śaktiṃ kuru dvandvaṃ svāheti daśadhā japet || 22 ||

<p. 113>

(*) (mantrastu (-) oṃ krīṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ tripurādevi imāṃ śaktiṃ 
pavitrīkuru mama śaktiṃ kuru kuru svāhā)
pañcatattvena tāṃ devīṃ pūjayedvidhinā śive |
bhogapātraṃ yadā deyaṃ tadā ramaṇamācaret || 23 ||

guptasādhanatantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

dravyādiśodhanaṃ sarvaṃ bahudhā prakaṭīkṛtam |
lokopakārakāt (j: -kārakaṃ)  śuddhaṃ saṃkṣepeṇa vada prabho || 24 
||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

guru (j: guroḥ) prakāśaṃ yanmantraṃ nityaṃ japati vai naraḥ (gh, j: 
sādhakaḥ) |
tenaiva manunā devi ṣaḍaṅge (gh, j: ṣaḍaṅgaṃ) nyāsamācaret || 25 ||

nyāsaṃ kṛtvā tato mantrī dravyādīnabhimantrayet |
saptatirmantritaṃ kṛtvā pūtaṃ sarvaṃ bhaved dhruvam || 26 ||

guruṃ śivaṃ tathā devīṃ nivedyañcaiva kāraṇam |
juhuyāt kuṇḍalīvaktre mūlamantreṇa sundari || 27 ||

mūlādhāre sthitā devi kuṇḍalī paradevatā |
bhogakāle maheśāni ājihvāntaṃ vibhāvayet || 28 ||

śodhitān matsyamāṃsādīn mukhenācchādya yatnataḥ |
mūlamantraṃ samuccārya juhuyāt kuṇḍalīmukhe || 29 ||

pratipātre pratigrāse evaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
bhojanecchā bhavettasyā nirlipto jīvasaṃjñakaḥ || 30 ||

<p. 114>

(*)(kulapūjāvināśārthaṃ yaḥ karoti hi durmatiḥ |
prayāti narakaṃ ghoramekaviṃśakulaiḥ saha || 31 ||

devān pitṝn samabhyarcya kulaśāstroktavartmanā |
guruṃ smaran pivenmadyaṃ khādan māṃsaṃ na doṣabhāk || 32 ||

sevayet cet sukhārthāya madyādīn yaḥ sa pātakī |
prāśayeddevatāprītyai sābhilāṣavivarjitaḥ || 33 ||)

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ūnatriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[triṃśollāsaḥ] |

samayācāratantre (-)

sambidāgrahaṇaṃ kṛtvā kāraṇaṃ tadanantaram |
kāraṇasya kāraṇaṃ hi sambideti prakalpitam || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

sambidā kā mahādeva kāraṇaṃ kiṃ (g, c: hi) vada prabho |
kasmāt pānaṃ kāraṇaṃ hi sambidānandabhāk naraḥ || 2 ||

atha sambidāprakaraṇam |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

bhāvaśakto'pyaśaktaśca sādhako dvividhaḥ śive |
bhāvāktaṃ sambidānandaṃ madyānandamabhedakam || 3 ||

<p. 115>

bhāvena bhāvyavān (ch: bhāgyavān) bhadre bhāvānandeṣu mohitaḥ 
|
bhāvānandeṣu deveśi muktibhāg jāyate naraḥ || 4 ||

ādyante sambidāpānaṃ kāraṇasya maheśvari |
tadā kaivalyamuktiḥ syāt satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 5 ||

sālokyañcaiva sārūpyaṃ sāyujyaṃ parameśvari |
idaṃ jñānaṃ sambidotthaṃ muktyarthamubhayānvitam || 6 ||

nigamatatve śrīdevyuvāca (-)

ānandaṃ brahmaṇe rūpaṃ yasya dehe vyavasthitam |
tasya sarvaṃ maheśāna siddhyānanda (gh, c, j: siddhānanda; ch: 
sadānanda) pradāyakam || 7 ||

vinānandena (gh: vināmadyena) yaddhyānaṃ sarvaṃ bhavati 
niṣphalam |
ata eva mahādeva sambidāgrahaṇañcaret || 8 ||

yatirvā bhūpatirvāpi madyānandaṃ samāśrayet |
sarvadā parameśāna siddhyānandaṃ kvacit kvacit || 9 ||

anyeṣāṃ sādhakānāñca sambidānandavardhinī (ch, j: sarvadā) |
madyānandaṃ kvacid deva parvaṇi madhupānayuk || 10 ||

kṛṣṇapakṣe pivenmadyaṃ śukle siddhiṃ pivenmudā |
śukle yadi pivenmadyaṃ ādyante sambidāṃ pivet || 11 ||

tantrāntare (-)

kṛṣṇe śukle pivenmadyaṃ sambidāsaṃyutaṃ śive |
śukle cādyaṃ pivet siddhiṃ kṛṣṇe cādyaṃ pivenmadhu || 12 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

sattvodbhavaṃ sambidāyā madyasya rājasodbhavam |
tvaritāyāstamodbhūtamityānandasya lakṣaṇam || 13 ||

<p. 116>

bhāvamātraṃ kriyātyaktaṃ (ch: kriyetyuktaṃ; j: kriyāyuktaṃ) 
sattve'pi parameśvari |
rājasīti kriyāśaktastāmasīti kriyācyutaḥ || 14 ||

śaktiṃ vinā yathānandaṃ madyasya parameśvari |
tathā siddhiṃ vinā devi madyānandaṃ hi niścitam || 15 ||

samayāñca pivedādau tato madyaṃ maheśvari |
tataḥ śaktiṃ yajeccakre tataḥ siddhiṃ pivenmudā || 16 ||

siddhiṃ vinā maheśāni (ch, j: kuleśāni) kulakārye na yogavān |
ata eva pivet siddhiṃ śaktiyukto maheśvari || 17 ||

śaktihīnaṃ hi yatpānaṃ sambideti prakīrtitam |
tadante śaktisaṃyukte sambidā samayā bhavet || 18 ||

ramaṇaṃ hi yadā devi tadā sā vijayā bhavet |
svecchācāre'pi ramaṇaṃ niṣedhavidhivarjitam || 19 ||

tadā sā sambidā devī siddhirupā sanātanī |
śivodbhavaṃ yadā dravyaṃ śaktiḥ saṃhṛhya yatnataḥ || 20 ||

tadā sā sambidā devī bhaṅgarupā priyamvadā |
pañcāṅgasaṃyutāṃ devi sambidāṃ sevayettu yaḥ (j: sevayed) |
ihaloke sukhaṃ bhuktvā yātyante paramāṃ gatim || 21 ||

sambidā samayā devi vijayā siddhireva ca |
bhaṅgaśca parameśāni pañcadhākhyānukīrtitam (ch: 
pañcadhānyānukīrtitam; j: pañcadhānyānukalpitam) |
yaḥ karoti trisandhāyāyāṃ mama tulyo na saṃśayaḥ || 22 ||

bhuktvā tu mādakaṃ dravyaṃ bhavet kulaparāyaṇaḥ |
sādhakaḥ kṣobhamāpanne (ch, j: kṣobhamātreṇa) mama kṣobhaṃ 
bhaved dhruvam || 23 ||

tasmādādau prakartavyaṃ sambidāsevanaṃ śive |
sambidāsavayormadhye sambideva garīyasī || 24 ||

<p. 117>

vijayā (gh, j: samvidā) grahaṇaṃ kṛtvā dhyānaṃ yaḥ kurute naraḥ |
tadā dhyānamayī mūrtiḥ pratyakṣā bhavati dhruvam || 25 ||

ataśca sambidāṃ pītvā kāraṇaṃ hi pivettataḥ |
samvidāsavayormadhye samvideva garīyasī || 26 ||

grahaṇāt mucyate pāptāt dhyānāt siddhirbhaviṣyati |
dhyānena dhyeyaṃ yadrūpaṃ samvidā nitya (j: mukti) dāyikā || 27 ||

yathā nityaṃ gṛhānandaṃ gṛhiṇīsaṃyutaṃ (j: -saṃyutā) tathā (j: 
yadā) |
ānandārthī varārohe ānande (j: ānande) vijayāṃ pivet |
kriyāmārgī kriyāśaktaḥ śuddhe'pi vijayāṃ pivet || 28 ||

atha samvidāśuddhiḥ |

oṃ samvide brahmasambhūte brahmaputri sadānaghe |
bhairavāṇāñca tṛptyarthaṃ pavitrā bhava sarvadā |
oṃ brahmāṇyai (gh, j: brāhmaṇyai) namaḥ svāhā || 29 ||

oṃ siddhimūlāśraye devi hīnavodhaprabodhani |
rājāprajāvaśaṅkari śatrukaṇṭhatriśūlini |
oṃ kṣatriyāyai namaḥ svāhā || 30 ||

oṃ ajñānendhanadīptāgne jñānāgnerjvālarūpiṇi |
ānandasyāhutiṃ prītiṃ samyak jñānaṃ prayaccha me |
hrī(/) vaiśyāyai namaḥ svāhā || 31 ||

oṃ namasyāmi namasyāmi yogamārgapradarśini (ch: pradāyinī) |
trailokyavijaye mātaḥ samādhiphaladā bhava |
klīṃ (ch: hrī/) śūdrāyai namaḥ svāhā || 32 ||

<p. 118>

ānandanandinīnande sadānandapadadvayam |
ullāsānandini kande cidānandasvarūpiṇi || 33 ||

divyā vimarṣiṇī siddhā susiddhā siddhimūlikā (ch: 
susiddhisarvamūlikā) |
rogaghnī paśupāśaghnī kālaghnī bodharupiṇī |
manonmani madhu drākṣā khecarī vijayā jayā || 34 ||

iti stutvā (-)

dhenumudrāṃ yonimudrāṃ pradarśya manunā śive |
mūlañca daśadhā japtvā juhuyāt kuṇḍalīmukhe || 35 ||

śrīnāthāya sveṣṭadevyai sādhakakāya maheśvari |
svamūrddhani pradātavyaṃ manunā ca pivenmudā || 36 ||

pānamantrastu (-)

(atra gh: pustakīyaḥ pāṭhaḥ :,(-)
oṃ bhaṅge bhaṅge mahābhaṅge mahābhairavi māṃ saṃbhāvaya
saṃbhāvaya vada vada vāgvādini mama jihvāgre sthirībhava
sarvaśatruvaśaṅkari svāhā | anena mantreṇa kuṇḍalīmukhe juhuyāt 
|) oṃ bhaṅge bhaṅge mahābhaṅge mahābhaṅge bhairavāṇāṃ
stambhaya stambhaya vada vada vāgvādini mama jihvāgre
sthirībhava sarvaśatruvaśaṅkari svāhā || iti pivet ||

śrīdevyuvāca

caturddhā samvidā proktā jātibhedena bhedataḥ |
samvidā paramā vidyā bhogamokṣapradā śivā || 37 ||

tasyā bhedaṃ jātipāśaṃ kathamuktaṃ sadāśiva |
tasyāḥ śuddhiṃ kathaṃ (gh: asyā aśuddhaṃ kiṃ) deva kathaya 
prāṇavallabha || 38 ||

<p. 119>

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

sādhakasya kriyālopāt jātipāśena bandhitā |
sādhakānāṃ sādhanārthe svayaṃ jātyabhisaṃyutā || 39 ||

suvarṇaiḥ kena deveśi kuṇḍalādiryathātathā |
jñānināṃ jñānabhedena nānārūpā ca samvidā || 40 ||

samvidāyā nacet doṣaṃ guṇo nāsti maheśvari |
dūṣaṇaṃ hi phalāktasya guṇaṃ jñeyaṃ hi tasya tu || 41 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

jñātavyā samvidā devī caturdhā parameśvara |
lakṣaṇaṃ hi tathā stotraṃ mama sthāne prakāśaya || 42 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

brāhmaṇasya śvetapuṣpaṃ paśvācārayuto yadi |
anyathā samvidāṃ vidyāṃ pivedānandahetave || 43 ||

kṣatriyasya raktapuṣpaṃ pītaṃ vaiśyasya pārvati |
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ hi śūdrasya puṣpeṇa jātimānakam |
puṣpabhedena deveśi jātibhedaṃ vicintayet || 44 ||

jñānārṇave śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kā jātirmama nātheśa yadi te mayyanugrahaḥ |
kathaya kathaya devaṃ (gh, j: kathasva mahādeva) hitārtthāya narasya 
ca || 45 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

sva sva jātyāśritaṃ karma jātipāśaṃ prakīrtitam |
karmanaṣṭe jātinaṣṭe'pi muktibhāk || 46 ||

<p. 120>

ānandapaṭale śrīśiva uvāca (-)

dugdhāmbughṛtamādhvīkasaindhavairlavaṇena vā |
sitayātha guḍenāpi pakvaiḥ kadalikairapi || 47 ||

amūlyaṃ madhuraṃ dravyaṃ pakvāmraṃ panasādikam |
tena sarveṇa vijayāṃ svīkuryāt sādhakottamaḥ || 48 ||

dugdhayogena vijayā kevalānandadāyinī (kh: -varddhinī) |
mahātejaskarī cakṣurdoṣādikavināśinī || 49 ||

sā punarjalayogena sarvājīrṇavināśinī |
ghṛtena madhunā dhatte vāgdevīvaśakāriṇī || 50 ||

pratibhāmuttamāṃ dhatte dhiṣaṇāñcātinirmalām |
pittadoṣān śleṣmadoṣān madhunā saha nāśayet || 51 ||

saindhavena mahāvahnipradā syāllavaṇena ca |
sitayātha guḍenaiva śūlaghnī pittanāśinī || 52 ||

atisārāpaśamanī śvāsakāśapramardinī |
āmavātasamudbhūtagrahaṇīvinivāriṇī || 53 ||

sarvaiḥ sumadhurairyuktā sarvāmayavināśinī |
valapuṣṭipradā caiva madhurasvaradāyinī || 54 ||

jñānavijñānadātrī ca śīlamārgapradarśinī |
bahumūtraṃ mūtraghātaṃ śarkarā ca praṇāśinī |
prakāśitaṃ tava snehāt sarvāgameṣu (k: savatantreṣu) gopitam || 55 ||

atha svīkṛtya vijayāṃ sahasrāre guruṃ yajet |
gurumantraṃ samuccārya caturthyantaṃ nivedayet || 56 ||

praṇamed daṇḍavadbhumau japtvā śrīgurupādukām |
iṣṭadevasya tanmantraṃ prajapan viharet kṛtī || 57 ||

<p. 121>

evamabhyāsato devi (gh, j: abhyāsayogena) pratyahaṃ vatsaraṃ tataḥ |
tejasvī valavān vāgmī medhāvī priyadarśanaḥ || 58 ||

rūpa yauvana sampūrṇa nānāguṇa samāśrayaḥ |
bhaviṣyati na sandeho dravyasyāsya niṣevaṇāt || 59 ||

samvidāsavayormadhye samvideva garīyasī |
samvit prayogastenaiva kartavyaḥ sādhakottamaḥ || 60 ||

ekakālaṃ dvikālambā trikālaṃ pañcakālakam |
tolakambā dvitolambā tolakatrayameva vā || 61 ||

anyūnā nādhikā mātrā yathā bhavati nityaśaḥ |
nyūnādhikāyāṃ mātrāyāṃ phalaṃ na syāt kadācana |
tasmāt pramāṇamātrāhi kartavyā siddhimicchatā || 62 ||

etat te kathitaṃ sarvaṃ vijayākalpamuttamam |
prasādādacirādasyāḥ siddhirbhavati vāñchitā || 63 ||

prāvarya veśma śmanasya salabdhakāma
metadrahasyamuditaṃ paramaṃ nigūḍham |
kutrāpi naiva kathanīyamidaṃ kadācid,
devi tvayāpi vidhinā pravidhīyatāṃ tat || 64 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

trailokyavijayāpatraṃ sabījaṃ ghṛtabharjitam |
trikaṭu triphalā śṛṅgī kṛṣṇa (gh, j: kuṣṭhaṃ) dhanyāka saindhavam 
|| 65 ||

śaṭhī tālīśapatrañca kakkolaṃ nāgakeśaram |
yamānīdvayaṃ (gh, j: yamānīdvayaṃ (-) (-) tatsamam, atra pustakayoḥ 
pāṭhāntarametad dṛśyate) methī ca jīrakadvayameva ca |
etāni samabhāgāni raudre śuṣkāṇi cūrṇayet || 66 || 

<p. 122>

gṛhītvā cūrṇameteṣāṃ samvitcūrṇantu tatsamam |
ubhayośca samāṃ datvā sitāṃ tanmiśrayed dṛḍham || 67 ||

miśrayitvā caturthāṃśaṃ samaṃ madhughṛtaṃ tathā |
punaḥ śilātale piṣṭvā trisugandhiñca miśrayet || 68 ||

svarṇādipātre purataḥ sthāpayitvā tataḥ kramāt |
caturbhirmantrabhistāsāṃ śodhanaṃ samupācaret || 69 ||

sevanādasya deveśi kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale |
mantrasiddhistathā pūjājapasiddhirvarānane || 70 ||

jñānasiddhirmaheśāni sevanānmokṣamāpnuyāt |
satyaṃ satyuṃ maheśāni satyameva na saṃśayaḥ || 71 ||

anena pūrṇahṛdayo japapūjāṃ samācaret |
ekoccāraṇamātreṇa tāvacca (gh: bhavecca) lakṣakoṭayaḥ || 72 ||

iti te kathitaṃ kānte sārātsāraṃ parātparam |
yasmai kasmai na dātavyaṃ iti satyaṃ kuru priye || 73 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse triṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ekatriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha śrīcakramadhye sādhakasya pātrādhāralakṣaṇam |

kulārṇave (-)

(pāṭho'yaṃ ch(-) pustake adhiko dṛśyate) ādhāre sthāpayet pātraṃ 
manunā śive |
ādhāre sthāpayet pātraṃ mṛtsthitaṃ mṛtyudāyakam || 1 ||

ādhāraṃ trividhaṃ proktaṃ ṣaṭpadmbā catuṣpadam |
athavā vartulākāraṃ trikoṇaṃ tripadānvitam || 2 ||

atha sādhakasya pātralakṣaṇam |

kulārṇave (-)

pātraṃ kāñcana (-) ratna kāca ghaṭitaṃ muktākapālodbhavam |
viśvāmitramayañca kāmadamidaṃ haimaṃ tathā sphāṭikam || 3 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

trikoṇaṃ maṇḍalaṃ vīraścatuṣkoṇaṃ likhedbhuvi |
ādhāraṃ sthāpayettatra pātraṃ tasyopari nyaset || 4 ||

sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ vāpi kācaṃ mauktikameva ca |
khaḍgañca nārikelañca tāmraṃ jalajameva ca |
pittalaṃ kāṃsyasambhūtaṃ matsyañcaiva ca pārvati || 5 ||

sarvakalyāṇadaṃ proktaṃ sauvarṇaṃ parikīrtitam |
rājatañca varārohe sarvarogavināśanam || 6 ||

abhicāreṣu sarveṣu kācapātraṃ viśiṣyate |
putravṛddhikaraṃ proktaṃ mauktikaṃ parameśvari || 7 ||

<p. 124>

jalajaṃ tu maheśāni bhakti (g: bhukti) mukti phalapradam |
pittalaṃ sarvadoṣaghnaṃ tāmrajaṃ kīrtivarddhanam || 8 ||

mṛnmayañca maheśāni cāsureṣu pradāpayet |
nṛkapālaṃ mahāpālaṃ sarvakārye praśastakam || 9 ||

vārāhī tantre (-)

svarṇa rājata tāmrāṇi sarvasiddhikarāṇi ca |
śāntike prastaraṃ pātraṃ stambhane mṛnmayaṃ śive || 10 ||

pittalaṃ māraṇe jñeyaṃ tāmramuccāṭane śive |
vaśīkārye kāṃsyapātraṃ vidveṣe kācapātrakam |
viśvāmitraṃ mahāpātraṃ sarvakāryeṣu durlabham || 11 ||

akṣayā tantre (-)

svarṇarūpya śilā kūrmma kapālaṃ mṛnmayaṃ priye |
nādikelañca śaṅkhañca pātrañca matsyasambhavam (gh, j: 
matsyañca parameśvari) || 12 ||

vilvavṛkṣasamudbhūtaṃ pātraṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
kāryabhede pātrabhedaṃ kuryāt sādhaka īśvari || 13 ||

mālā (ch, j: māyā) pātraṃ sarvakārye satvaraṃ phaladāyakam |
nṛ kapālasamudbhūtaṃ pātraṃ śuddhaṃ prakīrtitam || 14 ||

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

prāṇināṃ mānuṣaḥ śreṣṭho dharmādharmavibhedavān |
tatkapālakṛtaṃ pātraṃ sarvaṃ tasya vṛthā bhavet || 15 ||

pātraṃ kuryānmaheśāni dharmādharmeṣu mūḍhakaḥ |
tasya muṇḍaṃ svayaṃ chedya mahāpātraṃ prakalpayet || 16 ||

jātyādhamo mahāpāpī yuvāpi vyādhihīnakaḥ |
tasya muṇḍodbhavaṃ pātraṃ mahāpātraṃ prakīrtitam || 17 ||

<p. 125>

mahāpātraṃ mahāmālāmekabhāve prakalpayet |
mahāpātrakṛto rājā yataḥ śāstā maheśvari || 18 ||

svayaṃ chedya kṛtaṃ pātraṃ anyakṛt pātakī bhavet |
yonyākāraṃ hi yat pātraṃ mahāpātrasvarūpakam |
mama prītikaraṃ pātraṃ sādhakaprītidāyakam || 19 ||

yonipātraṃ varārohe mahāpātrottamaṃ śive |
tvāṃ vinā tasya māhātmyaṃ ko vetti jagatītale || 20 ||

yonerdoṣaṃ hi nāstyeva tasyāḥ śuddhiṃ na kārayet |
yonipātraṃ vinā pātraṃ śuddhaṃ kṛtvā pivenmadhu |
aśodhitaṃ hi yat pātraṃ kevalaṃ duḥkhadāyakam || 21 ||

atha pātraśuddhiḥ |

samayācāratantre (-)

pātramātraṃ maheśāni yonipātrānukalpanam |
yonyaśuddhe maheśāni pātramātre'pyuśuddhakam || 22 ||

darśanāt sparśanāt ghrāṇāt sevanānmadhupānataḥ |
sarvaṃ śuddhaṃ bhaveddevi yonijñānaṃ bhaved yadi || 23 ||

mūlena pātraṃ saṃsthāpya mūlena vīkṣaṇaṃ śive |
śaktibījaṃ likhet madhye trikoṇāntargataṃ śive |
pūrayet (gh: pūjayet) kāraṇenāpi mūlena guruvākyataḥ || 24 ||

athavā sarvapātrāṇi sāmānyārghakrameṇa ca |
pūritāni maheśāni kāraṇena maheśvari || 25 ||

iti pātraśuddhiḥ ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ekatriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[dvātriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha śrīcakre sādhakapātrasthāpanam |

yoginītantre (-)

śrīpātrasya paścimāṃśe cakradevasya (gh: devacakrasya) samukhe |
sthāpayet sarvapātrāṇi sāmānyārghakrameṇa tu || 1 ||

kālikākulasarvasve (-)

ghaṭa śrīpātrayormadhye sāmānyārghakrameṇa tu |
sthāpitāni ca pātrāṇi pūrayet kāraṇena tu || 2 ||

atha śrīpātrasthāpanastha niyamaḥ |

śrīpātraṃ sthāpayed vīraḥ sammukhe parameśvari |
pūrvādyaṃ cottarāgraṃ vā divārātrau vibhedataḥ || 3 ||

tantrāntare (-)

sāmānyārghakrameṇaiva kāraṇe pūritāni ca |
uttarāyantu saṃsthāpya paścimāgraṃ maheśvari || 4 ||

nārāyaṇītantr (-)

pūrvāgrañcottarāgraṃ vā divācakraṃ cared (gh: yajed) yadi |
uttarāgraṃ paścimāgraṃ niśācakraṃ cared (gh: yajed) yadi || 5 ||

<p. 127>

atha pātrasya saṃkhyākathanam |

yāmale (-)

navamaṃ saptamaṃ pātraṃ athavā pañca pātrakam |
tripātraṃ parameśāni sthāpayenmanunā śive || 6 ||

atha navapātranāmakathanam |

yāmale (-)

devīpātraṃ guroḥ pātraṃ bhogapātraṃ maheśvari |
yoginī valipātrañca śaktipātraṃ maheśvari || 7 ||

vīrapātraṃ pādyapātraṃ pātramācamanīyakam |
pātraṃ navamamityuktaṃ caturvargaphalapradam || 8 ||

atha saptapātranāmakathanam |

gurupātraṃ bhogapātraṃ śaktipātraṃ maheśvari |
yoginī vīrapātrañca valipādyaṃ hi saptamam || 9 ||

atha pañcapātranāmakathanam |

devīpātraṃ guroḥ pātraṃ bhogapātraṃ trayaṃ śive |
yoginī (-) valipātrañca pañcapātraṃ maheśvari || 10 ||

atha tripātram |

devīpātraṃ bhogapātraṃ guroḥ pātraṃ maheśvari |
tripātrāṇi ca kartavyamekapātraṃ na kārayet || 11 ||

ekapātraṃ na kartavyaṃ yadi sākṣānmaheśvaraḥ |
mantrastasya vṛthā jñeyaḥ śaktikāryaṃ vṛthā yataḥ || 12 ||

ekapātraṃ hi kartavyaṃ svadehaṃ śaktibhāvitam |
niṣedhañca vidhiñcaiva vāmāyāṃ nāsti ced yataḥ || 13 ||

<p. 128>

tathāpi parameśāni jñānī dhyānī na kārayet |
dhyānaniṣṭhasya deveśi gurordhyānaṃ hi bījakam |
gurūpātrodbhavaṃ madyamekapātraṃ pivenmudā || 14 ||

kubjikātantre (-)

ekapātraṃ samādāya yāvadānandabhāg bhavet |
tāvanmadyaṃ pived bhakto yāvat pānaṃ kramāt krmāt || 15 ||

atha kubjikātantroktapātranāmakathanam |

devyāḥ pātraṃ guroḥ bhogapātraṃ trayaṃ matam |
yoginī balipātrañca (pūjāpātrañcātmapātraṃ) 
pañcapātramidaṃ matam || 16 ||

śaktipātraṃ vīrapātraṃ saptapātraṃ maheśvari |
pādyamācamanīyañca navamaṃ parikīrtitam || 17 ||

atha pātradānakramaḥ |

devīpātraṃ daded devyai gurave gurupātrakam |
śaktaye bhogapātrañca pūjāpātrād yajet śivām || 18 ||

kulakuṇḍalinīvaktre cātmapātraṃ niyojayet (gh, j: nivedayet) |
śaktimātre śaktipātraṃ vīrāya vīrapātrakam || 19 ||

śrīpade pādyapātrañca mukhe ācamanīyakam |
śrīpātrādamṛtenanāpi yajedarghādinā priye || 20 ||

yāmale (-)

devyāḥ pātraṃ daded devyai gurave gurupātrakam |
bhogārthaṃ bhogapātrañca śaktaye ca pradāpayet || 21 ||

yoginyai yoginīpātraṃ dadyācca kulanāyike |
vaṭukakṣetrapālebhyo valipātraṃ nivedayet || 22 ||

<p. 129>

śaktaye śaktipātrañca vīrāya vīrapātrakam |
pādyapātraṃ pade (gh: dadet) devyā mukhe ācamanīyakam || 23 ||

anyat sarvaṃ varārohe śrīpātrādamṛtaṃ dadet |
caraṇāmṛtapānārthaṃ caraṇe kāraṇaṃ dadet |
kāraṇaṃ hi bhavet kāryaṃ śrīdevyāścaraṇāmbuje || 24 ||

viṣṇuyāmale (-)

kāraṇaṃ hi yadā devi śrīdevyāḥ padasaṃyutam |
mṛtabhāvaṃ parityajyāpyamaraḥ sādhako bhavet || 25 ||

śaktyucchiṣṭaṃ piveccakre vīrocchiṣṭaṃ hi carvaṇam |
ataśca sādhakāḥ sarve dadeyuḥ kāraṇaṃ mukhe || 26 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

cakrānte parameśāni dadedācamanīyakam |
tadante sādhako devi (j: parameśāni) pivedoṣṭhādharaṃ madhu || 27 ||

nigamakalpalatāyām (-)

yatra sthāne'pi śrīcakraṃ tatra gacchāmi śaṅkara |
nārīdehasaṃśritāhamamṛtapānamāśritā || 28 ||

tasyā duḥkhe'pyahaṃ duḥkhī sukhe'haṃ sukhabhāginī |
yathā dehasya duḥkhe'pi dehī bhavati duḥkhabhāk || 29 ||

ekāpi sundarī devī śrīcakreṣu tridhā parā |
sādhakasyāpi muktyarthaṃ pānāktā kāmukānvitā || 30 ||

sundarī ramaṇīrūpā rājarājeśvarī parā |
parā śrīkālikārūpā (j: strī-) śrīcakrapālane varā || 31 ||

<p. 130>

khaḍgahastā lalajihvā muktakeśī caturbhujā |
varābhayakarā ghorārāvayuktā vibhūṣaṇā || 32 ||

svanāthasya karaṃ dhṛtvā bhramantī cakrapālikā |
nagnā mattā mahādevī siṃhapṛṣṭhe śavāsanā || 33 ||

yoginī yogasaṃyuktā khaḍgahastā digambarī |
lakṣa lakṣa samāyuktā śrīcakraṃ pālayet sadā || 34 ||

parā śrītāriṇī vidyā śrīcakre dravyasaṃśritā (gh: saṃsthitā) |
darśane ghrāṇasaṃsparśe pānānandapradāyikā || 35 ||

saṃgṛhya pūrṇacaṣakaṃ sthāpayet sthaṇḍilopari |
pūjānte śaktaye dadyāt pātraṃ grāhyaṃ kṛpānvitam (gṛhya 
kṛpānvitā) || 36 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse dvātriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[trayastriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha vaṭukavaliḥ |

kulārṇave (-)

yāvanna dadyāt pātraṃ hi vaṭukāya kuleśvari |
sarvadevā na tṛpyanti smaraṇāt pūjanāt śive || 1 ||

vaṭukādīn yajeccakre gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt |
sarvadravyasamāyuktaṃ manunā pātrakaṃ dadet || 2 ||

<p. 131>

(atra dha cha ja pustakeṣu pāṭho'yaṃ dṛśyate : -
atha vaṭukāmantraḥ |
oṃ oṃ oṃ devīputra vaṭukanātha kapilajaṭābhāra bhāsvara 
piṅgalatrinetra jvālāmukha imaṃ valiṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā |
	balidānena santuṣṭo vaṭukaḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ |
	śāntiṃ karotu me nityaṃ bhūtavetālasevitaḥ ||)

atha vaṭukamantroddhāraḥ |

jñānārṇave (-)

ehyehi devīputrānte vaṭukānte ca nātha ca |
kapilānte jaṭābhāra bhāsurānte trinetra ca || 3 ||

jvālāmukhañca sarvānte vighnānnāśaya nāśaya |
sarvopacārasahitavaliṃ hṛhṇa dvidhāpadam |
vahnijāyānvito mantro vaṭukasya udāhṛtaḥ || 4 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ ehyehi devīputra vaṭukanātha kapilajaṭābhāra bhāsuratrinetra 
jvālāmukha vighnānnāśaya nāśaya sarvopacārasahitavaliṃ gṛhṇa 
gṛhṇa svāhā ||

balidānena santuṣṭo vaṭukaḥ sarvasiddhīdaḥ |
śāntiṃ karotu me nityaṃ bhūtavetālasevitaḥ || 5 ||

(atra gh ch ja pustakeṣu pāṭho'yaṃ dṛśyate (-)
oṃ oṃ oṃ sarvayoginībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo ḍākinībhyaḥ śākinībhyaḥ 
trailokyavāsinībhya imāṃ pūjāvaliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā |)

atha yoginībaliḥ |

ūrddhe brahmāṇḍato vā divi gaganatale bhūtale niṣkale vā,
pātāle vā anale vā salilipavanayoryatra kutra sthite vā, 

<p. 132>

kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu kṛtapadā dhūpadīpādikena,
prītā devyaḥ sadā naḥ śubhavalividhinā pāntu devendravandyāḥ || 6 
||

oṃ sarvayoginībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo ḍākinībhyaḥ |
trailokyavāsinībhya imāṃ pūjāvaliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā ||
oṃ yāṃ yoginībhya hu(/) phaṭ svāhā ||

asyoddhāraḥ |

etadante maheśāni yāṃ bījaṃ yoginī tataḥ |
bhyaḥ svāhā sarvavarṇānte yoginīpadamālikhet || 7 ||

kavacaṃ cāstamālikhya vahnijāyāṃ punarlikhet |
anena manunā devi yoginīnāṃ balirbhavet || 8 ||

oṃ ye kecid yoginī rudrā saumyā ghoratarā parā |
khecarīṣu bhūcarīṣu sā me prītāstu sarvadā || 9 ||

(atra gh ch j pustakeṣu pāṭhāntaro'yaṃ dṛśyate (-)
oṃ oṃ oṃ deva deva devīputra vaṭukanātha ucchiṣṭahāriṇī muhurmuhuḥ 
kṣaṃ kṣaṃ kṣetrapāla sarvavighnānnāśaya nāśaya 
sarvopacārasahitamimāṃ pūjāvaliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā ||)

atha kṣetrapālavaliḥ |

ṣaḍdīrghaṃ svarasaṃ bhinnaṃ kṣa kāraṃ vilikhet priye |
sthānakṣetrapadaṃ pānadhūpadīpādi cālikhet || 10 ||

sahitaṃ valimālikhya gṛhṇa gṛhṇa tato vadet |
vahnijāyānvito mantraḥ kṣetrapālasya sundari || 11 ||

<p. 133>

mantrastu |

oṃ kṣāṃ kṣīṃ kṣūṃ kṣaiṃ kṣauṃ kṣaḥ ehyehi kṣetrapāla 
dhūpadīpādisahitavaliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā |

yasmin (j: yo'smin) kṣetre nivāsī ca kṣetrapālasya kiṅkaraḥ |
prīto'yaṃ balidānena sarvarakṣāṃ karotu me || 12 ||

(pāṭho'yaṃ gh ch j pustakeṣu na dṛśyate |)

atha gaṇeśavaliḥ |

gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ trayamālikhya ṅentaṃ gaṇapatiṃ tataḥ |
varānte varadānte ca sarvānte janamālikhet || 13 ||

me vaśaṃ cālaya procya valiṃ gṛhṇa dvidhāpadam |
vahnijāyānvito mantro gaṇeśasya valiṃ haret || 14 ||

(pāṭho'yaṃ gh ch j pustakeṣu na dṛśyate |)

mantrastu |

gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ gaṇapataye varavarada sarvajana me vaśaṃ cālaya 
valiṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā ||

atha sarvabhūtebhyo valiḥ |

oṃ oṃ oṃ sarvabhūtebhyaḥ sarvabhūtādipatibhyo namaḥ |
bhūtā ye vividhākārā dikṣu bhumāntarīkṣagāḥ |
pātālatalasaṃsthāśca śivayogena bhāṣitāḥ || 15 ||

dhruvādyāḥ satya (j: sarva) gandharvā aindrādyāḥ sarvadevatāḥ |
tṛpyantu prītimanaso bhūtā gṛhṇantvimāṃ balim || 16 ||

<p. 134>

atha sāmānyavaliḥ |

rājarājeśvaravaliṃ sarvadevasya sammatam |
yasya nāma pradātavyaṃ taddevo valimicchati || 17 ||

tāratrayaṃ vadet paścāt amukaṃ kṣetrapālakam |
rājarājeśvara imāṃ pūjāvaliṃ tataḥ param |
gṛhṇa yugmaṃ dvidhāntoyaṃ manuḥ sarvaphalapradam || 18 ||

mantrastu |

oṃ oṃ oṃ amuka kṣetrapāla rājarājeśvara imāṃ pūjāvaliṃ gṛhṇa 
gṛhṇa svāhā |
anena validānena vaṭuvargasamanvitāḥ |
rājarājeśvaro devo me prasīdatu sarvadā || 19 ||

(20(-)23 saṃkhyakāḥ ślokā gh ch j pustakeṣu na vidyante |)
vāmāṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ vaṭukasya valirbhavet |
dakṣāṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ yoginīnāntu kathyate || 20 ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām (-)

vāmamuṣṭiṃ vidhāyādau tarjanīṃ śaraṇāṃ kuru |
anayā mudrayā devi kṣetrapālavalirbhavet || 21 ||

tathā muṣṭesu madhyasthāmaṃgulīṃ daṇḍavat kuru |
gajatuṇḍākhyamahāmudrā gāṇapasya (c: gaṇeśasya) valirbhavet || 22 
||

anena validānena vaṭuvargasamanvitāḥ |
rājarājeśvarī devo me prasīdatu sarvadā || 23 ||

<p. 135>

kumārī tantre (-)

atha kuladīpa darśanam |

kulakārye maheśāni kuladīpaṃ pradāpayet |
kuladīpaṃ vinā bhadre jñānadīpaṃ nacet kvacit || 24 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kuladīpaṃ hi kiṃ rūpaṃ kena dravyeṇa vā kṛtam |
nivedyaṃ kena rūpeṇa kathaya prāṇavallabha || 25 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

īṣadraktapiṣṭakena trikoṇagarta (k: gartha) mānatān |
dīpān ḍamarukārāñca bṛddhasya nakhamānataḥ || 26 ||

ākarṣāhyayutān (gh: ākarṣāṣṭayutān; j: ākarṣohyayutān) dīpān 
navasaptatripañcamaḥ |
śatānyūne maheśāni yugmānyaṃ dīpa kalpanam || 27 ||

śatādhikyaṃ yugmadīpaṃ sahasraṃ parameśvari |
dīpasaṃkhyāṃ paribhrāmya svatejastejasi layam || 28 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

rātrau kulakriyāyāñca kuladīpasahasrakam |
śataṃ deyaṃ divā kārye kulaniṣṭhaśca sādhakaḥ || 29 ||

antastejo vahistejo'pyekaṃ kṛtvā maheśvari |
tridhā devyagre saṃbhrāmya kuladīpaṃ nivedayet || 30 ||

mantrastu |

samastacakracakreśīyutaṃ devi mamātmakam |
āraktakāmadaṃ dīpaṃ gṛhāṇa mama siddhaye || 31 ||

<p. 136>

trivāraṃ darśayeddīpaṃ caraṇācchiramānataḥ |
pañcamaṃ saptamaṃ vāpi navamaṃ vā viśeṣakam || 32 ||

kālīvilāsatantre (-)

atha pātrasvīkāraḥ |

ādau yajet sveṣṭadevīṃ pādyādyai (ch: pādyārghaiḥ) 
rūpacārakaiḥ |
tataḥ śaktiṃ yajet cakre yayā śaktyāyutaḥ śive (gh: priye) || 33 ||

sva sva vidyoktamantreṇa vidhānena yajet śivām |
svaśaktiṃ paraśaktiṃ vā dīkṣitāñced yajet śivām || 34 ||

abhyarcya devatābuddhyā (gh: dhyātvā) bhogapātraṃ nivedayet |
sā tu pātraṃ (ch, j: sā'tmapātraṃ) namaskṛtya 
karasaṃpuṭamudrayā |
triśūlamudrayā gṛhya pivedācāryavākyataḥ || 35 ||

anyābhyaśca pradāyecca (ch, j: pradāvyaṃ) śaktibhyaśca maheśvari |
pṛthak pātraṃ pradātavyaṃ madhunā saha bhairavi || 36 ||

pātraṃ saṃgṛhya sā devī prasādaṃ pātraśeṣakam |
bhairavāya pradātavyaṃ bhaktāya sevakāya ca || 37 ||

gṛhitvā prathamaṃ pātraṃ sthāpitaṃ madhunā saha |
svaṣṭedevīṃ pūjayitvā mūlamantraṃ japet priye |
mudrāmāṃsairmaheśāni (gh: mahādevi) surādevīṃ prapūjayet || 38 
||

aṅganyāsañca svīkṛtya karāṅganyāsameva ca |
prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā gṛhṇīyāt pātramuttamam || 39 ||

kubjikātantre (-)

aṅganyāsaṃ karanyāsaṃ varṇanyāsaṃ maheśvari |
svavidyokta ṛṣinyāsaṃ vyāpakanyāsameva ca || 40 ||

pañcadhā nyāsamāśritya prāṇāyāmañcarenmudā |
tataḥ pātraṃ namaskṛtya juhuyāt kuṇḍalīmukhe  || 41 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse tritriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[catustriṃśollāsaḥ] ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

phalaṃ kiṃ nyāsajālasya kathaya prāṇavallabha |
atisūkṣmatamanāmnaḥ prāṇāyāmasya kiṃ phalam || 1 ||

athāṅganyāsādiphalam |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

aṅganyāsaṃ karanyāsaṃ mūlena praṇavena vā |
pañcāśanmanunā devi varṇanyāsaṃ samācaret || 2 ||

aṅganyāse ṣaḍaṅgāni devāṅgāni vicintayet |
karanyāse karaṃ jñeyaṃ devasya karamātrakam || 3 ||

pañcāśanmātṛkārūpī koṭī koṭī ca devatā |
varṇanyāse maheśāni deho devamayo bhavet || 4 ||

ṛṣinyāse svadehaṃ hi devadehaṃ vicintayet |
so'haṃ jñānena deveśi ṛṣyahaṃ paricintayet || 5 ||

tantrāntare (-)

gṛhītvā devatāmantraṃ sākṣācced yadi devatā |
taddehaṃ devatārūpaṃ so'haṃ jñānaṃ sadā yadā || 6 ||

<p. 138>

kubjikātantre (-)

kṣitirjalaṃ tejo vāyurvyoma dehī tathā manaḥ (gh, ch, j: manaḥ śive) |
saptadhā nyāsajālena saptaite devarūpiṇaḥ || 7 ||

āpādaśiraḥ paryantaṃ mūlamantreṇa bhāvini |
saptadhā mantrayenmantrī kyāpakanyāsakaṃ śive || 8 ||

atha prāṇāyāmaphalam |

prāṇāyāmena deveśi nidrāṃ tyaktvāpi kuṇḍalī |
bhaktyāpi yaddīyamānaṃ tad gṛhṇāti kuleśvari || 9 ||

kāraṇapūritaṃ pātraṃ gṛhṇīyānmanunā śive |
ādhāre manunā sthāpya tarpayet tadanantaram || 10 ||

tarpayed guruṇā sārddhaṃ sva (-) sva pātrācca kāraṇaiḥ |
guruśaktiṃ tarpayitvā sveṣṭadevīñca tarpayet || 11 ||

nigamatattve (-)

sveṣṭadevīṃ yadā deva svaśaktiṃ cintayet param (j: svaśakticintanāt 
param) |
śaktaye'pi (j: śaktimeti) tadā devyāḥ pātraṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
gurorājñānusāreṇa tacchaktiramaṇañcaret || 12 ||

yadā sveṣṭasya vāmasthāṃ raktavarṇāṃ vicintayet |
svaśaktiṃ parameśāna sveṣṭadevīñca cintayet |
gurorājñānusāreṇa pātraṃ dattvā kriyāñcaret || 13 ||

strīmātre harapatnī syāt pumān mātre ca śaṅkaraḥ |
vivāhaṃ bandhanaṃ jñeyaṃ vartistho vahnivat priye || 14 ||

śiva (-) devo guruḥ sākṣād gurudevaḥ sadāśivaḥ |
tasya vāme nārīmātraṃ ramaṇañca tadājñayā || 15 ||

<p. 139>

nārāyaṇītantra (-)

yadājñayā maheśāni vīrakarmāṇi sādhayet |
tadājñayā ramet śaktiṃ mātṛbhāvaṃ parityajet || 16 ||

atha tarpaṇakramaḥ |

māṃsena kāraṇaṃ miśraṃ pāṇibhyāṃ tattvamudrayā |
vindumātraṃ kṣipenmūrdhni pādukāmantramuccaran |
śrīguroścaraṇaṃ dhyāyan svamūrdhni gurupādukām || 17 ||

guruśaktiṃ tarpayitvā tathaivānandabhairavīm |
ānandabhairavaṃ devaṃ sveṣṭavidyāṃ hi tarpayet || 18 ||

trivāraṃ tarpayenmūrdhni hṛdaye'pi trivārakam |
sahasrāre sveṣṭavidyāsahitaṃ tarpayed gurum || 19 ||

hṛdaye tarpayed ramyaṃ devatāyāḥ prabhedake |
abhede tarpayed bhadre (ch, j: bhadraṃ) sahasrāre mahāpure || 20 ||

tarpaṇena bhavet śāntirdevatā sthiratā bhavet |
ataśca tarpayeddevān tāntrike vaidikeṣu ca || 21 ||

mantrastu |

tāratrayaṃ samuccārya śrīgurornāmapūrvakam |
śrīpādukāṃ tarpayāmi pūjayāmīti vā priye || 22 ||

atha gurupaṃkti tarpaṇam |

guruṃ paraguruñcaiva parāparaguruntataḥ |
parameṣṭhiguruṃ devi tarpayet tritrivārakam || 23 ||

<p. 140>

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

ko guruḥ parameśāna ko'pi syāt paramo guruḥ |
parāparaguruḥ ko vā parameṣṭhiguruśca kaḥ || 24 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

sthūlasūkṣmobhayoraikyaṃ gururjñānasya kāraṇam |
nānārūpaṃ sthūlamātraṃ yathāgniḥ kāṣṭhasaṃyutaḥ || 25 ||

sūkṣmasya bodhaṃ vijñeyaṃ sthūlabodhasya bījakam |
sthūlasya bodhaṃ vijñeyaṃ sūkṣmabodhasya bījakam |
aikyaṃ kṛtvā sthūlasūkṣmaṃ sarvametat prakāśitam || 26 ||

mantradātā guruḥ prokto mantrastu paramo guruḥ |
parāparagurustvaṃ hi parameṣṭhigururhyaham || 27 ||

atha sveṣṭavidyā tarpaṇam |

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

ādau mūlaṃ samuccārya sāyudhāṃ parivārakam |
savāhanāṃ sveṣṭadevīṃ tarpayāmi dvidhāntakaḥ || 28 ||

aikyajñānasya bījaṃ hi niṣedhavidhivarjitam |
tarpayeccet kriyāsaṅgād guruṇā saha bhāvinīm || 29 ||

sattve śvetaṃ guruṃ dhyāyet śaktyā saha dayānvitam |
śvetavarṇā dvibhujāktā dvinetrā tatsamāyutam || 30 ||

raje raktā tame kṛṣṇā caturvāha trilocanā |
tatsaṃyuktaṃ guruṃ dhyāyet tarpaṇādikamācaret || 31 ||

<p. 141>

tataḥ kramaḥ |

jñānārṇave (-)

aṃguṣṭhānāmikāyogād vāmahastena tarpayet |
aṃguṣṭhatarjanīyogād dakṣiṇe (j: dakṣeṇa) puṣpapātanam || 32 ||

aṃguṣṭho bhairavo devo'pyanāmikā ca caṇḍikā |
ubhayoryoga (gh: tayoḥ saṃyoga-) mātreṇa dravyaṃ syādamṛtopamam 
|| 33 ||

vṛddhāṃguṣṭho bhairavo'pi tarjanī caṇḍikā parā |
anayoryogamātreṇa dravyaṃ puṣpaṃ manoharam || 34 ||

tarjanī caṇḍikārūpā dakṣahastasya śaṅkari |
aṃguṣṭhayogāt sā devī puṣpitā kāmavihvalā || 35 ||

dakṣiṇe gṛhya pātreṇa vāme'pi tattvamudrayā |
māṃsamātraṃ kāraṇena mūlena tarpaṇañcaret |
tarpayed yonimadhye tu yoniṃ saṃgṛhya tatparam || 26 ||

dakṣiṇena kareṇāpi yonau puṣpa prapātanam |
bindumātreṇa dravyeṇa tuṣṭā bhavati kāminī || 37 ||

nijaśakterabhāve'pi jale yoniṃ vicintayet |
tarpaṇādi prakartavyaṃ jalamāyā sanātanī || 38 ||

yathā veśyā sarvapūjyā sarvasya bandhamuktidā |
tathā toyaṃ sarvapūjyaṃ sarvasya bandhamuktidam || 39 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

svadehe tarpaṇaṃ bhadraṃ svadehaṃ devadehakam |
tarpayed jñānavān devi svamūrdhni hṛdaye ca vā || 40 ||

<p. 142>

trivāraṃ tarpaṇaṃ devi trivāraṃ puṣpa pātanam |
guṇatrayasya caikatve tarpaṇaṃ caikavārakam || 41 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse catustriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[pañcatriśollāsaḥ] |

atha pātrasvīkāraḥ |

tataḥ pātraṃ (ch, j: tatpātrañca) namaskṛtya karasaṃpuṭamudrayā |
triśūlamudrayā gṛhya pratipātreṣu vandanam || 1 ||

jñānadvīpe (-)

śaktipātraṃ namet śaktirbīraśca vīrapātrakam |
pratipātraṃ śuddhiyuktaṃ surādevīṃ vicintayet || 2 ||

ādhāre sthāpitaṃ (gh: sthāpayet) pātraṃ saṃgṛhya dakṣiṇe kare |
pare vāme kare sthāpya surādevīñca prārthayet || 3 ||

atha prārthanā |

samudre madhyamāne tu kṣīrābdhau sāgarottame |
tatrotpannāṃ surādevīṃ kalau kāraṇarūpiṇīm |
amṛtaṃ satyalokeṣu svargalokeṣu kāraṇam || 4 ||

surāsevāt suratvaṃ hi dehi me kāmavihvale |
sparśanāt kāmadāgṛtvaṃ darśanāt pāpahāriṇī |
ānandatvaṃ sevanācca muktitvaṃ ramaṇīyutāt || 5 ||

<p. 143>

tripātraṃ pañcapātraṃ vā saptapātraṃ maheśvari |
pātrañca navamaṃ devi vandanīyaṃ pivenmadhu || 6 ||

ekapātraṃ yugmapātraṃ cakrānte naiva kārayet |
saṃkhyāvirahitaṃ pātraṃ kevalaṃ mṛtyudāyakam || 7 ||

tantrāntare (-)

ekapātraṃ na kartavyaṃ yadi sākṣānmaheśvaraḥ |
tasya mantro vṛthā devi pānaṃ narakadāyakam || 8 ||

kulārṇave (-)

tripātraṃ pañcapātrāntaṃ niyamena pivenmadhu |
ata ūrddhaṃ maheśāni niyamaḥ kaḥ kṣamo bhavet || 9 ||

saptamaṃ navamaṃ yāvad yadi syānniyamo bhavet |
saptamaṃ navamaṃ yāvad yadi syānniyamo bhavet (ch: tasmānna 
niyamañcaret; j: tāvanna niyamañcaret) || 10 ||

tasyārthaṃ vandanaṃ mantraṃ vakṣyāmi śṛṇu pārvati |
pañcapātraṃ vandanīyaṃ navamañca maheśvari |
vandanīyaṃ kramāt (ch, j: krame) kuryānniyamena pivenmadhu || 11 ||

atha pañcapātravandanam |

śrīmadbhairavaśekharapravilasatcandrāmṛtaplāvitaṃ,
kṣetrādhīśvarayoginīkulagaṇaiḥ siddhaiḥ samārādhitam |
ānandārṇavakaṃ mahātmakamidaṃ sākṣāttrikhaṇḍāmṛtaṃ,
vande śrīprathamaṃ karāmbu jagataṃ pātraṃ viśuddhipradam || 12 ||

juhomi kuṇḍalīvaktre juhsveti vaded guruḥ |
ājihvāntaṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ dhyātvā pānaṃ carenmadhu || 13 ||

<p. 144>

tantracintāmaṇau (-)

vāmahaste'i caṣakaṃ dakṣahastena pārvati |
śuddhiṃ kṛtvā (g, gh, c: dhṛtvā) maheśāni caṣake viniyojayet || 14 ||

mūlena pātraṃ dātavyaṃ gṛhnīyānmanunā (c: madhunā) śive |
kulakuṇḍalinī(-)vaktre dattvā dhyāyed guruṃ svayam (j: śive) || 15 ||

punaḥ pātraṃ māṃsayuktaṃ gṛhītvā kulanāyike (gh: 
brahmacintanam) |
mūlena kuṇḍalī vaktre dattvā brahma nirūpaṇam || 16 ||

dvitīyapātravandanam |

dvitīyapātravandanam |

(2)

oṃ haimaṃ mīnarasāvahaṃ dayitayā dattañca peyādibhiḥ,
kiñciccañcalaraktapaṅjadṛśā tasyai samāveditam |
vāme svādu (j: sādhu) viśuddhikaraṇaṃ pānaṃ nidhāyātmakaṃ, 
(gh, ch: vidhāyātmakaṃ; j: vidheyātmakaṃ)
vande pātramahaṃ dvitīyamadhunānandaikasamvarddhanam || 17 ||

tṛtīyapātravandanam |

(3)

sarvāmnāya kalākalāpakalitaṃ (k: -lalitaṃ) kautūhaladyotakaṃ (gh 
ch: dyotanam; j: dyotitam)
candropendramahendraśambhuvaruṇabrahmādibhiḥ sevitam |
dhyātaṃ devagaṇaiḥ paraṃ munigaṇairbrahmādibhiḥ (gh, j: 
mokṣarthibhiḥ) sarvadā,
vande pātramahaṃ (j: pāpaharaṃ) tṛtīyamadhunā 
cātmāvabodhakṣamam || 18 ||

<p. 145>

prāṇāyāmāt caret pānaṃ (gh: pātraṃ) prāṇāyāmaṃ tadantaram |
tadante ramaṇaṃ kuryānmūlamantrajapānvitam || 19 ||

tripātrasaṃyutaṃ cakramidamuktaṃ maheśvari |
pañcapātrayutaṃ cakraṃ vandanaṃ śṛṇu pārvati || 20 ||

caturthāpātravandanam |

(4)

oṃ madyaṃ mīnarasāvahaṃ hariharabrahmādibhiḥ sevitaṃ,
mudrāmaithunadharmakarmanirataṃ kṣārāmlatiktāśrayam |
ācāryāṣṭakasiddhi (gh: siddha) bhairavakalāmāṃsenasaṃśodhitaṃ,
pāyāt pañcamakāratattvasahitaṃ pātraṃ caturthaṃ namaḥ || 21 ||

pañcamapātravandanam |

(5)

ādhāre bhujagādhirājavalaye pātraṃ mahīmaṇḍalaṃ,
madyaṃ saptasamudravāripiśitañcāṣṭau ca digdantinaḥ |
so'haṃ bhairavamarcayan pratidinaṃ tārāgaṇai rakṣitaiḥ,
rādityapramukhaiḥ surāsuragaṇairājñākaraiḥ kiṅkaraiḥ || 22 ||

atha navapātravandanam |

rudrayāmale (-)

pātravandanamityuktaṃ navamaṃ saptamaṃ priye |
yatkṛtvā (gh: kṛte) sādhakaśreṣṭhaḥ śivatulyo na saṃśayaḥ || 23 ||

(1)

śrīmadbhairavaśekharapravilasat candrāmṛtaplāvitaṃ,
kṣetrādhīśvarayoginīgaṇamahāsiddhaiḥ samāveditam |

<p. 146>

ānandārṇavakaṃ navātmakamidaṃ (gh: mahātmakam) 
sākṣāttrikhaṇḍāmṛtaṃ,
tatpātraṃ prathamaṃ samastajagatāṃ saukhyāya vande sadā || 24 ||

(2)

sarvāmnāyamilat kalākulakalākautūhaladyotaka,
indro (gh: candro) pendramahendracandrakiraṇairbrahmādibhiḥ (gh: 
śambhuvaruṇaṃ-) sevitam |
dhyānādeva pariśrutaṃ vilayamutpādāya yat sarvadā,
lokānāṃ śubhavṛddhidāyakamidaṃ pātraṃ dvitīyaṃ namaḥ || 25 ||

(3)

madyaṃ māṃsarasāvahaṃ hariharabrahmādibhiḥ sevitaṃ,
mudrāmaithunadharmakarmasubhagaṃ kṣārāmlātiktāśrayam |
ācāryaṣṭakasiddhi (gh: -siddh) bhairavakalāmāṃsena saṃśodhitaṃ,
pāyāt pañcamakāratattvasahitaṃ pātraṃ tṛtīyaṃ namaḥ || 26 ||

(4)

viṣṇurbhūtasagolasarvasukhadaṃ brahmādisaṃcarcitaṃ,
sevyante śivaśaktisaṃyutamidaṃ pañcopacāraiḥ sadā |
satsyaṃ chāgakapotamuttamarasaṃ pātrañca sarveśvaram,
tatpātrañca samastapuṇyasukhadaṃ pātraṃ caturthaṃ namaḥ || 27 ||

(5)

sarvāmnyāyakulākalāgamapakaṃ devyairmukhairbhāṣitaṃ,
yogaṃ yoga (gh, j: bhoga) kulāṅgaśāstrasatataṃ guptaṃ 
rahasyānvitam |
ānandodbhava nādavindukalayā yogena tairbhairavai,
pītabrahmarasaṃ sadodyatakaraṃ pātraṃ bhaje pañcakam || 28 ||

(6)

chatraṃ cāmaraśaktipīṭhasadṛśaṃ saṃpūjya śaktiṃ sadā,
vāme veśyamanoharāṃ (gh: vāmāvaśyamanoharaṃ) sukhakarāṃ 
(gh: sukhakaraṃ) kautūhalaṃ kautukam |
nānā bhogavilāsasaukhyaramaṇaṃ kāmāṅganāsevitaṃ,
śrīmat sundarī tarpaṇaṃ dravarasaṃ pātrañca ṣaṣṭhaṃ bhaje || 29 ||

(7)

jāgrat (-) svapna suṣupti cintanaparaṃ, caitanyasākṣipradaṃ
vidyudbhāskaravallisannibhadyuti (ch: 
vidyudbhāskaravallibhidyutikaraṃ) jyotsnākalāvyāpitam |
iḍāpiṅgalamadhyagā trivalayā syāt kuṇḍalīmadhyagā,
pātraṃ saptamapūraṇe bhavabhayānando'dhikaḥ pātu mām || 30 ||

(8)

khaḍgaṃ pādukamañcajanaika (j: mañjulaikaṃ) puṭikā (gh: 
guṭikāṃ) sārasvataṃ sampradaṃ (sampradaṃ),
mṛtyurvañjanamugramārtiharahaṃ ramyaṃ jagadbhāṣitaṃ,
pātrañcāṣṭamamaṣṭasiddhikaraṇaṃ prauḍha prasannaṃ sadā || 31 ||

(9)

ānandaikarasaṃ sadāśivaparaṃ nandaikamuddīpanaṃ
sāmrāmbā sukhadaṃ manorathakaramajñānavidhvaṃsanam |
āyuḥkānti yaśovivarddhanakaraṃ saṃsāramohācchadaṃ (gh: 
mohocchedaṃ; ch: mohacchedaṃ),
pātraṃ yannavanāthaśaktisahitaṃ sarvārthasiddhipradam || 32 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvvollāsepañcatriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ṣaṭtriṃśollāsaḥ] |

guptasādhanatantre (-)

saṃgṛhya divyacaṣakaṃ sthiracittaṃ samāhitaḥ |
vikalpo nātra kartavyaḥ kṛte ca maraṇaṃ bhavet || 1 ||

atha pānaniyamaḥ |

kulatattvasāre (-)

ādau deyaṃ śaktipātraṃ mūlena manunāthavā |
dīyamānaṃ mahāmantraṃ kathayāmi śṛṇu priye || 2 ||

mantrastu |

alipātraṃ mayā tubhyaṃ dīyate piśitānvitam |
svīkṛtya subhage devi jayaṃ dehi punaḥ punaḥ || 3 ||

śaktiprasādamānīya yatnena parameśvari |
svapātre kāraṇe miśraṃ pivedānandahetave || 4 ||

śaktyucchiṣṭānvitaṃ pātraṃ kevalānandadāyakam |
śaktirūpā mahādevī kevalānandavarddhinī || 5 ||

śakti dehaṃ sthūlarūpaṃ kevalaṃ mokṣabhāk śive |
sādhakasya kriyānande tejīyo rūpadhāriṇī || 6 ||

yathākāśaṃ maheśāni sarvarūpasya rūpakam |
tathā nārī narasyāpi sarvakāryaprakāśikā (ch, j: prakāśinī) || 7 ||

<p. 149>

nirvāṇatantre (-)

pānaṃ pañcavidhaṃ proktaṃ gurudhyānādisaṃyutam |
svīkṛtya kāraṇaṃ devi paścāt kāryāṇi sādhayet || 8 ||

prathame ca (gh, j: śrī) gurudhyānaṃ tato brahma nirūpaṇam |
prāṇāyāmaṃ gṛtīye ca caturthe japamāharet || 9 ||

pañcame pañcamaṃ kṛtvā ṣaṣṭhe'pyānandamācaret |
pañcamaṃ pātrasahitaṃ cakrasya lakṣaṇaṃ śive || 10 ||

atha navamapātrasya lakṣaṇam |

gurudhyānaṃ (j: gurordhyānaṃ) hi prāṇāyāmaṃ japam manum 
pradakṣiṇaṃ namaskāraṃ stotraṃ gānañca nṛtyanam |
maithunaṃ parameśāni daśamānandamācaret || 11 ||

atha śrīgurudhyānam |

viśvasāre (-)

sahasrāre sthitaṃ brahma haṃsahaṃsīsamanvitam |
nādabindumayaṃ pīṭhaṃ haṃsayugmaṃ prakāśitam || 12 ||

tvadīya pratibimbaṃ yat śuddhadīpaprakāśakam |
hṛdaye cintayeddevaṃ dvibhujaṃ śaktisaṃyutam || 13 ||

pramāṇaṃ gurugītāyāṃ (-)

gṛdyambuje karṇikamadhyasaṃsthaṃ
siṃhāsane saṃsthitadivyamūrtitam |
dhyāyed guruṃ candrakalāvataṃsaṃ,
saccit sukhābhīṣṭavarāpradānam || 14 ||

<p. 150>

śvetāmbaraṃ śvetavilepayuktaṃ
muktāphalāphalabhūṣitadivyamūrtim |
vāmāṅkapīṭhesthitadivyaśaktiṃ
mandasmitaṃ pūrṇakṛpānidhānam || 15 ||

ānandamānandakaraṃ prasannaṃ,
jñānasvarūpaṃ nijabodhayuktam |
gīndramīḍyaṃ bhavarogavaidyaṃ,
śrīdguruṃ nityamahaṃ namāmi || 16 ||

gurutantre (-)

sahasrāre sthitaṃ brahma tadeva gururucyate |
dhyānapūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ sahasrāre prakalpayet || 17 ||

kadācit sva sahasrāre mantradhyeyo guruḥ sadā |
dadācit hṛdayāmbhoje kadācid dṛṣṭigocare || 18 ||

dṛṣṭe'pi gururūpañca sahasrāre na cintayet |
hṛdaye cintanaṃ nāsti prativimbeṣu cintayet |
tvadīya prativimbeṣu tajjñānaṃ paricintanam || 19 ||

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

sahasrāre paraṃ brahma hṛdaye pratibimbakam |
pratibimbasya bimbaṃ hi naradehaprakāśakam || 20 ||

tejovimbaṃ yathā devi tejīyaḥ sthūlamātrakam (g: sthūlarūpakaḥ) |
sthūlasya vimbaṃ paramaṃ tejasi bhāti sarvadā || 21 ||

tantrāntare (-)

gurau manuṣyabuddhintu (gh: buddhistu) mantre cākṣarabhāvanam (gh: 
bhāvanā) |
pratimāsu (gh: pratimāyāṃ) śilājñānaṃ kurvāṇo narakaṃ vrajet || 
22 ||

<p. 151>

atha brahmanirūpaṇam |

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

pañcanādaṃ ṣaṣṭhavindu ṣuṣumṇāmadhyasaṃsthitam (j: 
madhyagaṃ) |
ṣaṭpaṅkajamidaṃ proktaṃ sahasrāraṃ śivasthalam (ch, j: 
śivaṃpuraṃ) 23 ||

pañcacakraṃ pañcatattvaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ tatvavivarjitam (gh, j: 
vyomātītaṃ śive) |
tanmanaḥ parameśāni mano'tītaṃ nirañjanam || 24 ||

nirañjanaṃ nirākāramavāṅmanaso gocaram |
vācātītaṃ vacojñeyaprakāśaṃ (j: vācā-) prakāśakam || 25 ||

candrasūryāgnibhiryatra prakāśañca na vidyate |
tatprakāśe jagadbhāti nābhāti cāprakāśake || 26 ||

sahasrāramidaṃ proktaṃ sphāṭike rañjanaṃ yathā |
śiva śaktimayaṃ bindu sahasrāraṃ manoharam || 27 ||

sahasrāre pratidale nādabindusahasrakam |
pratibindu nādayugmaṃ nādañca binduyugmakam || 28 ||

nādaṃ bhāvaṃ maheśāni binduṃ bhāvavivarjitam |
nādabindumayaṃ sarvaṃ brahmajñānena bhāṣitam || 29 ||

jñānasya kāraṇaṃ nādaṃ bindu jñānasya nāśakam |
nādāktabindu jñeyañca brahmajñānamiti priye || 30 ||

atha prāṇāyāmaḥ |

mūlādhāre kuṇḍalinī svayambhū liṅga veṣṭitā |
mahāśṛṅgārasaṃyuktā jīvātma mokṣadāyikā || 31 ||

prāṇāyāmena tāṃ nītvā svādhiṣṭhāneṣu snāpayet |
maṇipureṣu tāṃ devīṃ (g: nītvā) cintāmaṇi vibhūṣayet || 32 ||

<p. 152>

anāhate mahāpadme nītvā tāṃ jagadambikām |
pūjayed vahuyatnena kāraṇādiprabhedakaiḥ || 33 ||

atha japaḥ |

vibhāve śaktimantrañca sabhāve śivamantrakam |
viśuddhākhye japenmantramājñāyāṃ tatsamāpanam || 34 ||

tantrāntare (ch, j: iti mantrāntare bhāvaḥ | tadājñāyāṃ 
japakarmāṇi sādhayet)

anāhate mahāśaktirjīvātma dīpavatprabhā |
viśuddhe'pi śive mattā ramaṇājñāsamāvṛtā (j: samāśritā) || 35 
||

pañcame pañcame tattve sahasrāre mahāpure |
śivaśaktimayaṃ bindumekadehaṃ vicintayet || 36 ||

tataḥ punaḥ pratisthāne pratipadme dale dale |
śivaśaktimayaṃ devi śaktyā śivamayaṃ vapuḥ || 37 ||

dhyātvāpi kāraṇaṃ pātraṃ juhuyādiṣṭasiddhaye |
mūlādhāre trikoṇākte bhagakṣālitavāriṇā || 38 ||

pūrayet kuṇḍalīgartaṃ mūlena manunā śive |
kāmarāgeṇa (j: vāṇena) santaptā kāmavāripipāsikā || 39 ||

visatantusamākārā (j: śiva) kāraṇyavārimajjitā |
ekāsyaṃ liṅgarandhre'pi parāsyena maheśvari |
śvāsocchvāsena (k, g: śvāsāśvāsen) devāni sthāpitāni kramāṇi 
ca || 40 ||

iti te kathitaṃ kānte (gh: devi) madhupānasya lakṣaṇam |
gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ || 41 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ṣaṭtriṃśollāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[saptatriṃśollāsaḥ] |

nārāyaṇītantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

antaḥpūjā śrutā nātha vāhyapūjāñca kiṃ vada (gh: kīdṛśam) |
antaḥpūjā mano hṛṣṭaṃ (j: hṛdyaṃ) yadi syāttu bhaviṣyati |
tadante sādhako deva vāhyapūjāñca kākṣati || 1 ||

antaḥpūjā tadā pūrṇā yadānte (j: yadante) devadarśanam |
vāhyārcanaṃ tadā kāryamanyathābhūd vṛthendriyam |
ata eva mahādeva śrotumicchāmi lakṣaṇam || 2 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

yaduktaṃ paramānande lokānāṃ siddhihetave |
śṛṇuṣva jagatāṃ mātaḥ śṛṇuṣva prāṇavallabhe || 3 ||

prathame śrīgurudhyānam |

yadājñayā maheśāni yatkāryaṃ parisādhayet |
tatkāryaphalalābhārthe taṃ guruṃ parikalpayet (k, c: parikalpitaṃ; 
paricintayet) |

dvitīye rūpacintanam |

kāraṇānandarūpā hi ānandaṃ kāraṇaṃ śive |
dvitīyasahitaṃ madyaṃ dvitīye rūpacintanam || 5 ||

<p. 154>

tṛtīye prāṇāyāmaḥ |

(śaivācāre bahudhāproktaṃ prāṇāyāmaphalam)

aṅganyāse'pyaṅgaśuddhaṃ (gh: aṅgaśuddhiṃ) karanyāse karaṃ 
śive |
aṅgulyaṅguliparvāntāt (k: -parvantan) sārddhaṃ sandhiṃ karasya ca || 
6 ||

caturthe japaḥ |

hṛdaye hastamāropya tiryak kṛtvā karāṅgulīm |
ācchādya vāsasā hastau dakṣiṇena sadā japet || 7 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa namāmi caraṇāmbuje |
gopanīyaṃ kathaṃ proktaṃ phalaṃ kiñca vada (gh: kintadvada) prabho 
|| 8 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

mantraṃ hi gopanaṃ bhadraṃ tathā jāpakaraṃ (k, kh, c: japaṃ karaṃ) 
śive |
kāraṇaṃ hi tathā gopyaṃ gopanīyañca maithunam || 9 ||

kusaṅgāt (ch, j: kusaṅge) phalahāniḥ syāt susaṅge phalabhāgbhavet |
muktyākāṅkṣī maheśāni saṅgaṃ tyaktvā kriyāñcaret || 10 ||

pañcame maithunan |

urudvandve padadvandvaṃ śivāgāre śivaṃ nyaset |
śukrapātaṃ yonirandhre (-mārge) muktistasya kare sthitā || 11 ||

<p. 155>

ṣaṣṭhe pradakṣiṇam |

yāmale (-)

caṇḍyāmekaṃ ravau sapta trīṇi kuryādvināyake |
catvāri keśave kuryāda śive cārddhapradakṣiṇam || 12 ||

śaktipradakṣiṇakramaḥ |

dakṣiṇādvāyavīṃ gatvā gatastasyāśca śāmbhavīm |
tasyāśca dakṣiṇe gatvā namaskāraṃ trikoṇavat || 13 ||

śivapradakṣiṇam |

vṛṣaṃ caṇḍaṃ vṛṣañcaiva somasūtraṃ (j: -śukraṃ) tathā vṛṣam |
caṇḍañca (j: vṛṣañca) somasūtrañca (j: -śukrañca) punaścaṇḍaṃ 
punarvṛṣam || 14 ||

pṛṣṭhe dakṣe (gh: pṛṣṭhadeśe) tathā vāme vṛṣaṃ caṇḍañca 
somakam |
savyāsavyakrameṇaiva somasūtraṃ (j: -śukraṃ) na laṅghayet || 15 ||

yatprakāraṃ yathāsaṃkhyaṃ pīṭhaṃ yasya maheśvari |
tatprakāraṃ hi tatsaṃkhyaṃ prādakṣiṇyaṃ (gh: pradakṣiṇaṃ) 
samācaret || 16 ||

asya phalam |

pradakṣiṇena deveśi devatāpīṭharopaṇam |
yaḥ kuryādbhaktibhāvena deve so'pi layo bhavet || 17 ||

saptame namaskāraḥ |

yadbhāge'pi namaskāraṃ tadbhāge layavānbhavet (k: -bhāg) |
atastvaṃ (k, g, gh: tvāṃ) parameśāni sarvalokasya vanditā (k, g, gh: 
vanditāṃ) || 18 ||

<p. 156>

nārāyaṇītantre (-)

svavāme praṇamedviṣṇuṃ dakṣiṇe gaurośaṅkaram |
guruṃ namet sammukhato nānyathā niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 19 ||

aṣṭāṅgena nameddevaṃ pañcāṅgena maheśvari |
hastena śirasā vāpi śirasā kevalena ca (ch, j: vā) || 20 ||

athāṣṭāṅga namaskāraḥ |

padbhyāṃ karābhyāṃ jānubhyāṃ urasā śirasā dṛśā |
vacasā manasā caiva praṇāmo'ṣṭāṣṭa īritaḥ || 21 ||

urasā śirasā devi vacasā manasā dṛśā |
pañcāṅgena nameddevaṃ devatā layabhāgbhavet || 22 ||

sahasrāre mahāpadme sarvadevālaye śive |
tattat svarūpaṃ saṃcintya sarvāniṣṭānnamed yajet (j: jayet) || 23 ||

dukūlaṃ nādamākāraṃ gale dattvā maheśvari |
namaskāraṃ tathā stotraṃ bhaktimān sādhakaścaret || 24 ||

aṣṭame stotram |

tantrāntare (-)

manasāpi paṭhet stotraṃ vācā vāpi japenmanum |
ubhayorniṣphalaṃ (g: viphalaṃ) vidyāt (k, g, c: devi) bhagna (k, g, c: 
bhīnna) bhāṇḍodakaṃ yathā || 25 ||

vīratantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

sveṣṭadevārcane sveṣṭa sarvakāryāṇi sādhayet |
tadanyaṃ pūjanaṃ stotraṃ kathamanyasya kārayet (j: kāraṇam) || 26 ||

<p. 157>

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

anantāśayajīvo'pi (gh: anantasyāśayajaro; c: anantāśayavījo) 
kriyānanteṣu lubdhakaḥ |
anantaśca phalākāṅkṣī ato devārcanāntakam (j: devohyanantakaḥ) || 
27 ||

ekadhyānamekarūpamekātmātmānamicchati (j: ekatvātmānam) |
stotreṇānyaṃ hi yaddevaṃ sveṣṭadevamayo bhavet |
ataśca sādhako devi sveṣṭānyaṃ stotramācaret || 28 ||

navame gāyanam |

navame gāyanaṃ nṛtyaṃ bhagaliṅgāmṛtaṃ śive |
nṛtyaṃ śṛṅgārabhāvena devatā prītibhāgbhavet || 29 ||

devatāguṇakākyaṃ vā gāyanaṃ bhaktidāyakam |
cakra madhye (gh, ch, j: bhinne) caredgānaṃ bhairavo gānanāyakaḥ 
(ch, j: -nāśakaḥ) || 30 ||

kevalaṃ (j: kevale) gāyanenāpi navamaṃ pātrabhakṣaṇam (k, c, ch: -
rakṣaṇam) |
tataśca dehī parame daśame'pi layo bhavet || 31 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

prathame bhaktimātraṃ hi dvitīye rūpa cintanam |
tṛtīye romaharṣañca caturthe'śruprapātanam || 32 ||

pañcame gadgadaṃ vākyaṃ ṣaṣṭhe gānādisaṅkulam |
saptame patito bhūmau jñānājñāno'pi cāṣṭame || 33 ||

navame jñānarahito dehājjīvaṃ vimuñcati (ch: na-)
daśame parameśāni gāne pāne ca jāyate || 34 ||

<p. 158>

nigamatattve śrīdevyuvāca (-)

gāyanaṃ bhagaliṅgasya nṛtyaṃ śṛṅgārabhāvakam |
devatāveśasaṃgrāhyanṛtyaṃ vādyañca gāyanam || 35 ||

gāne nṛtye yadānandaṃ śaktyāścāpi (k, c: śaktyā sāpi; gh: 
śaktiścāpi) śivasya ca |
tadānando yadā śakteḥ sa śivaḥ sāpi śaṅkarī (j: śaktiḥ sāpi ca 
śaṅkarī) || 26 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse saptatriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[aṣṛtriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha pātre madhudānapramāṇam |

viśvasāratantre (-)

prathame tolakaṃ pañca dvitīye'pi caturthakam |
tṛtīye'pi tritolaṃ syāccaturthe'pi dvitolakam |
pañcame'pye katolaṃ syāt tataḥ pūrṇaṃ pivenmadhu || 1 ||

atha navamapātre madhudānapramāṇam |

pañcamaṃ saptamaṃ pātraṃ navamaṃ vā maheśvari |
tadūrddhaṃ madhupāneṣu niyamaḥ kaḥ kṣamo bhavet || 2 ||

yasmit cakre maheśāni yatsaṃkhyapātrakalpitam |
viparīta krame māne (gh: krameṇaiva) tolakaṃ prathamāvadhi || 3 ||

<p. 159>

cakrānte'pyekatolaṃ hi tadante pūrṇapātrakam |
tadante maithunaṃ kuryād bhagavāri pivenmudā || 4 ||

prathame lavaṇaṃ (ch, j: kevalaṃ) madyaṃ dvitīye māṃsasaṃyutam |
mudrāyuktaṃ tṛtīye'pi caturthe mīnasaṃyutam || 5 ||

pañcame sarvasaṃyuktaṃ niyamena pivenmadhu |
athavā lavaṇe (navame) nāpi sarvapātrāṇi kārayet || 6 ||

carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ lehyapeyaṃ śaktivākyānusārataḥ |
jñānī ca parameśāni svecchayāpi pivenmadhu |
caryaṃcoṣyaṃ (gh: carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ lehyaṃ peyaṃ svecchayā hi 
maheśvari) tathā lehyaṃ peyaṃ hi svecchayā śive || 7 ||

carvaṇena vinā devi kevalam viṣabhakṣaṇam |
yena tena prakāreṇa carvaṇaṃ parikalpayet (ch, j: parikalpanam) || 8 ||

śyāmārahasye (-)

śaktiṃ vinā yathā madyaṃ tathā mudrāṃ vinā śive |
reto vinā yathā krīḍā vinā krīḍāñca retakam || (j: retanam) |
sarvañca viphalaṃ yāti yathā vāyuśca yathā vāyuśca bhakṣaṇam || 
9 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvāllāse aṣṭatriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ūnacatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

krīḍā kā parameśāna retaḥ kiṃ vada śaṅkara |
krīḍayā ca kimadbhutaṃ kathaya prāṇavallabha || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

krīḍāpi śaktibhiḥ sārddhaṃ retaḥ śṛṅgārasambhavam |
phalamānandavijñeyaṃ kāraṇobhayamīlitam || 2 ||

atha krīḍā | bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

gurorājñāṃ samādāya kriyāmātraṃ samācaret |
anyathā yā kriyā proktā vyañjane lavaṇaṃ (k, g, c: alavaṇaṃ) yathā 
|| 2 ||

tathā ca viśvasāre (-)

guruṃ vinā pivenmadyaṃ vinā śaktiñca maithunam |
taddravyaṃ naiva gṛhṇāti kuṇḍalīparadevatā || 4 ||

gurorabhāve tacchaktau pātraṃ dattvā pivenmadhu |
athavā tatsute dattvā pānaṃ tat (k, kh, c: yat) phaladāyakam || 5 ||

guroḥ kṛpāṃ vinā devi sarvaṃ hi viphalaṃ bhavet |
tailaṃ vinā yathā dīpe varttidānaṃ tathā dhruvam || 6 ||

gurorājñāṃ samādāya krīḍayā śaktibhiḥ saha |
madhupānena saṃmato ghātayed yonimaṇḍale || 7 ||

<p. 161>

atha krīḍā lakṣaṇam | niruttare (-)

ānīya sundarīṃ kāntāṃ kulabhaktāṃ kulārccane |
śakticakraṃ tridhā kṛtvā śakti bhāle likhet tataḥ || 8 ||

picchilāyām (-)

śvetaṃ raktañca miśrañca śakticakreṣu śobhanam |
tridhā kṛtvā likhedbhāle madhye miśraṃniyojayet || 9 ||

śvetasattvaṃ (j: śvetaṃ-) rajoraktaṃ tamomiśraṃ maheśvari |
kṛṣṇodbhūtaṃ (c: kṛṣṇodbhavaṃ) sarvavarṇaṃ likheccakrasya 
madhyavat || 10 ||

brahmakoṇaṃ viṣṇukoṇaṃ savyāsavye mehśvari |
śivakoṇaṃ madhyadeśe trivindu tritvabhāṣitam || 11 ||

vindumātraṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ madhyavarṇaṃ prakāśitam |
ūrddhe raktam adhaḥ śvetaṃ miśraṃ madhye niyojayet || 12 ||

tatra kāma kalābinduṃ śiva koṇe prakāśitam |
śaktāvāvāhanaṃ nāsti yato devī svarūpiṇī || 13 ||

sveṣṭa vidyāṃ svarūpāṃ tāṃ cintayet kula sādhakaḥ |
pūjayitvā ramet śaktiṃ vīrya pāte visarjanam || 14 ||

śrī cakre devatāgre ca pūjayed ramaṇe śivāṃ |
sambhoge (gh: devyagre sambhogecaiva; c: śambhoragre ca; j: devatāgre 
tu sambhoge) caiva devyagre devatā prītibhāgbhavet || 15 ||

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

muhurmuhuḥ viveddravyaṃ (j: madyaṃ) pītvā pītvā japenmanum |
dhyātvā dhyātvārccanaṃ śaktiṃ jñātvā jñātvā vrajet striyam || 
16 ||

<p. 162>

cakramadhye sādhakāgre (j: maheśāni) sādhyāṃ śaktiṃ ramedyadi |
pūrṇānando bhavet so'pi sambhogaṃ mama sammatam || 17 ||

sama kāryaṃ kṛtaṃ tena (gh: yena) satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
yadā rameccakrabhinne gurorājñānusārataḥ || 18 ||

yadi bhāgyena deveśi gurūramaṇamācaret |
sā nārī kālikārūpā śukra pātaṃ bhage (j: bhaved) yadi || 19 ||

yā (śloko'yaṃ ch: pustake nāsti) nārī parameśāni gurave 
bhaktisaṃyutā |
tadājñayāpi tadyonau guruśca ramaṇañcaret || 20 ||

anyathāpi na karttavyaṃ kṛte siddhirna saṃśayaḥ |
yadi kuryyāt tu mohena śṛṅgāraṃ śaktisaṃyutam |
gurutvaṃ hi layaṃ yasmāt punaścakraṃ niyojaye || 21 ||

nārāyaṇītantre (-)

anicchayā sādhakasya sādhyāyāḥ parameśvari |
ramaṇaṃ naiva karttavyaṃ kṛte'pi patito bhavet || 22 ||

maithunaṃ madyasāraṃ hi śukraṃ maithuna sārakam |
śukra pātaṃ vinā kāryaṃ madyaṃ maithuna (-) varjitam |
sarvaṃ hi niṣphalaṃ proktaṃ (gh: kāryyaṃ) mṛta putreṇa putriṇī || 23 
||

jñānārṇave (-)

dhṛtvā sādhaka retaśca sā nārī kālikā svayam |
ata eva maheśāni veśyāśaktipraphullikā (gh, c: śaktiḥ-) || 24 ||

sādhako darśane yantraṃ pāpamukto bhaviṣyati |
sparśanāt puṇyabhāgloko (gh, c: -loke) ghātanācca kriyānvitaḥ || 25 ||

<p. 163>

śukrapāte śivo'bhūcca nārī kālī parā tadā |
yadyoniṃ (j: tad-) bhakti bhāvena ramaṇañca karoti yaḥ |
pūtātmā puṇyabhāgīca kriyāśaktaḥ śivobhavet || 26 ||

pūjāt puṇyaṃ maheśāni puṇyāt kāryeṣu yogyatā |
yogyāt śivatvaṃ sāyujyaṃ śakre nirvāṇa bhāgbhavet || 27 ||

guptasādhanatantre (-)

śubhalagne śubhadine śubhakārye śubhasthale |
mathunaṃ kārayed dhīrastadbhinne (j: vīra-) narakaṃ vrajet || 28 ||

avidhānena deveśi maithunaṃ narakadāyakam |
vidhānene varārohe kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale || 29 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ūnacatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 
0 ||


[catvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha maithuna vidhānam | jñānārṇave (-)

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa lokānāṃ jñānadāyaka (j: trāṇa-) (!)
mathunaṃ śrotumicchāmi yathāvidhi vidhānakam || 1 ||

<p. 164>

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

pītvātu mādakaṃ dravyaṃ maithunaṃ yadvidhānakam |
maithunena vinā devi sarvakāryaṃ vṛthā bhavet || 2 ||

(śloko'yaṃ ch: pustake dṛśyate, nānyatra) tāntrike'pi svayaṃ vaidike 
pratikalpanam |
anyathāpi kṛtaṃ kāryyaṃ sa cumbako na saṃśayaḥ || 3 ||

ye vadanti maheśāni maithunaṃ naraka dāyakam |
tadarthe maithunaṃ devi proktaṃ hi vidhibodhitam || 4 ||

teṣāṃ saṅgakṛtaṃ devi cumbakaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā sādhako devi yonyā ghrāṇaṃ samācaret || 5 ||

tasyāṅgasparśanāddevi vīkṣayedyonimaṇḍalam |
śakterājñāṃ vinā devi valena maithunaṃ caret || 6 ||

sa dhūrttaḥ parameśāni asurasya matānvitaḥ |
śakterduḥkhaṃ maheśāni maithunena daded yadi |
sa śaṭhaḥ sāpi śaktiśca tatkṣaṇāttaṃ parityajet || 7 ||

vṛthā vākyena deveśi śakticitta prakāśakaḥ |
mukharaṃ (gh, j: mūrkhañca) taṃ vijānīyāt tatsaṅgaṃ parivarjayet || 
8 ||

dambhena parameśāni śaktimānīya yatnataḥ |
dāmbhikaṃ taṃ vijānīyāt tasyā (j: tathā) lāpaṃ parityajet || 9 ||

ayatnena yadā śaktiṃ dambhenāpyānayet śive |
tasya (j: asya) saṅgaṃ (j: aṅgaṃ) tasya vākyaṃ sādhakasyāpi 
nāśakam || 10 ||

cumbakasyāpi dhūrttasya śaṭhasyāpi maheśvari |
mukharasya (gh, j: mūrkhasya) dāmbhikasya (gh, j: dāmbhikasyāpi) 
kāmukasya mataṃ vinā |
ramaṇaṃ hi prakarttavyaṃ surabhāvena (c: surā-) bhāvitaḥ || 11 ||

<p. 165>

varadātantre (-)

brahma viṣṇu śivādīnāṃ maithunasya prasādataḥ |
tatra snehena vaddho'haṃ gopanīyaṃ manaḥ sthiram |
prakāśañca karomyadya na prakāśyaṃ kadācana || 12 ||

maithunārthe.pyahaṃ devipuṃ deheṣu sadā sthitaḥ |
maithunārthe'pi tvaṃ devi nārīdehe sadā sthitā || 13 ||

bahunāpi kimuktena (j: niyuktena) maithunasya prasādataḥ |
ahaṃ jñānaṃ samāśritya deheṣu dihināmadhṛk || 14 ||

maithunaṃ paramaṃ jñānaṃ kriyāmātraṃ jaganmayam |
sthūle sūkṣme kriyāśakta stejasi khalu pārvati (gh: śaṅkari) || 15 ||

nigamakalpadrume | śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kriyayā parameśāna maithunaṃ tat prakīrttitaṃ |
maithunaṃ puṇyajanitaṃ kriyākto jñānavān yadi || 16 ||

āvirbhāvaṃ tirobhāvaṃ kriyāmātraṃ suniścitam |
teṣāṃ madhye cādyabījaṃ maithunāktaṃ kriyeti ca || 17 ||

sūkṣme'pi yā kriyā proktā mukhena bhāva varjitā |
bhāvārthe'pi mahādeva sthūladehe kriyā yutā || 18 ||

ananta vacasā deva sthirabuddhirvinaśyati |
ata eva mahādeva (gh: maheśāna) śakti (gh: nārī) deheṣu maithunam || 
19 ||

kāntāyāṃ maithunaṃ deva puṃdeheṣu sukhoditam |
puruṣasya sukhaṃ deva nārīdeheṣu maithunam || 20 ||

<p. 166>

bahudhā vacasā kimbā kathayāmi maheśvara |
strī puṃrūpamahaṃ tvañca ramaṇārthe prakāśitaṃ || 21 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse catvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ekacatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha pañcamānanda kathanam |

nigama kalpadrume (-) śrīśiva uvāca (-)

pañcatattvaṃ varārohe kevalānandadāyakam |
ratestulyaṃ mahānandaṃ teṣāṃ madhye na vidyate || 1 ||

ratimāhāmtya kathane yadānandaṃ bhaveddhruvam |
tadānandaṃ kathaṃ bhadre cānyatattveṣu vidyate || 2 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

ratiprasādāddeveśa tuṣṭāhaṃ sarvadā tvayi |
śaktirūpāhyahaṃ tena tiṣṭhāmi ca gṛhe gṛhe || 3 ||

nirvikāraṃ nirālambaṃ bhāvātītaṃ paraṃ mahat |
rati santoṣa bhogārthaṃ (j: sambhogatoṣārthaṃ) śivastvañca 
śivāpyaham || 4 ||

nārāyaṇītantre (-)

dvayoryyogācca subhage maithunaṃ jāyate dhruvam |
ahaṃ tvaṃ strī pumān rūpo (gh: rūpe) tiṣṭhāmi bhāvahetave || 5 ||

<p. 167>

svīrūpā brahmarūpāca puṃrūpo brahmavigrahaḥ |
kīṭādiṣu varārohe maithunārthe sadā sthitaḥ || 6 ||

yena yena prakāreṇa sānandaṃ jāyate dhruvam |
tena tena prakāreṇa vicaratyapi bhūtale || 7 ||

anyānande varārohe sthirajñānaṃ na jāyate |
sthirānandaṃ pañcameṣu pañcamaṃ muktidāyakam || 8 ||

ānande maithune devi sṛṣṭi sthiti layaḥ kṣitau |
ānandena vinā dehī kṣaṇamātraṃ na tiṣṭhati || 9 ||

ataścānandakaṃ brahma maithunaṃ hi parāt param |
yataśca (gh, ch: ataśca) maithunānadaṃ prakṛti puruṣātmakam || 10 ||

lalitākhyatantre (-)

vedamātājapenaiva brāhmaṇe nahi śaulaje |
brahma jñānaṃ yadā devi tadā brāhmaṇa ucyate || 11 ||

ata eva dvijāḥ sarve madya maithuna lālitāḥ |
madyapāne bhavejjñānī maithune tattavavān bhavet || 12 ||

jñānārṇave śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇanātheśa (ch, j: paramānanda) paratattveṣu mohitaḥ |
bhāvabhedena kathaya sādhakānanda (-) lakṣaṇam || 13 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

ānandārthī kriyāmārgī sādhako dvividhaḥ smṛtaḥ (ch: śive) |
kriyātmano lakṣaṇaṃ hi bahudhā prakaṭīkṛtam || 14 ||

saṃkṣepe'pyadhunā proktaṃ kriyā śaktasya lakṣaṇam |
yena mārgeṇa deveśi phalabhāg jāyate naraḥ || 15 ||

<p. 168>

atha kriyāmārgi sādhaka lakṣaṇam |

vinā śaktiṃ pivenmadyaṃ vinā madyena maithunam |
vinā mudrāṃ pivenmadyaṃ niṣphalaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 16 ||

vinā mīnaṃ yajet śaktiṃ vinā māṃsena tarpaṇam |
carvvaṇena vinā madyaṃ niṣphalaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 17 ||

atipānaṃ na karttavyaṃ bhāvātītaṃ bhaved yataḥ |
bhāvātīte kriyā naṣṭā vidyā naṣṭā kuleśvari || 18 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

atipāne bhaveddu.khaṃ loke (c: loka) nindā pravartate |
ata eva kriyāmārgī atipānaṃ nacācaret || 19 ||

atipāne maheśāni japa pūjādi niṣphalam |
ata eva kriyāmārgī (j: maheśāni) hyatipānaṃ nacācaret || 20 ||

ānanda kāraṇaṃ madyaṃ ānandaṃ mukti dāyakam (gh, ch, j: 
kāraṇam) |
ānandenaiva jñātavyaṃ sādhakasyāpi lakṣaṇam || 21 ||

khaṇḍānandaṃ vinā devi pūrṇānandaṃ na jāyate |
khaṇḍa jñānaṃ vinā devi pūrṇajñānaṃ (ch: pūrṇānandam) na 
jāyate || 22 ||

uttamaṃ sarvadānandaṃ hetunā madhyamaṃ śive |
maithunaṃ raktarahitam adhamānandakaṃ śive || 23 ||

uttamasyaika pātre'pi madhyamaḥsyāt (j: madhyamasya) tripātrakam |
bahupātre cādhamasya kvacidānanda mīritam || 24 ||

[iti sarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ekacatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[dvācatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

athānandārthi sādhaka lakṣaṇam |

jñānārṇave śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kriyā mārgi sādhakasya lakṣaṇaṃ bahudhā śrutam |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi sādhakānanda lakṣaṇam || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

krimārgī kriyāśaktaḥ pañcatattveṣu lubdhakaḥ |
jñānamārgī tritatvāktaḥ (gh, j: kriyātyaktaḥ) kevalānanda 
lubdhakaḥ || 2 ||

bhāvatīto jñāna mārgī bhāvātītaṃ hi maithunam |
bhāvātītaṃ pivenmadyaṃ sarva prāṇi hite rataḥ || 3 ||

nārāyaṇītantre (-)

sveṣṭavidyā sarvarūpā svātma jñānena bhāṣitā |
prāṇi naṣṭe cātmanaṣṭaṃ tritattvaṃ jñāni sevitam || 4 ||

pañca tattvasya deveśi phalaṃ pañcavidhaṃ yataḥ (j: matam) |
ata eva paṅka tattvaṃ pratyekaṃ jñāna dāyakam || 5 ||

madyaṃ mudrāṃ maithunaṃ hi tritattvaṃ triguṇānvitam |
sevanāt prasabhaṃ (gh, ch: prasavaṃ) siddhiḥ kālī tārā ca sundarī || 6 
||

kālikā kalpe (-)

vīrabhāvaṃ dvidhā jñeyaṃ daivamāsurameva ca |
deve tritattvaṃ paramaṃ (j: parame) pañcatattvāsure śive || 7 ||

<p. 170>

āsureṣu bhavenmuktirdaiveṣu mukti bhāg naraḥ |
anayośca yathā bhedaṃ tat śṛṇuṣva maheśvari || 8 ||

paśvācāraśca śaivaśca vīraśca divyaṃ eva ca |
siddhāntaśca bhavedbhāvaḥ kaulaśca bhāva varjitaḥ || 9 ||

bhāvātīte bhavenmuktirbhāvairvaddho bhavennaraḥ |
kaulācārasya bījaṃ hi divyaḥ siddhānta eva ca || 10 ||

āsure divya bhāvaṃ hi daive siddhānta eva ca |
divyo deva svarūpaśca siddhānto deva eva ca || 11 ||

nigamānande śrīdevyuvāca (-)

divya siddhāntayorbījaṃ dakṣa vāmīti śaṅkara |
imau dvau sevanīyau cet kaula (ch: kaulasya) jñānasya hetave (ch: 
jñānahetave) || 12 ||

[iti śrīsarvānanda nātha viracite sarvollāse dvācatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 
0 ||


[tricatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha daivānanda lakṣaṇam |

yāmale śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kīdṛśaḥ prathamollāso dvitīyaśca tṛtīyakaḥ |
caturthaḥ pañcamaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ saptāṣṭa navamo daśa (gh, j: 
saptamaścāṣṭama śiva) |
ānandaṃ pratipātrasya mama sthāne kramādvada || 1 ||

<p. 171>

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

indriyākalitaṃ sarvaṃ tattadbhāva vivarjitam |
tanmayaṃ niścalaṃ śāntaṃ ullāsādimudīritam || 2 ||

<1>	ullāse prathame prāpte tanmayañca japedhṛdi |
	nakuryyādadhikaṃ hetuṃ mudrācarvvaṇakāni ca || 3 ||

<2>	samadṛṣṭaṃ samaikatvaṃ mano buddhi vivarjitam |
	lakṣamalakṣamanyañca tanmayañcadvitīyakam || 4 ||

	prāptyānandamaye kurvan pratyeka kāraṇāni ca |
	kvaciddhyānaṃ japādiñca kvaciccarvaṇa mācaret || 5 ||

<3>	dehābhimāna galita mupalabdhi vivarjitam |
	viśrānti vāsanā yatrāpyullāsaṃ tat tṛtīyakam || 6 ||

tṛtīyollāsake (g, gh, ch: tṛtīyollāsakaṃ) prāpte kuryyāddhetuṃ 
yathārpitam |
carvannapi tathaivānyaṃ vicaret śāsane (k, kh, g: svāsane) 
sthitaḥ || 7 ||

<4>	antarlakṣa vahirdṛṣṭirnimeṣonmeṣa varjitaḥ |
	tanmayañca tadākāraṃ caturthānandamīritam || 8 ||

	tūryānandamayaṃ yatra hetuṃ śaktyā pivet saha |
śakti vīrārpitaṃ yadyattattad grāhyāṇi carvaṇam || 9 ||

<5>	jīvanmuktaṃ mano'tītaṃ viśrāntirguru maṇḍale |
	lakṣaṇañca varārohe pañcamaṃ parikīrtitam || 10 ||

	nahi pātre viviktāni (gh, j: viriktāni) vīraścaivārpitāni ca |
anyārpitaṃ hi yaccheṣaṃ kāraṇaṃ hi mukhaṃ (c, j: sukhaṃ) 
vinā |

<p. 172>

<6>	vāsanā vilayaṃ yatra bhāvā bhāva vivarjitam |
laye'pi svākṣaraṃ mantraṃ (gh, j: mātraṃ) devātmāhaṃ 
vicintanam (j: vicintayet) || 12 ||

ṣaṣṭhollāsetu deveśi tanmayaṃ hi jagattrayam |
tadā tāntrikatā cakre mādanantu (c: modana-) yathā sukham || 13 
||

<7>	svavāhyābhyantaraṃ sarvaṃ ātmarupaṃ vicintanam (ch, j: 
vicintayet) |
advaitaṃ paramānandaṃ cintanaṃ saptamaṃ priye |
saptame samatā (j: layatā) cakre tantre milanatā bhavet || 14 ||

<8>	pītāt śeṣaṃ punargrāhyaṃ yoginyai deyamuttamam |
	na kiñcidṛṣṭamānandaṃ kārya kāraṇameva ca || 15 ||

	eka eva hi nirdvandvaṃ cinmayañca cidātmakam |
pātraṃ vā mukhapātraṃ vā kevalāsyena (ch, j: anyena) sevitam 
|
	nṛtya gīta sadollāsaṃ kuryādvīrāṅganā saha || 16 ||

<9>	ullāse navame prāpte anirvādyaṃ tu yat sukham |
	kriyātītaṃ kalātītaṃ mano'tītaṃ sunirmalam || 17 ||

	śiva śaktyātmakaṃ dvandvaṃ nahi varṇa vivekatā |
	prāptiṃ vā mukha yonyādīn tatra kuryādyathārpitam |
	viśrāmamupaviṣṭā vā nopaviṣṭaṃ yathārpitam || 18 ||

<10>	na jānāmi varārohe daśamānandajaṃ sukham |
kalātītaṃ mano'tītaṃ kriyātītaṃ (ch: bhāvātītaṃ) 
parātmakam || 19 ||

	tiṣṭhan gacchan svapn jāgrat krīḍan mīlan muhurmuhuḥ |
	svecchācāraṃ kriyāmātraṃ kevalātma sukhoditam || 20 ||

	pītvā pītvā punaḥ pītvā svecchayā maithunoditam |
	utthāya punaḥ pītvā, pītvā pītvāpi maithunam || 21 ||

	ata eva maheśāni maithunaṃ na parityajet |
	utpatteḥ kāraṇaṃ bījaṃ maithunaṃ parameśvari |
	vināśa kāraṇaṃ jñeyaṃ sthiteḥ kāraṇameva ca || 22 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse tricatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 0 
||


[catuścatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha maithunam |

vīratantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kuleśa prāṇa nātheśa jagadānanda rūpaka |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi maithunasya ca lakṣaṇam || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

brahma viṣṇu śivādīnāṃ maithunasya prasādataḥ |
tava snehena vaddho'haṃ gopanīyaṃ manaḥsthiram || 2 ||

prakāśañca karomyadya na prakāśyaṃ kadācana |
citrāsane nātinīce nāticocce maheśvari || 3 ||

ānīya sundarīṃ kāntāṃ nirlajjāṃ cāruhāsinīm |
madyaṃ māṃsañca matsyañca mudrāñca maithuna (k, kh, c: 
maithunaṃ) priyām || 4 ||

svavāme vāpyurusthāne sthāpayenmanunā śive |
kāraṇaṃ pūritaṃ pātraṃ mūle dattvā mukhe muhuḥ || 5 ||

<p. 174>

paścāt svayaṃ pived dravyaṃ (gh: madyaṃ) māṃsaṃ matsyādinā 
priye |
sarvaṃ dattvā mukhe devyāṃ paścādātmani yojayet || 6 ||

mahācakramiti proktaṃ maithunaṃ saṃyutaṃ yadi |
taccakrasya ca māhātmyaṃ varṇitaṃ naiva śakyate || 7 ||

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

mūle vastraṃ parityajya mūlena bhaga vīkṣaṇam |
mūlena sparśanaṃ kṛtvā mūlena liṅgaveśanam || 8 ||

gaṇḍa dvayaṃ cumbanañca stana dvandvañca mardanam |
rasanā coṣaṇaṃ devi maithunaṃ tadanantaram || 9 ||

mūlena sarvaṃ karttarvyaṃ śukre śukra prapātanam |
guruṃ dhyātvā ramet śaktiṃ patanānte (gh: pātanānte; j: 
ghātanānte) manuṃsmaret || 10 ||

evaṃ daśa śataṃ vāpi sahasraṃ (gh, j: cāyutaṃ) vā manuṃ smaret |
gurave dakṣiṇārthāya cāṣṭavāraṃ japenmanum || 11 ||

śukra pātaṃ tataḥ kuryyāt tadante prapaṭhet stutim |
ādyante prapaṭhet stotraṃ śakti vidyāṃ vicintayet |
śivo'hamiti matvā ca ramaṇaṃ mama sammatam || 12 ||

nigama kalpadrume (-)

yonistotraṃ vinā deva yoni jñānaṃ na jāyate |
yoni jñānaṃ vinā deva maithunaṃ na śubha pradam || 13 ||

kula sambhava pūjāyāmādyante prapaṭhet stutim |
madhye devīṃ yajed gānaṃ pānaṃ nṛtyaṃ japañcaret || 14 ||

<p. 175>

śṛṇu devi sura śreṣṭhe surāsuranamaskṛte |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi stotraṃ hi sarvadurlabham |
yasyāvabodhanāddehe dehī brahma mayo bhavet || 15 ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

śṛṇu deva suraśreṣṭha sarva bījasya (gh, ch, j: jīvasya) sammatam |
na vaktavyaṃ kadācittu pāṣaṇḍe nāstike nare || 1 ||

mamaiva prāṇa sarvasvaṃ latāstotraṃ digambara (!) |
asya prapaṭhanāddeva jīvanmukto'pi jāyate || 17 ||

<1>	oṃ bhaga rūpā jaganmātā sṛṣṭisthitilayānvitā |
	daśavidyāsvarūpātmā yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 18 ||

<2>	koṇa traya yutā devi stuti nindā vivarjitā |
	jagadānanda saṃbhūtā yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 19 ||

<3>	rakta rūpā jaganmātā yonimadhye sadā sthirā |
	brahma viṣṇu śiva prāṇā yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 20 ||

<4>	kārttikī kuntalaṃ rūpaṃ yonyupari suśobhitam |
	bhukti mukti pradā yoniryonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 21 ||

<5>	vīraya rūpā śailaputrī madhyasthāne virājitā |
brahma viṣṇu śiva śreṣṭhā (g, ch, j: -prāṇā) yonirmāṃ pātu 
sarvadā || 22 ||

<6>	yonimadhye mahākālī chidrarūpā suśobhanā |
sukhadā madanāgārā yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 23 ||

<7>	kālyādi yoginī devī yonikoṇeṣu saṃsthitā (gh, j: sadā sthitā) |
	manoharā duḥkha labhā yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 24 ||

<p. 176>

<8>	sadā śivo meru rūpo yonimadhye vaset sadā |
kaivalyadā kāmayuktā (gh, j: ratā) yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 
25 ||

<9>	sarva deva stutā (gh, j: yutā) yoniḥ sarva deva prapūjitā |
	sarva prasavakartrī tvaṃ yonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 26 ||

<10>	sarva tīrtha mayī yoniḥ sarva pāpa praṇāśinī |
	sarva gehe (gh, j: dehe) sthitā yoniryonirmāṃ pātu sarvadā || 27 ||

<11>	muktidā (j: bhuktidā) dhanadā sukhadā kīrttidā tathā |
	ārogyadā vīra ratā pañca tatva yutā sadā (gh, j: yutā) || 28 ||

<12>	yonistotramidaṃ proktaṃ yaḥ paṭhet yoni sannidhau |
śaktirūpā mahādevī tasya gehe sadā sthirā || 29 ||

<13>	tīrtha paryaṭanaṃ nāsti nāsti pūjādi tarpaṇam |
puraścaraṇaṃ (gh, j: puraścaryāpi)  nāstyeva tasya 
muktirakhaṇḍitā || 30 ||

kevalaṃ maithunenaiva śiva tulyo na saṃśayaḥ |
satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyaṃ mamavākyaṃ vṛthā nahi || 31 ||

yadi mithyā mayā proktā tava hatyā supātakī |
kṛtāñjali puṭobhūtvā paṭhet stotraṃ digambara (!) || 32 ||

sarvatīrtheṣu yat puṇyaṃ labhate ca sa sādhakaḥ |
kālyādi daśa vidyāśca gaṅgādi tīrtha koṭayaḥ |
yoni (ch, j: yoneḥ) darśana mātreṇa sarvāḥ sākṣānna saṃśayaḥ 
(ch, j: cānyathā) || 33 ||

kula sambhava pūjāyāmādau cānte paṭhedidam |
anyathā pūjanāddeva ramaṇaṃ maraṇaṃ bhavet || 34 ||

ekasandhyāṃ trisandhyāṃ vā paṭhet stotramananyadhīḥ |
niśāyāṃ sammukhe śaktyāḥ sa śivo nātra saṃśayaḥ || 35 ||

<p. 177>

iti yoni stotram |

stotrānte parameśāna kāraṇaṃ pāni pūritam |
vāmahaste pradātavyaṃ guhyā di mantra pūrvakam || 36 ||

atha śrīcakra pādodaka māhātmyam |

(śloko'yaṃ gh, ch, j (-) puṣtake nāsti) gaṅgā puṣkara narmadāsu 
yamunā godāvarī gautamī (-)
gaṅgā dvāra gayā prayāga vadarī vārāṇasī sindhuṣu |
rivā setu sarasvatī prabhṛtiṣu brahmāṇḍa bhāṇḍodare
tīrtha snāna sahasra koṭi phaladaṃ śrīcakra pādodakam || 37 ||

tataḥ (-)

bhaga kṣālita toyena pātra kṣālita vāriṇā |
liṅga kṣālita toyena prakṣiped vindu bindubhiḥ || 38 ||

yonau hastaṃ mukhe stotraṃ śakti haste'pi pātrakam |
sugandhaṃ śītalaṃ toyaṃ prakṣipet tattva mudrayā || 39 ||

tantrāntare (-)

pātraṃ suśītalaṃ kuryyāt śrīpātrādikrameṇa ca |
guroḥ pātrād deva pātrādātma pātrānmaheśvari || 40 ||

sādhakasyāpi pātrācca toyaṃ kṣiptaṃ mahītale |
tattoyaiḥ kardamaṃ kṛtvā lalāṭe tilakaṃ nyaset || 41 ||

vibhinna śakti pātrañced guru pātrānmaheśvari |
śakti pātrāt pātramātrāt toyaṃ kṣiptaṃ mahītale || 42 ||

<p. 178>

kula tattvasāre (-)

bhagālliṅgāttathā pātrāt śrīpātre śītalaṃ sthitam |
toyaṃ kṣipet svamūrddhādi binduñca tattva mudrayā || 43 ||

yaṃ yaṃ spṛśāmi pādena yaṃ yaṃ paśyāmi cakṣuṣā |
sa eva dāsatāṃ yāti yadi śakra samo bhavet || 44 ||

iti mantreṇa deveśi mūla mantreṇa vā punaḥ |
avaśiṣṭa jalairdevi kardame tilakaṃ nyaset || 45 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse catuścatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 
0 ||


[pañcacatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

cakrānte parameśāni śānti stotraṃ paṭhenmudā || 1 ||

athānanda stotram |

kulārṇave (-)

<1>	(k, kh, g, c: manobhuvo maṅgala maṅgalātmā saundaryalakṣmī 
bhuvi vaijayantīm) namo guro maṅgala mūla mudrāṃ,
	saundarya lakṣmīṃ bhuvi vaijayantīm |
	śrīsundarīmindu kalāvataṃ sāṃ,
	sānandamānandamayīṃ smarāi (k kh, g, gh, c: bhajāmi) || 2 ||

<p. 179>

<2>	śrīsundarī pūjana tatpurāṇāṃ,
	hālābhirālohita locanānām |
	asmākamānandita mānasānāṃ,
māheśvarāṇāṃ (gh, c: ma-) divasāḥ prayāntu || 3 ||

<3>	vidhāya dhārāṃ vadane sudhāyāḥ,
	śrīcakramabhyarcya kula krameṇa |
	āsvādayantaḥ piśitaṃ mṛgākṣī(-)
māliṅgya mokṣaṃ sudhiyaḥ prayānti (gh, ch, j: sudhiyolabhante) 
|| 4 ||

<4>	dine dine siddhi (k, g, c: śuddhi) ghaṭastu pūrṇo,
dine dine tarpaṇamastu devyāḥ |
dine dine saṃghaṭatāṃ dvitīyā,
dine dine sādhaka saṅgamastu (j: saṅgamo'stu) || 5 ||

<5>	(śloko'yaṃ ja pustake dṛśyate nānyatra) āsvādayantaḥ 
piśitasya khaṇḍa
	mākaṇṭhapūrṇaṃ madirāṃ pivāmaḥ |
	vāmekṣaṇāsaṅgamamādadhānā
	bhuktiñca muktiñca parāṃ vrajāmaḥ || 6 ||

<6>	(śloko'yaṃ gh, j: pustakoyordṛśyate) na svādu lābhaḥ 
piśitasya yasmin,
	pañcākṣarī pūrṇa ratirna yatra |
	na yatra saṅgo mṛga locanāyā(-)
	stattaddinaṃ durdinameva manye || 7 ||

<7>	pravarttakānāṃ sahasrātha (k, g, c: sahasātu) lakṣmīḥ
	prayāti gehaṃ vi pada (j: supada) krameṇa |
	śrīsundarī sādhaka nindakānā(-)
	(j: prāṇā dhanānīha layaṃ prayānti) māyuḥ kṣayaṃ gacchati 
tatkṣaṇena || 8 ||

<p. 180>

<8>	aṅgeṣu kuṣṭhādi gṛheṣvalakṣmī
	rmūkatvamāsye bhavanaṃ śmaśānam |
	śrīsundarī sādhaka nindakānām
prāṇā (j: āyuḥkṣayaṃ gacchati tatkṣaṇena) yataste pralayaṃ 
prayānti || 9 ||

<9>	śrīsundarī sādhaka puṅgavānām
	yathā yathā nindanamātanoti |
	janaḥ samaḥ putra kalatra mitrai (-)
	stathā nāśamupaiti śīghram || 10 ||

<10>	hālāṃ pivan (k, g, c: pivan dīkṣita mandireṣu,
	svapanniśāyāṃ gaṇikā gṛheṣu |
	gṛhe gṛhe bhojanameva kurvan,
	vaṃbhramyate kaulika (j: sādhaka) cakravartti || 11 ||

<11>	anantaraṃ kāla vaśācca moham,
	so'haṃ bhaviṣyāmi na me viṣādaḥ |
	(k, kh, g: śrīsundarī janmani janmalīlām) janmani janmani tvām,
	yadbhairavo'haṃ jananīṃ smarāmi (k, kh, g, c: samohe) || 12 ||

<12>	vikalpa vāṭī taṭa sannikṛṣṭe,
	pravarttamānāḥ paśavo varākāḥ |
	praviśya mohāmbunidhāvagagādhe,
	bhramantyanāsvādita (ch, j: anāsādita) kaula mārgāḥ || 13 ||

<p. 181>

<13>	unmūlanaṃ pātaka bhūruhāṇā(-)
	munmīlanaṃ citta kutūhalānām |
	ākarṣaṇaṃ paṅkaruhekṣaṇānāṃ,
	maireya (kh, c: naivedya) pānaṃ vayamācarāmaḥ || 14 ||

<14>	vārāṇasi jahnu sutā prayāga
	(j: godāvarī kedāratīrthāni vilokitāni) godāvarītīrtha 
vilokanāni |
	tainaiva manye jagataḥ kṛtāni,
	śrīsundarī cintanameva yasya || 15 ||

<15>	āyātayātena bhavāmburāśau,
	jāto mahāneṣa mama prayāsaḥ |
	mokṣāya nāthasya pada prasādā (-)
	daṅgīkṛtaḥ samprati kaulamārgaḥ || 16 ||

<16>	nānyaṃ viloke na ca vānyamīhe,
	nānyaṃ smarannāparamāśrayāmi |
	kadāpi nāhaṃ paramātma rūpāṃ,
	śrīsundarīṃ cetasi vismarāmi || 17 ||

<17>	vilokya (k, kh, g, c: vilikhya) sindūra mayaṃ sudhābhiḥ,
	śrīcakrarājaṃ niśi kḷptavantaḥ (k, kh, g, c: tarpayantaḥ) |
	śrīsundarīṃ cetasi cintayanto,
(k, kh, g, c: hālā vilolairviṣayanti lokān) helāvilokairvaśayanti 
lokān || 18 ||

<18>	yatrāsti bhogo na ca tatra mokṣo,
	yatrāsti mokṣo naca tatra bhogaḥ |
(gh: śivāpadāmbhoja yugārcakānām) śrīsundarī pūjana 
tatparāṇāṃ,
bhogaśca mokṣaśca karastha eva || 19 ||

<19>	vāme vālā (gh, j: rāmā) ramaṇa kuśalā dakṣiṇe pāna 
pātram,
	agre nyastaṃ maricasahitaṃ śūkarasyoṣṇa māṃsam |
	skandhe vīṇā lalita subhagā satkathā sadguruṇām (gh, ch, j: 
sadgurūṇāṃ pravṛttiḥ),
	kaula dharmmaḥ parama gahano yogināmapyagamyaḥ || 20 ||

<20>	vāme candramukhī mukhe ca madhuraṃ pātraṃ karāmbhoruhe,
	mūrdhni śrīguru cintanaṃ bhagavatī dhyānāspadaṃ mānase |
	jihvāhyāṃ japa sādhanaṃ pariṇatiḥ kaula kramābhyāsato, (j: 
kaulāṅganādhyāsane),
	yaḥ śānto niyataṃ (j: yatpātraṃ) pivettadamṛtaṃ bhuktiñca 
(ch: bhaktiñca) bhuktiṃ vrajet || 21 ||

<21>	ekena śuṣka caṇakena ghaṭaṃ pivāmi,
	vāpīṃ pivāmi sahasā lavaṇārdrakeṇa |
	āsvādayāmi yadi śodhita māṃsa khaṇḍam,
	gaṅgāṃ pivāmi yamunāṃ saha sāgareṇa || 22 ||

<22>	kare pātraṃ mukhe stotramānandaṃ hṛdayāmbuje(-)
	mūrdhni śrīnātha pādābjaṃ smaraṇaṃ kimataḥ param || 23 ||

<23>	ali piśita purandhrī yoga (gh, c, ch: bhoga) pūjā paro'ham,
	vahuvidha jana bhāvārambha (j: kulamārgārambha) 
sambhāvito'ham |
	guru caraṇa rajo'haṃ (gh j: rato) bhairavīmāśrito'ham,
	paśujana vimukho'haṃ (gh, j: virato) bhairavo'haṃ śivo'ham || 
<24> ||

<p. 183>

iti kulārṇavoktānanda stotram |

(śloko'yaṃ j: pustake dṛśyate nānyatra) pītvā madyaṃ paṭhet 
stotraṃ sādhakaḥ kulabhairavaḥ |
kula strī saṅga nirataḥ kulakāryaṃ samācaret || 25 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse pañca catvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] 
|| 0 ||


[ṣaṭcatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

athābhiṣekaḥ |

ūttaratantre śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

abhiṣekaṃ vinā devi kula kāryaṃ na cācaret |
pānañca viṣa pānaṃ syāt maithunaṃ pāpadāyakam || 1 ||

abhiṣekaṃ (gh, j: abhiṣeke) vinā bhūte ācāryatvaṃ karoti yaḥ |
catvāri (k, kh g: catvāraḥ) tasya naśyanti āyurvidyā yaśo valam || 2 ||

guptañca sarvatantreṣu tava snehena śaṅkari |
abhiṣekaṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvasiddhi pradāyakam || 3 ||

dhanaṃ yaśo valāyuṣyaṃ mahāpātaka nāśanam |
sarvāśā pūrakaṃ sarva mantra doṣa vināśanam || 4 ||

sarvārtha sādhanaṃ devi sarvatīrtha phalapradam |
abhicāra haraṃ sarvaṃ grahadoṣa vināśanam || 5 ||

<p. 184>

tejo vṛddhi karaṃ devi vala vṛddhi karaṃ param |
takṣakeṇāpi daṣṭasya viṣapīḍā vināśanam || 6 ||

tejo hrāse vala hrāse buddhi hrāse dhana kṣaye |
strīkṛteṣvapi doṣeṣu śarīre mānase tathā || 7 ||

vikāre deśikaḥ (j: mānase) kuryādabhiṣekaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ |
asaubhāgye ca nārīṇāmabhiṣekaḥ pravarttate || 8 ||

sarva doṣa haro dharmaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ hi śaṅkari (j: pārvati) |
nadī tīre deva bhūmau taru mūle catuṣpathe || 9 ||

devatāyatane vāpi sthāpayed ghaṭamuttamamam (j: avraṇam) |
nātihrasvaṃ nātidīrghaṃ mṛṇmayaṃ svarṇa (gh, c, j: mṛttāmra 
svarṇa) nirmitam || 10 ||

kāmabījena (klīṃ) saṃprokṣya vāgbhavenaiva (ai/) śodhayet |
śaktyā (hrī/) kalasamāropya māyayā (hrī/) pūrayejjalaiḥ |
mantreṇānena deveśi tīrthānyāvāhayettataḥ || 11 ||

oṃ gaṅgādyāḥ saritaḥ sarvāḥ samudrāśca sarāṃsi ca |
sarve samudrāḥ saritaḥ sarāṃsi jaladā hradāḥ ( gh, j: nadāḥ) || 12 ||

sarve prasravaṇāḥ puṇyāḥ svarga pātāla bhūgatāḥ |
sarvetīrthāni puṇyāni ghaṭe kurvantu sannidhim || 13 ||

ramābījena (śrīṃ) japtena pallavaiḥ pratipādayet |
kūrcena (hrūṃ) phaladānaṃ syāt vadhṛbījaiḥ (j: strībījena) (strī) 
sthirākṛtiḥ || 14 ||

(j: sindūraṃ vahnibījena puṣpaṃ dadyācca vāyunā) strībījena 
(strīṃ) ca sindūraṃ puṣpaṃ dattvā tathā priye (gh: dadyāt svareṇa 
ca phaṭ) |
mūlena dūrvāṃ praṇavaiḥ kuryādabhyukṣaṇaṃ tataḥ || 15 ||

<p. 185>

hu(/) phaṭsvāheti mantreṇa kuryāddarbhaiśca (k: kumbhasya) tāḍanam |
(pāṭho'yaṃ j: pustake dṛśyate nānyatra) vicintya devī pīṭhantu 
tatrāvāhya prapūjayet || 16 ||

svatantrokta vidhānena mantrasyoccāraṇena tu (ch: 
mantrasyoddhāraṇena tu; j: svamantroddhāraṇaiḥ saha) |
ghaṭaṃ saṃsthāpayenmantrī (gh, j: pūjayettad ghaṭaṃ mantrī) 
mantreṇānena deśikaḥ || 17 ||

oṃ uttiṣṭha brahma kalasa (!) devatābhīṣṭa siddhida |
sarvatīrthāmbu sampūrṇa pūrayasva (j: pūrayāsmat) manoratham || 18 
||

īśānendu svara kṣauṇī (gh, j: mantrastu hasakala hrī/) tadante 
bhuvaneśvarīi |
mantreṇānena vāditra nirghoṣaiścālayedghaṭam (k, kh, g, c: 
vāmutranirghoṣaḥ) || 19 ||

abhiṣiñced guruḥ śiṣyaṃ yadvā deśika nāyakaḥ |
jvare gātre grahe'śvatthapallavairbhūta (k, kh, g, c, ch: gṛhe) saṅgame 
|| 20 ||

siñcedauḍumbarairmantra doṣe ca karavīrajaiḥ |
yaśo dhanāyustejaḥsu śrīphalasyāpi pallavaiḥ || 21 ||

(pāṭho'yaṃ j: pustake dṛśyate) tulasī mañjarībhiśca sarva pāpa 
kṣayārthibhiḥ |
sarva tīrtha phala prāptyai śāktānāṃ vilva sambhavaiḥ (itaḥ param (-) 
j: pustake (-) abhicāre nārasiṃhairabhiṣekaḥ pracakṣate | ityādi pāṭho 
dṛśyate || 22 ||

(j: kuryāddarbhaiśca doṣeṣu strīkṛteṣvakhileṣu ca) kuryād 
darbhairadarbheṣu strīdiṣeṣu kṛteṣu ca |
asaubhāgye ca nārīṇāṃ dūrvābhirabhiṣecanam || 23 ||

athavā sarva kāryeṣu vidadhyādāmra pallavaiḥ || 24 ||

dakṣiṇā mūrtiḥ ṛṣiranuṣṭupchandaḥ śaktirdevatā 
sarvasaṅkalpasiddhyarthe viniyogaḥ |

<p. 186>

<1>	oṃ rājarājeśvarī śaktirbhairavī rudrabhairavī |
śmaśāna bhairavī devī tripurānanda bhairavī || 25 ||

	trikūṭā tripuṭā (k, kh, c, ch: tripurā) devī tathā tripurasundarī |
	tripureśī mahādevī tathā tripuramālikā || 26 ||

	tripurānandinī devī tathaiva tripurātanī |
	etāstvāmabhiṣiñcantu mantrapūtena vāriṇā || 27 ||
