<p. 190>

<22>	nabhaśca (k: natiśca) vallabhā (svāhā) vahnervaṣaṭ kūrca (hu/) 
mataḥ pram |
	vauṣaṭkārastu phaṭkāro'bhiṣiñcantu sarvadā || 66 ||

<23>	naśyantu pretakuṣmāṇḍā rākṣasā dānavāśca ye |
	piśācā guhyakā bhūtā abhiṣekeṇa tāḍitāḥ || 67 ||

<24>	alakṣmīḥ kālakarṇī (k, g, c: kākālī) ca pāpāni sumahānti ca |
	naśyantu cābhiṣekeṇa tārāvījena (strī/) tāḍitāḥ || 68 ||

(cihnitāḥ ślokāḥ j: pustake dṛśyate)

<25>	rogāḥ śokāśca dāridryaṃ daurvalyaṃ cittavikriyā |
	naśyantu cābhiṣekeṇa vāgbījenaiva (ai/) tāḍitāḥ || 69 ||

(cihnitāḥ ślokāḥ j: pustake dṛśyante)

<26>	lokānurāga tyāgaśca daurbhāgyamapi duryaśaḥ |
	naśyantu cābhiṣekeṇa manmathenaiva (klī/) tāḍitāḥ || 70 ||

<27>	tejo hrāse buddhihrāse śaktihrāse tathaiva ca |
	naśyantu cābhiṣekeṇa śaktibījena (hrī/) tāḍitāḥ || 71 ||

(cihnitāḥ ślokāḥ j: pustake dṛśyante)

<28>	viṣāviṣṭamahārogā ḍākinyabhibhavastathā |
	ghorābhicārāḥ krūrāśca grahā rāgāstathaiva ca |
	naśyantu cābhiṣekeṇa kālībījena (krī/) tāḍitāḥ || 72 ||

<29>	naśyantu vipadaḥ sarvāḥ sampadaḥ santu susthirāḥ |
	abhiṣekeṇa śāktena pūrṇāḥ santu manorathāḥ || 73 ||

ityuttaratantre abhiṣekaḥ ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse ṣaṭcatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 
0 ||


[saptacatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha dakṣiṇācāra vīrasya bhāvaḥ |

svadharma (-) nirato vīraḥ śivo bhūtvā yajet parām |
sa eva dakṣiṇācāraḥ sarvatantreṣu gopitaḥ || 1 ||

muṇḍamālā tantre (-)

madyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ mudrā maithunameva ca |
pañca tattva yuto vīraḥ śivaḥ sākṣānna saṃśayaḥ || 2 ||

śaṅkaro'hamiti jñātvā kalā māhātmyasaṃyutaḥ |
kalāṃ kālīṃ cintayitvā pūjayedramaṇena tu || 3 ||

sādhakaḥ śaṅkaraḥ sākṣānnāsti bhedo maheśvari (gh: kiyānapi) |
mohāt yaḥ kurute bhedaṃ rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet || 4 ||

nāhaṃ vasāmi kailāse na merau na ca bhūtale |
kulajñā yatra tiṣṭhanti tatra tiṣṭhāmi bhāvinī || 5 ||

matsyamāṃsāsavāsakto (ch, j: -māṃsasurāsakto) lolupaḥ strīṣu 
sarvadā |
śivo'hamiti saṃjñāya viharet śakti saṅkaṭe || 6 ||

sarva jātyadhamo devi śvapaco nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śvapaco'gri kula jñānī dvijasyāpyadhikaṃ (j: dvijādapyadhikaṃ) 
śive ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvāllāse saptacatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] 
|| 0 ||


[aṣṭacatvāriṃśollāsaḥ] |

atha vāmācāraḥ |

samayācāra tantre (-)

svapuṣpaiḥ pañca tattvaiśca pūjayet kulayoṣitām |
vāmā cāraḥ sa vijñeyo vāmā bhūtvā yajet parām (j: śivām) || 1 ||

svapuṣpasya pramāṇamāha |

nigama kalpadrume śrīdevyuvāca (-)

pañcapuṣpeṇa vā sapta puṣpeṇa pūjayet śivām |
pūjayitvā niśīthe tu ramaṇaṃ śaktimāśritam (j: śaktibhiḥ saha) || 2 
||

svapuṣpañca svayambhuñca vajraṃ kuṇḍodbhavaṃ śiva |
golakaṃ pañcadhā puṣpaiḥ pūjayet parameśvarīm || 3 ||

gopī candana puṣpeṇa vīra puṣpeṇa śaṅkara (j: maraṇenācca 
yecchivām) |
saptapuṣpeṇa saṃpūjya niśīthe ramaṇena tu || 4 ||

uddhṛtenaiva puṣpeṇa yantraṃ kṛtvārccayet śivām |
anuddhṛtena puṣpeṇa ramaṇenārccayet śivām || 5 ||

uddhṛtya puṣpaṃ saṃśuddhaṃ kṛtvā devīṃ yajet parām (gh: 
prapūjayet) |
anuddhṛtaṃ svayaṃ (j: anuddhṛta dhiyaṃ ) śuddhaṃ samudrasya jalaṃ 
yathā || 6 ||

puṇyena labhate puṣpaṃ śata janmārjitena ca |
svayambhūkusumādiñca devānāmapi durlabham || 7 ||

<p. 193>

atha svayambhū svapuṣpa prabhṛti kusumānāṃ

vidhāna nirūpaṇam |

nigama kalpadrume (-)

vivāhitāyāḥ kanyāyāḥ prathame ṛtu sambhave |
tacchoṇitaṃ maheśāna svapuṣpaṃ parikīrtitam || 8 ||

avivāhitāyāḥ kanyāyā liṅgasparśādrajasvalā |
tad dravyañca mahādeva svayambhu kusumaṃ prabho || 9 ||

vivāhitāyāḥ kanyāyāḥ puruṣasya ca tāḍanāt |
yadi puṣpaṃ samudbhūtaṃ vajraṃ tat parikalpitam (gh, j: parikīrtitam) 
|| 10 ||

bharttṛyuktā ca yā (j: ṛtuyuktā yadā) nārī puruṣānyasya yogataḥ |
raktaṃ samutkṣared yonyā athavā garbhasaṃkaṭāt |
kuṇḍodbhavaṃ sa vijñeyaṃ śṛṇu golodbhavaṃ (j: 
pūrṇakālodbhavaṃ) priya || 11 ||

svāmi śūnyā ca yā nārī jāra yogādrajasvalā (g, gh, j: rajoyutā) |
tadraktaṃ golakaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvakālodbhavaṃ śṛṇu || 12 ||

māsi māsi ca yadraktaṃ kṣarate yoni maṇḍalāt |
tadraktaṃ parameśāna sarva kālodbhavaṃ priya || 13 ||

puruṣe maithune yukte yadraktaṃ śukra miśritam |
kṣarate ca bhagādraktaṃ taddravyaṃ (gh, j: raktaṃ) gopī candanam || 14 
||

sva strīṣu maithune deva yat puṣpaṃ samupasthitam |
tat puṣpaṃ vīra puṣpañca svayambhū kusumaṃ śṛṇu || 15 ||

<p. 194>

māsi māsi ca (gh, j: sarvāsāmapi) nārīṇāṃ svayambhū 
kusumādikam |
viśeṣaṃ gaṇikāyāstu cāṇḍālyāstu viśeṣakam (gh, j: 
cāṇḍālyāḥ kuhusambhavaṃ) || 16 ||

atha svapuṣpādi śuddhiḥ (kha-) |

mātṛkābhedatantre (-)

aśaucitātmā yasyāpi sarvaṃ tasyāpyaśaucitam |
pūtātmanaśca pūtātmā sarvaṃ pūtaṃ maheśvari || 17 ||

aśaucitaṃ tridhā jñeyaṃ śaucaṃ śaucaṃ jñeyaṃ tridhā priye |
kulācārāt kaulikādvā (k, g, c: laukikādvā) moha śāstrāt kuleśvari 
|
sarvaṃ pūtañcāśucitaṃ svakārye nādhikāritā || 18 ||

tantrāntare (-)

sarvakāryeṣu sarvatra vaidika nāntrikeṣu ca |
anāsthaiva maheśāni sarva karma vinaśyati || 19 ||

kaulādvā kaulikādvāpi (k, g, c: laukikādvāpi) jñāna 
śāstrānmaheśvari |
sarva pūtaṃ hi vijñeyaṃ sarva kārye'dhikāritā || 20 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse aṣṭacatvāriṃśadullāsaḥ] || 
0 ||


[ūnapañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha svapuṣpādi svayambhavādi puṣpa śodhana mantraḥ |

nigama kalpadrume (-)

māyābījaṃ samuddhṛtya vahni bījaṃ samuddharet |
caturddaśa svaropetaṃ nādavindu vibhūṣitam || 1 ||

kṣakāraṃ vahnisaṃyuktaṃ vāmanetra vibhūṣitam |
śodhayeddaśadhā japtvā svayambhū kusumaṃ priya || 2 ||

mantrastu hrī(/) rau(/) kṣrī(/) |

vāgbhavaṃ bījamuccārya kāmabījaṃ tataḥ param |
tadante vahnibījantu śuddhaṃ kuṇḍodbhavaṃ priya || 3 ||

mantrasu ai(/) klī(/) ra(/) |

māyābījatrayañcoktvā śodhayet golakaṃ priya || 4 ||

mantrastu hrī(/) hrī(/) hrī(/) |

kāmabījatrayaṃ māyāṃ samuccārya maheśvara |
sarvakālodbhavaṃ dravyaṃ śodhayet bahuyatnataḥ || 5 ||

mantrastu klī(/) klī(/) klī(/) hrī(/) |

vadhūbījaṃ kāmabījaṃ samuccārya dvayaṃ dvayam |
gopīcandanamīśāna śodhayet bahuyatnataḥ || 6 ||

mantrastu strī(/) strī(/) klī(/) klī(/) |

mūlena śodhayeddeva (!) svapuṣpaṃ vajrapuṣpakam |
pūjayettu kuleśānīṃ kulācāreṇa sādhakaḥ || 7 ||

anyat sarva śaktijātaṃ mūlena manunā priya (gh, j: śiva) |
śodhayet pūjayeddevīṃ yatra tatraiva kalpanam (kh: siddhaye) || 8 ||

<p. 196>

bhaga kṣālita toyena liṅga kṣālita vāriṇā |
mūtrodakena śukreṇa yajedāvaraṇaṃ yataḥ || 9 ||

bhaga liṅga kṣālitañca śodhayet kāryya siddhaye |
kāma (k, g, c: ramā) bījaṃ vadhūbījaṃ śabdabījaṃ tathāhi phaṭ || 
10 ||

mantrastu klī(/) strī(/) hu(/) phaṭ |

mūtrasya śodhanaṃ mantraṃ śṛṇuṣva prāṇa vallabha (!) |
śabda bījaṃ phaḍantañca vahni jāyā tataḥ param |
namo'ntoyaṃ mahādeva mūtra śuddhirvidhīyate || 11 ||

mantrastu hu(/) phaṭ svāhā namaḥ |

śukrasya śodhana deva iṣṭa mantreṇa (gh, j: vauṣaḍantena) māyayā || 
12 ||

mantrastu iṣṭamantraḥ hrī(/) ca |

(iti gh: pustake adhikaḥ pāṭhaḥ) śukradvayaṃ śodhitaṃ syāt 
māyayā puṭitaṃ vaṣaṭ |
śabda bījantu tasyānte phaḍanta mantramīritam || 13 ||

mantrastu (-) hrī(/) vaṣaṭ hrī(/) hu(/) phaṭ |

evaṃ krame mahādeva śuddhaṃ kuryāt pṛthak pṛthak |
bhūmau trikoṇamālikhya vāmenaivārghya vāriṇā (gh, j: bindunā) || 
14 ||

śuddha toyena saṃprokṣya kāraṇenāthavā sakṛt |
mūlamantraṃ samuccārya pañca mudrāṃ pradarśayet |
sāmānya śuddhaṃ taddravyaṃ viśeṣaṃ mantra bhāṣitam || 15 ||

atha pañca mudrā pramāṇam |

kubjikā tantre (-)

dhenumudrā tatsyamudrā bhūtinyākarṣiṇī tathā |
yonimudreti paramā pañca mudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 16 ||

<p. 197>

dhenumudrāmṛtaṃ dravyaṃ matsyena vāripūritam |
bhūtinī pañcabhūtañca milanākarṣamudrayā |
yonimudrā sṛṣṭi bījaṃ jñātvā (j: japtvā) dravyaṃ hi śodhayet || 17 
||

atha pañca tattvena pūjayet |

pañcatatva prakāraṃ dakṣiṇācāre proktam || idānīṃ 
saṃkṣepeṇoktam,(-)

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

māṃsaṃ matsyaṃ tathā mudrā madyaṃ maithunakaṃ śive |
pañcatattvamidaṃ proktaṃ pañcatattvodbhavaṃ dhruvam || 18 ||

pañcatattvodbhavaṃ tattvam (gh: dravyam) ekadā milana yadā |
tadā tattvaṃ bhavet siddhiḥ punastattvasya tattvakam (g: 
pañcatattvamayaṃ śubham) || 19 ||

kṣityaṃśena bhavenmāṃsaṃ toyāṃśenāpi mīnakam |
tejo'ṃśena bhavenmudrā vāyvaṃśenāpi kāraṇam || 20 ||

śūnyāṃśe maithunaṃ proktaṃ pañcatattvamayaṃ śubham |
kṣityaṃśaṃ śuṣkarūpaṃ hi toyāṃśenāpi cārdrayet || 21 ||

punaśca śoṣayeddevi (gh: śodhayet) mudrāṃśenāpi tajjalam |
vāyvaṃśenāpi tanmudrāṃ nānārūpadharāṃ parām || 22 ||

maithunāṃśena deveśi sarvamātraṃ prakāśitam |
athavā pañcatatvena pañcamena yajet śivām || 23 ||

kevalaṃ pañcamenāpi vīrabhāvena pūjayet |
śaktyājñayāpi śāktaḥ syāt śakti jñānena kutracit || 24 ||

<p. 198>

pañcatatve pañcame vā cārccanaṃ hi tadājñayā |
svadehe cintayet śaktiṃ svadehe ramaṇaṃ śive |
pañcatattvena saṃpūjya svadehaṃ śaktisaṃyutam || 25 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvāllāse ūnapañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 
||


[pañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha pūjayet kulayoṣitām |
atha kulayoṣitāṃ lakṣaṇam |

kulārṇave śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇa nātheśa pañcatattva pradāyaka |
śrotumicchāmi prāṇeśa lakṣaṇaṃ kulayoṣitām || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

madya pāna ratā yā strī kulastrī saiva śaṅkari |
madyapāne'pyaśaktā yā kulabhraṣṭā sanātani || 2 ||

kula sthānaṃ pālayitvā kevalaṃ nirjane dadet |
viparītaṃ (gh, j: -ta) kuladravye vijñeyā kulayoṣitām || 3 ||

madyādi bhojanaṃ kṛtvā kulaṃ jñātvā kulaṃ nyaset |
sā nārī parameśāni vijñeyā kulayoṣitā || 4 |

<p. 199>

kuladravye kulaṃ dattvā kulañca sevayettu yā |
sā nārī parameśāni vijñeyā kulayoṣitā || 5 ||

kuladravyaṃ samānīya sevayettu kule yadi |
sā nārī parameśāni vijñeyā kula yoṣitā || 6 ||

svakulīnasya sevārthaṃ parakīyaṃ yajed yadi |
sā nārī parameśāni vijñeyā kulayoṣitā || 7 ||

tantrāntare (-)

svakulañca vinā devi svakulaṃ na prakāśitam |
vibhinne (c: vistīrṇe) kula dātavyaṃ svakulānanda hetave || 8 ||

sā nārī parameśāni vijñeyā kulayoṣitā |
nārīmātreṣu vijñeyā deveṣu kulayoṣitā || 9 ||

tāsāṃ madhye viśiṣṭā yā tava sthāne prakāśitā |
tasyārccane mahānandaṃ jīvanaṃ tasya durllabham |
ata eva mahāvīrastadanyāṃ naiva laṅghayet || 10 ||

nigamatatve kula lakṣaṇam |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

mātardurge mahābhāge namāmi caraṇāmbuje |
kulaṃ kiñca mahādevi mama sthāne prakāśaya || 11 ||

śrīmahādevyuvāca (-)

kulastrī parameśāna kulānandeṣu mohitā |
kulāgāre kuladravyaṃ dātavyaṃ kāṅkṣitā sadā (j: kulayoṣitām) || 
12 ||

<p. 200>

rāgayuktā kāmayuktā kāmārtā kāmadāyikā |
parapuṣpākṛti sthānaṃ kulāgāraṃ (j: -re) prakāśitam || 13 ||

kulañca vāruṇaṃ bījaṃ kuṇḍaṃ cāndraṃ (gh, j: candraṃ) 
maheśvara |
tatraiśānaṃ nīyamānaṃ (kh, j: līyamānaṃ) sarvaṃ hi 
paścimānanam || 14 ||

samayācāra tantre (-)

vāruṇaṃ cāndramadhyasthaṃ sarvadevālayaṃ śive |
randhraṃ śivaṃ laulitaṃ (c: lauhitaṃ) muktiṃ taddhyāna saṃyutam || 
15 ||

kula sthānamidaṃ jñeyaṃ sṛṣṭi sthityanta kārakam (gh, j: -ṇaṃ) |
yathā kriyā tathā jñānaṃ (k, g, gh, c: jñeyo) yathā jñānamidaṃ 
tathā (j: yathā jñānaṃ jñeyaṃ tathā) || 16 ||

samayācāratantre (-)

yonimadhye sthitaṃ śūnyaṃ śūnyamadhye nirañjanam |
kulasthānamidaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvabījasya bījakam || 17 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kulasthānaṃ vāruṇañca tvayoktaṃ parameśvara |
śambhu madhyaṃ candrabījaṃ nārīdehasya bījakam |
tadbījaṃ kiṃ maheśāni tadbhinnaṃ nārī vā katham || 18 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

vāruṇaṃ candrabījāntaṃ paraspara yutaṃ (j: parapuṣpa-) śive |
kulasthānaṃ vinā śaktijñānamātraṃ na jāyate || 19 ||

<p. 201>

pāna yuktā kāma mattā sarvadānanda saṃyutā |
nitamba jaghana sphītā parapuṣpa bhaga prabhā || 20 ||

kulastrī (c: apuṣpā) cottamā jñeyā madhyamā puṣpadarśitā |
hīnā'pi parameśāni puṣpaṃ madhyeṣu gopitam (g: madhyeṣu 
gopitā; g: madhye sugopitam)  || 21 ||

uttame pūjite yantre muktibhāg jāyate naraḥ |
madhyame pūjite bhaktirhīne'pi kārya sādhanam || 22 ||

puṣpa jñānaṃ vinā devi śakti jñānaṃ na jāyate |
parājitā puṣpa rūpā kulāgārañca madhyagam (j: madhyamam) || 23 ||

śakti jñānaṃ sarvabījaṃ tasya bījaṃ na vidyate |
aṇḍa jātaṃ svedajātaṃ bīja jātaṃ tridhā śive || 24 ||

śukra śoṇita sambhūtaṃ mānuṣaṃ parikīrtitam |
liṅgamadhye sthitaṃ śukraṃ yonimadhye ca śoṇitam || 25 ||

sṛṣṭi bījamidaṃ jñeyaṃ tasyedaṃ bīja mātrakam (j: anayośca 
parasparam) |
tasya bījaṃ na vidyeta gadituṃ naiva śakyate || 26 ||

vāyvādhikye ḍimbajātaṃ toyādhikye'pi svedajam |
tejādhikye bīja jātaṃ kṣityādhikye'pi mānuṣam || 27 ||

śukra śoṇita sambhūtaṃ dehamātraṃ maheśvari |
narānya sūkṣma bhāgāktaṃ aṇḍajādi (gh, j: aṇḍajāti-) 
prabhedakam || 28 ||

kula sthānasya māhātmyaṃ gadituṃ naiva śakyate |
yonyārūḍhānmaheśāni kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale |
kriyāyogo dhyāna yogo bhakti yogo bhaviṣyati || 29 ||

<p. 202>

vṛhadyonitantre (-)

atha kulasya devamaya kathanam |

trikoṇe ca (gh, j: trikoṇeṣu) maheśvarāḥ |
trikoṇākāra rūpā sā sarvadevālayā priye (gh: śive) || 30 ||

pārśvayoḥ kālikā tārā corddhe bhuvanasundarī |
tripureśī yonimadhye mūle vasati bhairavī || 31 ||

chinnamastā yonigarte dhūmā prānte vinirgatā |
roma kūpe mahākālī mātaṅgī mekhalāsu ca || 32 ||

yonikṣetre ca kamalā kāmākhyā yonidevatā |
bindupuṣpatarormūle kuṇḍalī brahmavigrahā || 33 ||

bindu puṣpaṃ svayaṃ rudraḥ prakṛtiḥ puṣparūpiṇī |
pīṭhaṃ kāma svarūpañca dvividhaṃ parameśvari || 34 ||

vyaktāvyakta svarūpaṃ hi vyaktādguhyaṃ mahāphalam |
praṇavākāra rūpeṇa yonyākāraṃ vicintayet || 35 ||

nārāyaṇītantre | śrīdevyuvāca (-)

vyaktāyāścaiva guptāyā lakṣaṇaṃ kiṃ prakāśaya || 36 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

nārīdehe sthitā vyaktā puṃdehe (gh, j: sva-) sūkṣmasaṃsthitā |
vyaktasya pūjanāddevi lakṣa pīṭha phalaṃ labhet |
guptārccane'pi muktiḥ syād bhakti bhāva yuto yadi || 37 ||

<p. 203>

vṛhadyoni tantre (-)

etat prapūjanāddevi lakṣa pīṭha phalaṃ labhet |
darśanāt lakṣa pīṭhānāṃ phalaṃ yadvaravarṇini || 38 ||

tat phalaṃ labhate bhaktyā yoni pīṭhasya darśanāt |
sparśanāt sarva pīṭhānāṃ phalamāpnoti sādhakaḥ || 39 ||

yāni yāni ca tīrthāni triṣu lokeṣu sundari |
tiṣṭhanti tāni tīrthāni yoni pīṭheṣu sundari || 40 ||

yoni dakṣiṇa pārśveṣu yamunā pravahet sadā |
sarasvatī madhyabhāge vāmeṣu jāhnavī parā || 41 ||

puṣpa sthāne bindurūpaṃ tīrthaṃ garteṣu puṣkaram |
kṣetre tīrthāni tiṣṭhanti sarvāṇi (j: cānyāni) parameśvari || 42 ||

samayācāratantre | śrīdevyuvāca (-)

tat prasādānmahādeva jñātavyā kulayoṣitā |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi lakṣaṇaṃ kula yoṣitām || 43 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

yallakṣaṇānvitā jñeyā nārī ca (j: yā nārī) kula yoṣitā |
tallakṣaṇānvito jñeyaḥ sādhakaḥ kula yoṣitaḥ || 44 ||

nārīdehe sthūla rūpaṃ puṃdehe sūkṣma rūpakam |
jñānināṃ jñānarūpedaṃ kulasya lakṣaṇaṃ śive || 45 ||

tantrāntare (-)

puṃkulaṃ nārīdeheṣu nīryāpi puruṣe kulam |
sthūlarūpaṃ sūkṣmarūpamanyānyaṃ jñāpitaṃ priye (gh: śive) || 
46 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse pañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ekapañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha maithuna lakṣaṇam |

nigama kalpadrume śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

ratiḥ kena prakartavyā (gh: kenaiva kartavyā) ratirvā kīdṛśī śubhā |
tava prītikarī devi cocyatāṃ bhava bandhanāt || 1 ||

devi sarva jaganmātaḥ kaulikānāṃ parāyaṇi |
yoni tattvaṃ vinā naiva kula dharma (k: dhana) parāyaṇaḥ || 2 ||

mayā yad yat kṛtaṃ karma tava yoni prasādataḥ |
(j: pustake adhika pāṭho dṛśyate nānyatra) tadeva ca mahādevi 
vismṛtaṃ sādhanaṃ mahat |
vismṛtaṃ punarucyeta śapathaṃ me punaḥ punaḥ || 3 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

unmattaṃ (j: uttamaṃ) duṣṭa cittātmā vismṛtaṃ sādhanaṃ mahat |
na vaktavyaṃ punarhyetat śapathaṃ me punaḥ punaḥ || 4 ||

gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ gopanīyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
rati santoṣa tuṣṭyarthaṃ (k, g: tuṣṭārthaṃ) punarhyetat prakāśitam || 5 
||

yonyantare tridhā nāḍī vāruṇī raktikā tathā |
śukriyā (c: śucikā) ceti kalyāṇi sarva deśa ramojjvalā (gh: 
rajojjvalā; j: rajasvalā) || 6 ||

<p. 205>

vāruṇyāḥ (gh: vāruṇī) kṣarate toyaṃ raktikā rudhiraṃ tathā |
śukrikā śukra (j: reta) jananī tasyāṃ pūjā mahāphalā || 7 ||

madhyabhāge śukriṇī syāt dakṣe savye rajojjvalām (j: vāme 
rajasvalā) |
dhyātvā kuryāt sadā saṅgaṃ śukre bīja prapātanam || 8 ||

taddravyaṃ kuṃkumairyuktaṃ (gh, j: candanai) sindūreṇāthavā 
punaḥ |
kevalaṃ vāpi puṣpeṇa śodhitaṃ tannivedayet || 9 ||

tantrāntare (-)

raktena sahitaṃ śukraṃ yadi syāt parameśvari |
tadā śukreṇa dātavyaṃ cānukalpaṃ kuleśvari || 10 ||

athānukalpaṃ raktasya śṛṇuṣva prāṇavallabhe |
pratyakṣasyāpi yogyatvaṃ cānukalpeṣu saṃsthitam || 11 ||

gautamīye (-)

raktānukalpaṃ raktāktaṃ śvetaṃ śukrānukalpanam (k, g: kalpakam) |
svasvavarṇayutaṃ dravyaṃ tad dravyasyānukalpanam || 12 ||

puṣpodbhaveṣu puṣpeṣu puṣpāt puṣpaṃ niyojayet |
devatārthe'pi vīrasya ātmārthe'jñāninaḥ (gh: jñāninaḥ) kvacit || 
13 ||

gaṅgā ca yamunācaiva madhyabhāge sarasvatī |
dhyātvā yajenmaheśāni madhye (j: savye) śukra prapātanam || 14 ||

<p. 206>

athāsya bhāvaḥ |

vāmā bhūtvā yajet parām |

svadehe vāmājñānam | guptasādhana tantre (-)

devī buddhamidaṃ (j: budhyā) sarvaṃ sarva dehasya bījakam |
vṛkṣasyāpi yathā bhūmervalaṃ (k: -vanaṃ) devi (k: devī; j: śaktiḥ) 
tathā priye || 15 ||

śaktiyukto bhavet sṛṣṭiḥ śaktiḥ syāt sṛṣṭisaṃyutā |
parasparaṃ bhavedbījaṃ vāyurākāśayoryathā || 16 ||

sṛṣṭirūpaṃ mahādevaṃ bījaṃ śakti svarūpakam |
bījarūpaṃ mahādevaṃ sṛṣṭiśakti (k, g: sṛṣṭiṃ-) svarūpakam || 17 ||

bījarūpā mahādevī sṛṣṭirūpo maheśvaraḥ |
prādurbhāvaṃ tirobhāvaṃ paraspara vivakṣitam || 18 ||

pañcabhūtamaye dehe sthūlarūpe maheśvare |
śaktistatra mahādevi sūkṣmarūpeṇa bhāṣitā || 19 ||

pañcabhūtamayaṃ dehaṃ kevalaṃ śaktirūpakam |
pañcadhāpyekadhā (k, g: ekadā) yatra nānārūpavatī śivā || 20 ||

kubjikā tantre (-)

nānārūpavatī śaktiḥ puruṣasyeka rūpakaḥ |
yathā nānāpi mukure nānātvaṃ (j: mukule darśane) pratibimbakam || 
21 ||

śivo'pi śaktirūpaścet (k: śaktiyuktaḥ syāt) śaktiḥ syāt 
śivayogataḥ |
avinābhāva sambandhaṃ dvayoreva parasparam || 22 ||

<p. 207>

śiva śaktidvayaṃ tattvaṃ tattvaṃ jñānasya kāraṇam |
śivena śaktirvijñeyā (k: śaktiṃ vijñeyāṃ) jñeyaṃ 
śaktyāktaśaṅkaram (j: śaktyātu śaṅkaraḥ) || 23 ||

puruṣaḥ prakṛtau (k: prakṛti) yuktaḥ sarva kārya prakāśavān |
śaktiśca puruṣeṣvāktā (j: puruṣeṇa) yadā sarva prakāśinī || 24 ||

śakti jñānaṃ vinā devi śivajñānaṃ na cet kvacit |
śiva jñānaṃ vinā kiñcit (k: kaścit) śaktijñānaṃ na jāyate || 25 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse ekapañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[dvāpañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha śakti jñānam |

kulacūḍāmaṇau (-)

sthūlajñānaṃ vinā devi sūkṣma jñānaṃ na cet kvacit (j: na 
jāyate) |
ataśca bahujanmānte śakti jñānaṃ prajāyate || 1 ||

śaktijñānaṃ vinā devi muktirhāsyāya kalpate (k: kalpyate) |
sā śaktirvāmā vijñeyā puruṣasyāpi muktidā || 2 ||

śakti jñānaṃ dvidhārūpaṃ guptā vyaktā kuleśvari |
guptāśaktistu dehasthā (j: śaktiḥ svadehasthā) vyaktā ramaṇa 
dāyinī || 3 ||

<p. 208>

vyaktā jñānaṃ vinā bhadre guptā jñānaṃ na jāyate |
vyaktā ramaṇa tuṣṭā cet guptā ramaṇa tuṣṭitā || 4 ||

atha guptāśakti lakṣaṇam |

śāktakrama candrikāyām (gh, j: -candrikāyām) (-)

śaktirbrahmā (k, kh, gh, c: brahma) śivaḥ śaktiḥ śaktirviṣṇuśca 
vāsavaḥ |
anyeca vahavo devāḥ śakti mūlāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
atastebhyaḥ pradhānaṃ hi śaktiṃ viddhi mahāmate || 5 ||

jñānadvīpe (-)

yasya yasya padārthasya yā yā śaktirudāhṛtā |
saiva sarveśvarī devi (k: devī) sa ca sarvo maheśvaraḥ || 6 ||

bhāva cūḍāmaṇau (-)

sthūlendriya mahādeva (k, kh, c: -devaṃ) stasyādhiṣṭhātrī caṇḍikā |
kāryākāryaṃ maheśāni tasyā eva na saṃśayaḥ || 7 ||

śarīramindriyārthaṃ (j: indriyāktaṃ) hi cendriyaṃ śakti saṃyutam |
kāryākāryaṃ bhavet śakternirliptaḥ (j: yasyā-) puruṣaḥ śive || 8 ||

icchāśakterbhavedicchā jñāna śaktestu jñānavān |
kriyā śakterbhavet kāryaṃ prāṇināṃ sarvasādhane || 9 ||

ramaṇaṃ śaktisaṃyuktaṃ jaḍaṃ jñeyaṃ sadāśivam |
athavāpi śivaṃ jñeyaṃ dehinaṃ śakti bījakam || 10 ||

dehaṃ śarīraṃ vijñeyaṃ dehīti śiva kīrtitam |
vāmājñānaṃ maheśāni sthūla sūkṣma pramāṇakam || 11 ||

<p. 209>

atha vyaktāśakti lakṣaṇam |

nigamakalpadrume śrīdevyuvāca (-)

striyo devāḥ striyaḥ prāṇāḥ striyaścaiva vibhūṣaṇāḥ (j: -ṇam) |
strīsaṅginā sadā bhāvyāma (j: bhāvyama) bhāve svastriyāmapi || 12 
||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

strīrūpaṃ brahmarūpañca tvayoktaṃ varavarṇini |
abhāve svastriyaṃ devi kathamuktaṃ sadāśive || 13 ||

śrīdevyuca (-)

brahma dattā rudra dattā dvividhā strīrmaheśvara |
brahma dattāgninā hutvā śiva dattā tu kāmataḥ || 14 ||

śiva kārye śivā yojyā parā yojyānyakarmaṇi |
sandeho naiva kartavyo mama vākyānusārataḥ || 15 ||

nigamānande (-)

vāmābhāve maheśāni (gh: -na) svavāmāṃ toṣayenmudā |
svavāmā toṣaṇārthe'pi para vāmāñca toṣayet || 16 ||

paravāmātmanaḥ tulyaṃ svātmānaṃ cintayenmudā (j: cintanaṃ-) |
toṣayed ramayet śakti (j: śāktaḥ) tasyā vākyena (gh, j: vākyānu) 
mānataḥ |
toṣayet parameśāni (gh: -na) vīrabhāva samāśritaḥ || 18 ||

<p. 210>

atha vāmā pūjā lakṣaṇam |

guptasādhana tantre (-)

svadehaṃ nārī dehañca svakāryaṃ ramaṇīyutam |
ramaṇaṃ śaktisaṃyuktaṃ svadeheṣu viśeṣakam || 19 ||

ramaṇena maheśāni vāmāpūjāṃ prakalpayet |
svaśakti ramaṇārthe'pi paraśaktiṃ ramet śive || 20 ||

ramaṇaṃ śaktibhiḥ sārddhaṃ svadehe paradehake |
svaśaktiṃ paraśaktiṃ vā caikāṃ jñātvā ramet śivām || 21 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

ramaṇena varārohe yādṛk mukhaṃ bhaved dhruvam |
tādṛk sukhaṃ śarīrasya kadācinnaiva jāyate || 22 ||

ramaṇena varārohe ramādevīṃ prapūjayet |
ramā pūjanamātreṇa ramā tasya kare sthitā || 23 ||

ramaṇena bhavet svargo duḥkha muktirmaheśvari |
ata eva kulācārī mukhena bhaktibhāg bhavet || 24 ||

niṣedhaśca vidhiścaiva vāmācāre (j: svecchācāre) na cet kvacit |
svecchācāre yoni garte liṅgaṃ dadyāt tadājñayā || 25 ||

niṣedhaśca vidhiścaiva svecchācāre na pārvati |
maithunaṃ cet śakti yuktaṃ kevalaṃ śakterājñayā || 26 ||

puruṣasyaiva niyamo (j: puruṣo niyamaścaiva) na yoṣitsu kathañcana |
abhiṣekasya (k, g: abhiṣekādya) bhāvena cādhikārī na saṃśayaḥ || 
27 ||

<p. 211>

svadehe ramayet śaktiṃ nānyathā ca kathañcana |
svagehe pāyasaṃ tyaktvā bhikṣāmaṭati durmatiḥ || 28 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse dvāpañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[tripañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha siddhāntācāraḥ |

samayācāratantre (-)

ātmānaṃ devatāṃ matvā (gh: dhyātvā) yajeddevaṃ vidhānataḥ |
sadānandaḥ sadā śāntaḥ siddhāntācāra ucyate || 1 ||

(atra ātmānaṃ devatāṃ matveti ślokasya vyākhyānaṃ bodhyam)
(ātmāntaṃ devatāṃ matvā jñātvā, evaṃ vidhānato yo yajet,
sa siddhānta cāraḥ, punaḥ kathambhūtaḥ, sadānandaḥ sadā śāntaḥ 
|)

athāsya (k: atha siddhāntācārasya) siddhāntācārasya bhāvaḥ |
śāktakrama (-) candrikāyām (tandri-) (-)

manyante ye svātmānaṃ (k, g: janātmānaṃ) vibhinnaṃ (c: vibhinne) 
parameśvarāt |
na te paśyanti taṃ devaṃ vṛthā teṣāṃ pariśramaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 212>

gautamīye (-)

ātmānaṃ devatāṃ matvāpyātmānaṃ toṣayedyadi |
siddhāntācāro (k: -cāravijñeyaṃ) vijñeyastasya jīvaḥ śivo bhavet || 
3 ||

tathā ca kulārṇave (-)

ghṛṇā lajjā bhayaṃ śokaṃ jugupsā ceti pañcamī (c: -mam) |
kulaṃ śīlaṃ tathā jātiścāṣṭau pāśāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 4 ||

pāśavaddhaḥ sadā jīvaḥ pāśamuktaḥ sadāśivaḥ |
evaṃ jñātvā maheśāni cātmānaṃ toṣayed yadi |
sa jīvaḥ parameśāni śiva eva na saṃśayaḥ || 5 ||

guptasādhana (-) tantre (-)

ātmānaṃ toṣayeddevīṃ (k, kh, g, gh: ātmātoṣaṇamātreṇa) tuṣyanti 
sarvadevatāḥ |
ata eva kulācārī ātmānaṃ toṣayenmudā || 6 ||

kulārṇave (-)

yatrāsti bhogo na ca tatra mokṣo,
yatrāsti mokṣo na ca tatra bhogaḥ |
śivā padāmbhoja yugārccakānām,
bhogaśca mokṣaśca karastha eva || 7 ||

vaiṣṇavānāñca śāktānāṃ śaivādīnāṃ maheśvari |
ātmānaṃ devatāṃ matvā toṣayedramaṇādinā || 8 ||

ātmasthāṃ (j: ātmānaṃ) devatāṃ tyaktvā vahirdevaṃ vicintayet |
karasthaṃ kaustubhaṃ tyaktvā bhramate kāca tṛṣṇayā || 9 ||

<p. 213>

pañcatatvena deveśi svecchācāreṇa vā punaḥ |
jīvaṃ deva (gh, j: brahma) mayaṃ jñātvā toṣayed bhojanādiṣu || 10 ||

haṃsamāheśvare (-)

yāni yāni ca tīrthāni ye ye devā maheśvari |
śarīraṃ jñāpitaṃ sarvaṃ jīvarūpaṃ sanātani (k, kh, g, c: -nam) || 
11 ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau (-)

śarīra (k: -raṃ) vyāpitaṃ raktaṃ jīvo (k: jīva jñeyaṃ) jñeyo 
maheśvari |
mṛtadehe varārohe rudhiraṃ naiva tiṣṭhati |
sukhaduḥkhādayaḥ sarve jīvasyāpi maheśvari || 12 ||

jñānadvīpe (-)

ekaiva hi mahāmāyā nāma bhedena saṃsthitā |
vimohanāya lokānāṃ tasmāt sama manā bhavet || 13 ||

devī viṣṇu śivādīnāmekatvaṃ paricintayet |
bheda bhāva (k: -bhāvo) mano yasya tasya mokṣo na jāyate || 14 ||

kularahasye (-)

athā durgā tathāviṣṇuryathā viṣṇustathā śivaḥ |
nānābhāva mano yasya tasya mokṣo na jāyate |
sarvaṃ dehamayaṃ (j: deva) jñātvā dehaṃ (j: ayaṃ) śive || 15 ||

<p. 214>

deha jñānaṃ vinā devi jīva jñānaṃ na cet kvacit |
jīva jñānaṃ vinā devi śiva jñānaṃ na cet kvacit || 16 ||

śiva jñānaṃ vinā jīvaḥ śivo'bhūcca na cet kvacit |
ātmabrahmeti saṃjñātvā devabrahmeti bhāvayet || 17 ||

devatātmā'bhinno yastasya jīvaḥ śivo bhavet |
śarīraṃ vyāpitaṃ yadyat jīvaṃ (j: śivaṃ) jñeyaṃ kuleśvari || 18 ||

iti sthirataraṃ yasya tasya jīvaḥ śivo bhavet |
ādau dehaṃ tato jīvaṃ tato devaṃ (k: dehaṃ) vicintayet |
tato devamayaṃ jīvaṃ dehaṃ jīvamayaṃ smaret || 19 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse tripañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[catuḥpañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha maithunānanda lakṣaṇam |

nigama tattvasāre śrīśiva uvāca (-)

madyānandaṃ mahādevi bahudhāpi prakāśitam |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi maithunānanda lakṣaṇam || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

maithunānanda kathane śaṅkā'bhūt mama mānase |
niyojya nandinaṃ dvāre nirgaccha (k: nirgatya) rati mandiram || 2 ||

<p. 215>

tava snehāt pravaktavyaṃ sādhanaṃ paramaṃ mahat |
yat kṛtvā sādhaka śreṣṭhaḥ śivo'bhūt parameśvara || 3 ||

maithunena vinā deva madyapānaṃ hi duḥkhadam |
madyapānaṃ vinā deva maithunaṃ pāpadāyakam || 4 ||

pānānte maithunaṃ bhadraṃ maithunānte'pi kāraṇam (k: pānakam) 
|
pānaṃ maithuna saṃyuktaṃ jīvasya mukti dāyakam || 5 ||

pūrṇānande mahādeva maithunaṃ naiva jāyate |
indriyākalitaṃ sarvaṃ rūpa mānādivarjitam || 6 ||

ata eva kulajñānī madya pānaṃ yathāsukham |
ānandaṃ dvividhaṃ proktaṃ khaṇḍaṃ pūrṇaṃ kuleśvara || 7 ||

khaṇḍānandi (k: -nandī) kriyāmārgī yoni liṅgasya darśanāt (k: 
gharṣaṇāt) |
atipānaṃ na karttavyamatipātraṃ na dāpayet || 8 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

ānande janite devi bahu pātraṃ dadedyadi |
dīyamāne kriyā lupte kruddhā bhavati kāminī || 9 ||

nigama tattve (-)

śaktirūpā mahāmāyā sarva geheṣu saṃsthitā |
yadānandayutā nārī tadā maccharīraṃ śiva || 10 ||

dehaṃ jīvaṃ tathā prāṇaṃ mano buddhiñca bhojanam |
karomyahaṃ gānapānaṃ svayaṃ devīsvarūpiṇī || 11 ||

sānanda jñāna mātreṇa hṛtpadme'haṃ prakāśitā |
prakāśe'pi svayaṃ devī sākṣādbhavati sādhakaḥ || 12 ||

<p. 216>

sādhakastvaṃ mahādeva sādhyāhaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
ānandaṃ (j: ānande) sādhakaṃ dṛṣṭvā tathā sādhyāñca 
śaṅkarīm || 13 ||

darśanācca bhavenmuktiḥ sālokyaṃ parameśvara |
svakāntāṃ parakāntāṃ vā sālokyaṃ darśane śive || 14 ||

sālokyaṃ caiva sārūpyaṃ sāyujyaṃ parameśvari |
nirvāṇañca yadānandaṃ (j: dayā-) mama sthāne prakāśaya || 15 ||

atha caturvidha muktyānanda kathanam |

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

kāntāyāḥ ṣoḍaśe varṣe darśanāt (k: darśane) yat sukhaṃ priya |
tat sukhaṃ sarvadā deva sālokye (j: sālokyaṃ) nātra saṃśayaḥ || 16 ||

kāntāyāḥ ṣoḍaśe varṣe sparśane yat sukhaṃ priya |
tatsukhaṃ sarvadā deva sārūpye nātra saṃśayaḥ || 17 ||

kāntāyāḥ ṣoḍaśe varṣe saṅgame yat sukha priya |
tatsukhaṃ sarvadā deva sāyujye (j: sāyujya) nātra saṃśayaḥ || 18 ||

śukrotsāraṇa kāle tu yatsukhaṃ priya tatsukham |
jāyate sarvadā deva nirvāṇe nātra saṃśayaḥ || 19 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse catuḥpañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 
0 ||


[pañcapañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha pūrṇānandasya māhātmyam |
nigamatattvasāre śrīśiva uvāca (-)

mātardurge mahābhāge mamaiva prāṇa vallabhe |
pūrṇānandasya māhātmyaṃ mama sthāne prakāśaya || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

dehī brahmamayaṃ jñātvā (k, g, c: brahmeti saṃjñātvā) sarvaṃ 
brahmeti bhāvayet |
janmamṛtyumayaṃ (k, g, c: -bhayaṃ) ghoraṃ kadācinnaiva paśyati || 2 
||

dehī dehe sthite deva pūrṇānanda na jāyate |
bhāvātītaṃ yadā jñānaṃ pūrṇānandaṃ tadā bhavet || 3 ||

bhāvātītamayaṃ bhāvaṃ bhāvaṃ bhāvātītamayam (c: 
bhāvātītamaya śiva) |
pūrṇānandaṃ tadā jñeyaṃ gāna pāneṣu (k, g, c: gāne pāneṣu) 
jāyate || 4 ||

gānena (k, g, gh, c: jñānena) jāyate pānaṃ pānācca gāyanaṃ śiva 
|
ānandasya kramaṃ kutra niścitaṃ kena vartmanā || 5 ||

kiṃ vā kāryamakāryaṃ kiṃ varṇituṃ naiva śakyate |
bhāvātītamayaṃ vākyaṃ bhāvātītamayaṃ stavam || 6 ||

bhāvātītamayaṃ jñānaṃ bhāvātītaṃ hi maithunam |
bhāvātītamayaṃ pānaṃ bhāvātītaṃ hi gāyanam |
bhāvātītamayaṃ dhyānaṃ bhāvātītamayī (k, g, gh, c: 
bhāvātītamayā) kriyā || 7 ||

<p. 218>

guptasādhana tantre śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kvacit pānaṃ kvacidgānaṃ kvaciccarvaṇamācaret |
kvacid dhyānaṃ japādiñca kvacinmaithunamācaret || 8 ||

pānānte carvaṇaṃ devi carvaṇānte pivenmadhu |
māṃsaṃ mudrāṃ mīnayuktaṃ (j: -yuktāṃ) pānamānanda 
sammatam (j: saṃyutām) || 9 ||

carvyaṃ coṣyaṃ tathā lehyaṃ peyañca parameśvari |
mukhe yad yat pradātavyaṃ bhojanānanda sammatam || 10 ||

nigama tatve śrīdevyuvāca (-)

pūrṇānande mahādeva maithunaṃ naiva jāyate |
indriyākalitaṃ sarvaṃ prakāśaka vivarjitam || 11 ||

yadi daivāt sādhakendraḥ kriyākāṅkṣī bhavet śiva |
sarvatra yoniṃ jñātvā'pi ghātaṃ kṛtvā muhurmuhuḥ || 12 ||

kvacid yonau kvacit pārśve kvacit pṛṣṭhe maheśvara |
kvacidāsye kvacit karṇe mūrdhni deśe kvacit kvacit || 13 ||

bhāvātītakrameṇaiva ghātaṃ kuryānumuhurmuhuḥ |
kvacilliṅgena hastena kvacidaṃgulinā śiva || 14 ||

kvacinnāsā puṭenaiva kvacinnetreṇa ghātanam |
kvacit pādenāṃgulinā mūrdhnāpi jihvayā kvacit |
dantaghātaṃ sarvagātraṃ coṣyamāṇaṃ muhurmuhuḥ || 15 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvāllāse pañcapañcāśadullāsaḥ] 
|| 0 ||


[ṣaṭpañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kuleśi śrotumicchāmi śaktyānandasya lakṣaṇam || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca (-)

śaktyānandaṃ mahādeva bahubhāgye prakāśitam |
prakāśite premānande (j: maheśāna) sarvānandasya tulyatā || 2 ||

bhāvātīto yathā śāktastathā śaktirmaheśvara |
ānandasyāpi tulyatvaṃ pānaṃ ramaṇa tādṛśam || 3 ||

śaktirvā puruṣo (k, g, c: sādhako) vāpi patito yadi bhūtale |
(cihnita sārddha śloka dvayaṃ j: pustake adhikaṃ vidyate) 
tatkṣaṇādramaṇaṃ kuryāt ghṛṇā lajjā vivarjitā || 4 ||

sādhakaḥ patito bhūmau sādhyā ramaṇamācaret |
sādhyāpi patitā bhūmau sādhako ramaṇañcaret || 5 ||

anicchāyāṃ na karttavyaṃ kartavyamājñayāpi ca |
anyathāpi na karttavyaṃ ubhau (gh: kartavyāvubhau) narakagāminau || 6 
||

śaktyānande yajet śāktaḥ śivānande yajet śivām |
ānandena yuto deva kukkuro'pi śivo bhavet || 7 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse ṣaṭpañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[saptapañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

atha śakti māhātmyam |

toḍalatantre (-)

ātma śaktirvarārohe deho'yaṃ (?) jaḍitā sthitā |
vaśīkarttuṃ na śaknoti vāhya śaktestu kā kathā || 1 ||

vāhya śaktirvarārohe sva śaktirjñāyate yadi |
toṣayed bahu yatnena rāga dveṣa vimuktakaḥ (kh, c: vimohakaḥ) || 2 ||

śāktakramacandrikāyām (gh, j: -tandrikāyām) (-)

vivāhitāyāḥ kanyāyā (j: kāntāyāḥ) yadyanyo ramaṇaṃ caret |
tāsāṃ prahāraṃ nindāñca kauṭilyaṃ naiva kārayet || 3 ||

śaktirūpaṃ kriyārthaṃ hi vivāhaṃ paribhāṣikam |
strīmātre hara patnī ca pumānmātre ca śaṅkaraḥ || 4 ||

śaṅkaro'haṃ varārohe śakterjñānaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
icchā śakterbhavedicchā kriyā śakteḥ kriyā bhavet || 5 ||

jñāna śakterbhavejjñānaṃ bhavellajjāpi lajjayā |
bandhaṃ mokṣaṃ varārohe icchā śakterna saṃśayaḥ || 6 ||

ata eva mahādevi (k, g, c: mahādeva) deha (g: sarvāṃ) śaktiṃ 
prakīrtitam |
yo'nyebhyo darśanebhyaśca bhuktiṃ (gh, c: bhaktiṃ) muktiñca 
kāṃskṣati |
svapna labdha dhanenaiva dhanavān sa bhavedyadi || 7 ||

<p. 221>

upāsyā bahavo devā yaduktāstava suvrate (k, g, c: -tāḥ) |
pūjyā (gh, j: pūjā) pradhānā tatraiva śaktirādau dṛḍha (k, c: 
dṛḍhaḥ) vrataḥ || 8 ||

śaktirbrahmā śivaḥ śaktiḥ śaktirviṣṇuśca vāsavaḥ |
anye ca bahavo devāḥ śakti mūlāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 9 ||

śaktiṃ vinā yato hyeṣāmasamarthaṃ prakīrtitam |
atastebhyaḥ pradhānaṃ hi śaktiṃ viddhi mahāmate || 10 ||

śuktau rajatavadbhrāntiryathā (gh: -bhātiryathā) jāyeta pārvati |
tathānya (k, g, c: athānya; gh: anyathā) darśanebhyaśca bhuktiṃ 
muktiñca kāṃkṣati || 11 ||

(śloko'yaṃ gh, j: pustakayoradhiko dṛśyate)
manyate ye svamātmānaṃ vibhinnaṃ parameśvarāt |
na te paśyanti taṃ devaṃ vṛthā teṣāṃ pariśramaḥ || 12 ||

sarva devamayīiṃ devīṃ sarva devamayīṃ parām |
ātmānaṃ cintayeddevīṃ paramātma svarūpiṇīm || 13 ||

nirvāṇa tantre (-)

devyātmānaṃ svamātmānaṃ bhāvayed yatamānasaḥ |
aikyaṃ saṃbhāvayennityaṃ svagurūṃ devatātmakam || 14 ||

ātmānaṃ cintayeddevīṃ śaktimātra svarūpiṇīm |
ātmābhedena yaścintyo (j: ātmābhede layaścintyo) yāti tanmayatāṃ 
naraḥ || 15 ||

so'hamityasya satataṃ cintanāt tanmayo bhavet |
ahaṃ devo na cānyo'smi mukto'hamiti bhāvayet || 16 ||

rudrasya cintanādrudro viṣṇuḥ syādviṣṇuḥ syādviṣṇu cintanāt |
durgāyāścintanād durgā bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 17 ||

<p. 222>

evamabhyāsayogastu ahanyahani (k, g: 
evamabhyāsamānantvapyahanyahani) pārvati |
jarā maraṇa kuḥkhādyairmucyate bhava bandhanāt || 18 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse saptapañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 
||


[aṣṭapañcāśattamollāsaḥ] |

haṃsa bījasya māhātmyam |

mahānirvāṇa tantre śrīdevyuvāca (-)

deveśa prāṇa nātheśa (g, j: parameśāna) triguṇe triguṇātmaka |
adhunā haṃsa bījasya māhātmyaṃ kathaya priya || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

haṃsa bījasya māhātmyaṃ gadituṃ naiva śakyate |
tava snehena baddho'haṃ kiñcidbhāvaṃ prakāśitam || 2 ||

devālayaṃ bhaveddehaṃ haṃsena manunā śive |
haṃsa bījaṃ samāśritya dehī dehe sadā sthitaḥ || 3 ||

hakāraḥ śaṅkaraścaiva sakāraḥ śaktirīritaḥ |
śiva śaktyātmakaṃ mantramajapeti prakīrtitam || 4 ||

ṣaṭśatāni divārātrau sahasrāṇyekaviṃśatiḥ |
ajapā nāma gāyatrīṃ jīvo japati sarvadā || 5 ||

<p. 223>

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

śiva śaktyātmakaṃ mantraṃ jīvo japati sarvadā |
prajapet kena mūlañca so'haṃ kena vicintayet || 6 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

kumbhakaṃ syād haṃ kāreṇa saḥ kāreṇāpi recanam |
kumbhakeṣu (j: kumbhake'pi) japenmantraṃ pratyeke pratyekākṣaram || 
7 ||

tantrāntare (-)

hakāraṃ śiva bījaṃ syāt śaktibījaṃ sakārakam |
jīvātmānaṃ nādarūpaṃ binduñca paramātmakam || 8 ||

visargaḥ karmma saṅgaḥ syāt haṃsa bījaṃ prakīrtitam |
vindu dvayaṃ visargaḥ syāt sṛṣṭiḥ sthitirmaheśvari || 9 ||

eka binduṃ laye devi dvivinduṃ sṛṣṭirūpakam |
trivinduṃ sthiti rūpañca bindumekaṃ laye punaḥ || 10 ||

śaiva śaktimayaṃ dehaṃ jivātmā karmma rūpakam |
paramātmā bindurūpaṃ haṃsa bījena bhāṣitam || 11 ||

sṛṣṭi sthiti layaṃ jñeyaṃ haṃsa bījaṃ sulocane |
haṃsa jñāne bhavet sṛṣṭiḥ so'haṃ jñāne sthitiḥ priye |
nāhaṃ jñāne layaṃ devi bhāvā bhāva prabodhakam || 12 ||

nārāyaṇī tantre (-)

svabhāve haṃsa bījena deha bhedena cintanam |
so'haṃ bhāvena parame'pyekadehaṃ vicintayet || 13 ||

hakāreṇa sakārañca sakāreṇa hakārakam |
pūjanaṃ sarvadā kuryāt vāma dakṣa vibhedataḥ || 14 ||

<p. 224>

nārāyaṇī tantre (-)

śiva bījaṃ hakārañca puṃdeha śiva rūpakam |
(pāṭho'yaṃ g: pustake adhiko dṛśyate) śaktibījaṃ sakāraṃ hi 
puṃdehaṃ śiva rūpakam || 15 ||

śakti bījaṃ sakāraṃ hi śaktidehaḥ prakāśitaḥ |
so'haṃ śaktimayaṃ dhyānāt (k, g, c: bhāvāt) jyotirdhyānaṃ 
prakāśitam || 16 ||

sūkṣma dhyānamahaṃ brahma sarva vyapi nirañjanam |
(pāṭho ga pustake adhiko dṛśyate) sthūla dhyānaṃ haṃsa bījaṃ 
bheda jñānācca labhyate |
so'haṃ jñānād bhavellabhyaṃ jyotirdhyānaṃ sunirmalam || 18 ||

nāhaṃjñānāllabhyate ca vācātītaṃ nirañjanam |
sthūlaṃ tejastathā sūkṣmaṃ dhyānaṃ trividha lakṣaṇam || 19 ||

sthūlamindriyasaṃyuktaṃ yoni liṅgādisaṃyutam |
jyotirdhyānamabhedaṃ hi so'haṃjñānayuto yadi |
sūkṣmaṃ nitya nirākāraṃ gaganādapi nirmalam || 20 ||

[iti sarvānandanāthaviracite sarvolllāse aṣṭa pañcāśadullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ūnapaṣṭitamollāsaḥ] |

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

dhyānatrayasya madhyeṣu soḥaṃ kena prajāyate || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

sthūla dhyānaṃ haṃsa bījaṃ sevya sevaka bhedakam |
tejaḥ sūkṣmabhedaṃ hi sevya sevaka varjitam || 2 ||

bhāvātītaṃ hi yaddhyānaṃ so'haṃ jñānāt paraṃ śive |
yasya yasya padārthasya yā yā śaktirudīritā (kh, g, j: udāhṛtā) |
saiva sarveśvarī devī sa ca sarvo maheśvaraḥ || 3 ||

mahānirvāṇa tantre (-)

svadehe pūjayeddevaṃ nānya dehe kadācana |
svagehe pāyasaṃ tyaktvā bhikṣāmaṭati durmatiḥ || 4 ||

sthūladhyānānmahādeva (k, g, c: mahādeva !) stejodhyānāddhi (j: 
dhyānādi) śaṅkarī (j: śaṅkari !) |
sūkṣma dhyānād bhavenmuktiroṅkāraṃ tatra sambhavam (gh: 
kumbhakam) || 5 ||

bhinna dehaṃ śivaṃ śakti tejodhyānamabhedakam |
śiva śaktyātmakaṃ sūkṣmaṃ oṃ tatsad vyāpitaṃ jagat || 6 ||

vindu trayaṃ nāda yugmaṃ bindu yugmañca nādakam |
bindumekaṃ nāda yugmaṃ oṃkāraṃ brahma bodhakam || 7 ||

kuṇḍalinyaṅkuśākārā bindurūpaḥ sadāśivaḥ |
aṅkamātraṃ mahādevi śiva śakti prabodhakam || 8 ||

<p. 226>

bindu dvayaṃ vinā devi kiñcinmātraṃ na jāyate |
vāme ca paramā śaktirdakṣiṇe paramaḥ śivaḥ || 9 ||

śiva śaktyātmakaṃ brahma vācātītaṃ sunirmalam |
takāraṃ śaṅkaraṃ jñeyaṃ takāraṃ puṃstva vigraham || 10 ||

brahma bodhamayaṃ devi tat śabdaṃ (j: sarvaṃ) śakti gopitam |
binduyugmaṃ nādamekaṃ takāraṃ brahma bodhakam || 11 ||

tat śabdaṃ parameśāni oṃkārasyāpi bodhakam |
vinā svareṇa deveśi vyañjanaṃ naiva tiṣṭhati || 12 ||

tadvarṇaṃ sakalaṃ bodhaṃ bhāva rūpaṃ prakāśitam |
sakāraḥ śaṅkarī jñeyā takāro nāda rūpakaḥ || 13 ||

śaktibrahmamayaṃ jñānaṃ sat (j: tat) śabdaṃ bhāva bodhakam |
vyañjanaṃ puruṣaṃ jñeyaṃ svaraṃ jñeyañca śaṅkarīm (j: 
śaṅkarī) || 14 ||

śiva śaktyātmakaṃ brahma sat śabdenāpi bhāṣṭitam (j: bodhitam) |
sakārañca takārañca puruṣaṃ parameśvari || 15 ||

śakti jñānaṃ madhya (k, g, c: madhye) luptaṃ akāraṃ śabda (j: 
sarva) bodhakam |
pañcanādaṃ saptabindumekāṅgaṃ parameśvari || 16 ||

etairyuktaṃ sakāraṃ hi tri vakāraṃ prakāśitam |
satvaṃ rajastamaścaiva tri vakāreṇa bhāṣitam || 17 ||

pañcanādaṃ pañcatattvaṃ bindu svarga bibhūṣitam |
triguṇāktaṃ trikoṇañca pratikoṇaṃ trayānvitam (k, g, gh: 
triyānvitaṃ; kh, c: kriyānvitam) || 18 ||

koṇa mātre bindumātraṃ madhye nādaṃ maheśvari |
sarva varṇa kramamidamaṅgaṃ jñeyaṃ śivopari || 19 ||

bindu dvayaṃ vinā bhadre aṅkamātra na jāyate |
nāda vindvaṅka yuṅvarṇa (gh, c: nādabinduyutaṃ) brahma jñānasya 
kāraṇam || 20 ||

<p. 227>

tatśabdaṃ jñeya satśabdaṃ sarvabhāva prakāśitam |
tatsat jñeyaṃ brahma bījaṃ oṃkāre'bhūt prakāśitam || 21 ||

oṃkārād jāyate sarvaṃ oṃkāre ca pralīyate |
sṛṣṭi bījaṃ hi oṃkāraṃ laya bījaṃ trilocane || 22 ||

haṃsa bījāt (k, g, c: mantrāt) samudbhūtaṃ bhāvaṃ bhāvātītaṃ 
dhruvam |
dakṣiṇānāñca vāmānāṃ siddhāntānāṃ maheśvari || 23 ||

haṃsaḥ so'hañca nāhañca bhedābhedātmanātmakam |
kaulānāñcaiva divyānāṃ bhāvātītaṃ hi kevalam || 24 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse ūnaṣaṣṭyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ṣaṣṭitamollāsaḥ] |

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

kena (j: yena) mārgeṇa vā svāmin bhāvātītaṃ prakāśitam |
prakāśite'pi kaulānāṃ divyānāṃ bhedakaṃ vada || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

yanmārgiṇā bhavet kaulo divyo'bhūt tena mārgiṇā |
ubhayoreka bhāvena bhāvātītamayo bhavet || 2 ||

divyānāñca jagaddivyaṃ kaulānāṃ divya (g: bhāva) varjitam |
divyastu devavat prāyo vīraścoddhata mānasaḥ |
divya vīre ca yo bhedaḥ sa bhedaḥ parikathyate || 3 ||

<p. 228>

nigama tatve (-)

kaulānāṃ niyamo nāsti niṣedhays vidheḥ śive (gh: niṣedhañca 
vidhiḥ śivaḥ) |
divyānāñca tathā jñeyaṃ muktimātraṃ vibhedakam (g: -
mātrabhedakam) || 4 ||

divyānāṃ tejasi bhāve bhāvātītaṃ prakāśitam |
tejaḥ syāt paramāṇuśca sarva vyāpinirañjanam || 5 ||

kaulānāñca tathaivoktamabhāve bhāva varjitaṃ |
prasaṅgāt kathayāmyadya divyasyāpi ca lakṣaṇam || 6 ||

tathā ca samayācāratantre (-)

yadvarṇā devatā (k, g, c: devatāḥ)  yasya (k, g, c: sarvaṃ) tattejaḥ 
puñja pūritam |
tejomayaṃ jagat sarvaṃ vibhāvya mūrtti kalpanam (j: kalpitam) || 7 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse siddhāntācāra kathane 
ṣaṣṭyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[ekaṣaṣṭitamollāsaḥ] |

atha kaulācāraḥ |

nirdvandva mānaso bhūtvā jñātvā kāma kalā tanum |
idaṃ vīra kulaṃ devi jñeyaṃ ramyaṃ manoharam || 1 ||

(nirdvandvamānaso bhūtvā asyabhāvaḥ (c: asyabhāvaḥ prakāśitaḥ) 
yāmale)
dvandvātīto bhavedeka eko bhāvātītaḥ śive |
prakāśa vākyaṃ nirdvandvamekaṃ hrasvaṃ hi dīrghakam || 2 ||

<p. 229>

hrasva dīrgha krameṇaiva jagat sthāvara jaṅgamam |
guruṃ laghuṃ dīrghaṃ vācātītaṃ vacaḥ śive || 3 ||

bhāvātītaṃ jagat sarvaṃ jñānaṃ jñeyamayaṃ śivaṃ |
(ślokārddho'yaṃ k, c: pustakayorvidyate) jñānametat jagat sarvaṃ 
jñānaṃ jñeyamayaṃ śive || 4 ||

jñānametat jagat sarvaṃ manojñeyaṃ maheśvari |
jñānajñeyaṃ mano devi bhāvātītaṃ sunirmalam || 5 ||

jñānārṇave (-)

sthūla sūkṣma manaścāpi bhāvād bhāvātītaṃ śive |
bhāvātitād bhavedbhāvo bīja vṛkṣeva pārvati || 6 ||

ābrahmastamba paryantaṃ prabhāti mānase (k, g, c: mānasī; j: manasi) 
sadā (j: śive) |
ata eva maheśāni mano'tītaṃ nirañjanam || 7 ||

jñātvā kāma kalā tanu masya bhāvaḥ |

kulārṇave (-)

kāmena kāmanāsiddhirniṣkāmī mokṣatāṃ (j: kṣematām) vrajet |
ata eva jagat sarvaṃ kāmabhāvaṃ sulocane |
sadā kāmena sā bhāti kalārūpā sanātanī || 8 ||

atha kalā pramāṇamāha |

nīlatantre (-)

kulākulaṃ śmaśānañca latā veśyañca vāruṇam |
pīṭhaṃ nigūḍhā prakṛtiṃ yoniṃ cākhyānukīrttitam (k, c: 
cākhyānakīrttanaṃ) || 9 ||

<p. 230>

niruttare (-)

kalā cānukalāpañca kalāmātra prakīrtitā |
kalā ca dvividhā proktā guptā vyaktā maheśvari || 10 ||

guptā ca prakṛtirūpā vyaktā ramaṇadāyinī |
śmaśāna vāsino vīrāḥ kalāṃ pūjanti sarvadā || 11 ||

śmaśāna vāsino vīrāḥ guptāyoniṃ prapūjayet |
vyaktāyoniṃ (vyaktāyoniṃ yajedvīro'śmaśāne gopane śive |
iti k, g: pustakīyapāṭhaḥ |
vyaktāyoniṃ maheśāni śmaśāne gopane śive |
iti c: pustakīyapāṭhaḥ |) yajedvīraḥ śmaśāne gopane śive || 12 ||

kalāñca pūjayedguptāṃ mānasī (?)  parameśvari |
vyaktāpi (?) pūjayedvīro vāhye'pi nirjane priye || 13 ||

vyaktāyoniṃ maheśāni dvividhāṃ muktidāyinīm |
udāsināṃ śmaśānañca gṛhiṇāmarccayedbhagam || 14 ||

śmaśāna pūjanādvīro bhaga pūjādhikārakaḥ |
śavārūḍhāt tathā devi bhagārūḍhādhikārakaḥ || 15 ||

bhedajñānāt yathā devi ekajñānādhikārakaḥ |
śmaśāna dvividhaṃ devi citāyoniḥ prakīrtitā |
citā vyaktāpi deveśi guptayonīti kīrtitā || 16 ||

nirvāṇatantre (-)

brāhmaṇāḥ kṣatriyā vaiśyāḥ śūdrāśca parameśvari |
kalāvāsava yogena kalā pūjāṃ prakalpayet || 17 ||

kulārṇave (-)

āsavena vinā devi maithunaṃ naiva kārayet |
maithunena vinā devi madyapānaṃ na cācaret || 18 ||

<p. 231>

ata eva maheśāni gṛha dharmma praśastakaḥ |
śavāsanamudāsināṃ gṛhiṇāmāsavāsanam |
gatāsūnaśavaḥ prokto madya pānāsavaḥ priye || 19 ||

tantrāntare (-)

śave vāpyāsave vāpi kārya siddhirna saṃśayaḥ |
śavāsane bhedakāryamabhedamāsavāsane || 20 ||

śakti dehe maheśāni na kuryācca śavāsanam |
śaktidarśanamātreṇāpyudāsināṃ kriyā kṣayaḥ || 21 ||

āsavasyāsanaṃ devi puṃdehaṃ (g: -dehe) śakti dehakam |
puruṣasyāsanaṃ śaktiḥ śakteḥ puruṣa dehakam || 22 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse ekaṣaṣṭyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[dvāṣaṣṭitamollāsaḥ] |

atha prakṛti svarūpa lakṣaṇam |

vṛhadyoni tantre (-)

prakṛtiṃ vyarthatāṃ jñātvā yacca kālīṃ prapūjayet |
vṛthā pūjā bhavettasya na bījaṃ jala secanam || 1 ||

ajñātvā prakṛtiṃ devi (j: devīṃ) brahmajñānaṃ karoti yaḥ |
vṛthā jñānaṃ bhavettasya klīvamāliṅganaṃ yathā (k, c: śaktiṣu 
śaktisaṅgamam) || 2 ||

<p. 232>

(śloko'yaṃ g, gh, j: pustakeṣvadhiko dṛśyate) prakṛtijñānamālabhya 
brahmajñānaṃ karoti yaḥ |
vṛthā jñānaṃ bhavettasya śaktiṣu śaktisaṅgamam || 3 ||

keciddhyāyanti prakṛtiṃ kecicca puruṣaṃ śive (j: priye) |
te brahmajñāninaḥ santaḥ prakṛtiṃ puruṣātmakam || 4 ||

vinā na prakṛtiṃ brahma vinā brahma na tat śivām |
ubhayorjñānayogena brahmajānīti niścitam || 5 ||

siddhalāharītantre (-)

kecid vadanti prakṛtiṃ kecit puruṣa kīrttanam |
ubhayorekabhāvena brahmajñānīti niścitam || 6 ||

pārvatyuvāca (-)

vācātītaṃ kriyātītaṃ mano'tītaṃ sanātanam |
brahmajñānamidaṃ deva prakṛtiḥ kā vadasva me (j: prakṛtiṃ kāṃ 
vada prabho) || 7 ||

vṛhadyonitantre | śrīśiva uvāca (-)

yā proktā prakṛtirnityā jagadambe sanātani (gh, j: sanātanī) |
saiva yoni svarūpā ca (gh: sā) jagadutpatti kāriṇī || 8 ||

siddhalāharītantre (-)

sattvādayo guṇā devi jāyante prakṛterdhruvam |
brahma viṣṇu śivādīnāṃ mūlāḥ sattvādayo guṇāḥ || 9 ||

koṇatrayeṣu deveśi guṇatrayaṃ sutiṣṭhati |
sthūla sūkṣmamayaṃ jyotirvyāpitā prakṛtiḥ sthitā || 10 ||

<p. 233>

sattvādayo guṇāstasyāḥ sāpi sattvādayo guṇāḥ |
guṇātītā bhavet sāpi vācātītā hi vācikā (g, gh: vācakā; j: 
vācakam) || 11 ||

brahma viṣṇu śivādiśca bhaved yasyā (gh, j: tasyā) nijecchayā |
punaḥ pralīyate yasyā (gh, j: tasyāṃ) tasyāśca jāyate punaḥ || 12 ||

prakṛtirvikṛtimāpanne sarvaṃ paśyati pārvati |
vikṛtiḥ prakṛtimāpanne tataḥ kiñcinna paśyati || 13 ||

tantrāntare (-)

yā proktā prakṛtirnityā vikṛtiḥ sā maheśvari (j: syānmaheśvari) |
satvaṃ rajastamo devi kecidbhinnaṃ vadanti ca |
guṇa baddhāśca te jīvā mokṣasya nādhikāritā (k, g, c: 
nādhikāritāḥ; j: nādhikāriṇaḥ) || 14 ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

triguṇena (g: trikoṇena) mahādeva trividhā cet kriyāsthitā |
triguṇe'pyekabhāvo'pi guṇaśca kena jāyate || 15 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca (-)

guṇatraya vibhedena (k, g, c: vibhāgena) vikṛtiḥ syāt priyamvade |
ekabhāvena prakṛtiścaṇakākāra rūpakaḥ || 16 ||

tantrāntare (-)

yā proktā prakṛtirnityā caṇakākāra (k, g, c: caṇakākṛti) rūpiṇī |
vibhinne śiva śaktiḥ syādabhinne caṇakaḥ śive || 17 ||

<p. 234>

triguṇāktaṃ (j: triguṇānāṃ) trikoṇañca caṇakaṃ triguṇātmakam |
griguṇaḥ parameśāni bhūrjalaṃ (gh: kṣitirbhūḥ; c: ujjvalaṃ; j: 
kṣitiḥkaṃ) pāvako dhruvam || 18 ||

tamaḥ satvaṃ rajaścaiva (g, gh, j: tamorajaśca sattvañca) trikoṇeṣu 
(gh, j: triguṇeṣu) sadā sthitaḥ |
triguṇa (j: trikoṇa) vyāpitaṃ sarvaṃ jagat sthāvare jaṅgamam || 19 ||

ādyāśaktiyuto devaścaṇakākāra rūpakaḥ |
nirguṇasyālayaḥ sākṣānmahākālyālayaḥ priye || 20 ||

ānandasyāhutiṃ yatra (k, g, c: tatra) sa evānanda rūpakaḥ |
tadākṛtiḥ (j: prakṛtiḥ) sthūlabhūtā (gh: -bhūtvā)  nārīdeha (j: -
dehe) prakāśitā |
sūkṣmadeha (j: dehe) samudbhūtā puṃdeheṣu prakāśitā || 21 ||

nigamakalpadrume (-)

liṅgaṃ kṛcchraṃ bhagaṃ kṛcchraṃ veṣṭitaṃ bhuvana trayam |
liṅgamadhye sthitā yoniryonimadhye ca liṅgakam |
ubhāvubhau ca saṃtyaktvā kṣaṇamātra na tiṣṭhati || 22 ||

samayācāra tantre (-)

nirguṇaṃ yat paraṃ brahma śarīrādiṣu varjitam |
sākāraṃ yadbhaveddevi kevalaṃ bodha hetave || 23 ||

yathā sūryasya bimbañca bahudhā darpaṇādiṣu |
dṛśyate parameśāni tathā sarvamidaṃ jagat || 24 ||

eka eva paraṃ brahma jyotīrūpaṃ nirañjanam |
sākāraṃ yadi jāyeta svecchayāpi tadā priye || 25 ||

<p. 235>

jyotī rūpā mahāyoniḥ sthūla sūkṣma prabodhinī |
sākāraṃ svecchayā tasyā nirākārañca svecchayā || 26 ||

yadā sā'pyeka rūpā ca tadā sūkṣmā sanātanī |
yadā ced bahudhā bhūtā (j: bhūtvā) tadā jyotīti kīrtitā || 27 ||

śarīrādiyutā cet syāt sākāraṃ parameśvari |
bahunā (gh, j: bahudhā) ramaṇenāpi cābhāve bhābabodhakam || 28 ||

abhāvāj jāyate sarvaṃ jagat sthāvara jaṅgamam |
rūpatrayaṃ bhāvabodhaṃ sṛṣṭi sthiti layaḥ priye || 29 ||

prakṛtiśca pumāṃścaiva tayorvījaṃ hi bhautikam |
bhautikāṃ prakṛtiṃ jñeyāṃ (j: bhautikā prakṛtirjñeyā) bhautikaṃ 
puruṣaṃ śive || 30 ||

vadāmi bhautikaṃ brahma prakṛti puruṣātmakam |
bhagañca prakṛtiṃ jñeyaṃ pumān brahmeti pārvati || 31 ||

prakṛtyāñca (k, g, c: prakṛtyāyāḥ; gh: prakṛtyā) pumān (gh: 
puruṣa) brahma puṃsi prakṛtirīśvarī |
sarvadā vāyunā devi tatra śṛṅgārakāvubhau || 32 ||

vāyurākāśa saṃyukto vāyvāktaḥ sarvabhūtakaḥ (g: 
sarvabhautikaḥ; gh: pañcabhūtakaḥ) |
yathāṅgāṅgī mamāhañca (j: madaṅgañca) tathāpi 
pāñcabhautikaḥ (gh, c: -bhautikam) || 33 ||

anityaṃ pañcadhā jñeyaṃ pañcaikyaṃ nityakalpanam |
kalpanāyāṃ bhavet sṛṣṭiḥ kalpanāyāṃ layo bhavet |
kaula jñānamidaṃ devi kalpātītaṃ nirañjanam || 34 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanāthaviracite sarvollāse dvāṣaṣṭhyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||


[triṣaṣṭitamollāsaḥ] |

tantrāntare | śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

rūpatrayañca kiṃ deva brahmajñānañca kiṃ prabho |
kaivalyaṃ kīdṛśaṃ jñānaṃ kathaya prāṇa vallabha || 1 ||

śrīśiva uvāca (-)

sthūlarūpaṃ jyotīrūpaṃ sūkṣmarūpaṃ sulocane (j: trilocane) |
rūpatrayamidaṃ jñeyaṃ (g: proktaṃ) brahma jñānasya kāraṇam || 2 
||

atha brahmajñānam | śrīśiva uvāca (-)

ākāśājjāyate vāyurvāyorutpadyate raviḥ |
raverutpadyate toyaṃ toyādutpadyate mahī || 3 ||

pañcabhūtātmakaṃ yadyat sthūlarūpaṃ maheśvari |
aṇḍajaḥ svedajaścaiva udbhijjaśca jarāyujaḥ || 4 ||

aṇḍajāḥ pakṣi saprādyāḥ svedajā maśakādayaḥ |
vṛkṣa gulmādayo devi udbhijjāhi hi vicetanāḥ || 5 ||

jarāyujā mahādevi (gh, j: maheśāni) manujāḥ paśavastathā |
teṣāṃ madhye manuṣyeṣu brahmajñānañca jāyate || 6 ||

caturviṃśati tattvañca jyotīrūpaṃ prakāśitam |
tannāśe parameśāni sūkṣmadehī prakāśitaḥ || 7 ||

caturviṃśatitattvāni śṛṇuṣva prāṇa vallabhe |
kṣitirjalaṃ tathā tejo vāyurākāśa eva ca || 8 ||

<p. 237>

prāṇāpānasamānaśca vyānodānau (k, c: ścodānavyānau) ca 
vāyavaḥ |
śravaṇaṃ darśanaṃ ghrāṇaṃ sparśanaṃ rasa bodhanam || 9 ||

gudaṃ liṅgaṃ hastapādau vākyañca parameśvari |
(pāṭho'yaṃ gh, j: pustakayornāsti) tyāgaṃ śṛṅgāraścittendriya 
catuṣṭayam |
caturviṃśati tattvāni śaktiratra pṛthak pṛthak || 11 ||

śrīpārvatyuvāca (-)

caturviṃśati tattvāni kathitāni tvayā prabho |
adhunā śrotumicchāmi tattat śaktyanukīrttanam || 12 ||

śrīmhādeva uvāca (-)

anantāḥ śaktayo devi dehamadhye prakāśitāḥ |
gadituṃ naiva śaknomi brahmāṇḍānte'pi pārvati || 13 ||

tāsāṃ madhye śreṣṭhaṃ (j: sṛṣṭi) rūpā caturviṃśati rūpikā |
tāsāṃ madhye śreṣṭha (j: sṛṣṭi) rūpā caturddaśa parātmikā || 14 ||

tāsāṃ madhye caturddhā ca śaktirātmā (k, kh: śaktiruktā; c: 
śaktirūpā ca) maheśvari |
(pāṭho'yaṃ j: pustake adhiko vidyate) tridhaikātmā caturdhā ca 
śaktiruktā maheśvari || 15 ||

sundarī buddhirūpā ca manorūpā ca kālikā |
cittarūpā ca tārā (gh: tāriṇī cittarūpā ca) syāt (j: syuḥ) 
tridhaikoktā (gh: tridhaikātmā) kriyātmikā || 16 ||

śaṅkaro'bhūnmahādevo'pyahaṅkāra svarūpakaḥ |
vināhaṅkāramātreṇa kiñcinmātraṃ na jāyate || 17 ||

<p. 238>

ātmano'pi nirvikalpādahaṅkāraḥ prajāyate |
ahaṅkārasya nirlepādahaṃ brahmeti bhāṣyate || 18 ||

mṛttikāyāṃ ghaṭo devi hāṭake kaṭakaṃ yathā |
śuktau rajatavattoye taraṅga budbudau (k, g: taraṅgaṃ budbudaṃ) 
yathā || 19 ||

rajjau bhujaṅgavaddevi sphāṭike rañjanaṃ yathā |
tathā deho maheśāni dehimadhye prakāśitaḥ || 20 ||

ghaṭe nāśe mṛttikā syāt kaṭake hāṭakaṃ tathā (gh: yathā) |
taraṅga budbudau nāśe toyamātraṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 21 ||

bhujaṅga nāśe rajjuḥ syāt rañjane sphāṭikaṃ tathā (gh: yathā) |
dehanāśe tathā deho kevalo'haṃ nirañjanaḥ (j: niraṃjanam) || 22 ||

svarūpaṃ śūnyaṃ yaddhyānaṃ tat samādhirna saṃśayaḥ |
advaitaṃ (j: arthaitat) paramaṃ brahma kevalo'haṃ nirañjanaḥ (kh, g, 
c, j: -nam) || 23 ||

sarvātītaṃ paraṃ śāntaṃ svātma jñāna prabodhakam |
prabodhe tu pare tattve kevalo'haṃ nirañjanaḥ (g, j: -nam) || 24 ||

nirañjanamidaṃ jñeyamavāṅmanasa gocaram |
gadite (j: -tuṃ) tat paraṃ brahma sarvaṃ vyāpyaika (j: vyāpyaiva) 
saṃsthitam || 25 ||

tasmin (j: tasmāt) jātaṃ jagat sarvaṃ tasminneva sthitaṃ sadā |
pralīnaṃ hi punastasmin kṣitau vṛkṣeva (j: brahmaiva) pārvati || 26 ||

utpatte (k, kh, c: utpatti) rvyutkrameṇaiva sṛṣṭirvrahmaṇi (j: brahmava) 
līyate |
sṛjyate ca punastasmāt (gh: tasmin) svecchayā nija māyayā || 27 ||

<p. 239>

brahmakhelā jagat sarvaṃ brahma rūpamidaṃ jagat |
sarvaṃ hi khalvidaṃ brahma tadanyannāsti kiñcana || 28 ||

viśvasāre (-)

ābrahma stamba paryantaṃ paraṃ brahmasvarūpakam |
sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ vyāptaṃ praṇamāmi jaganmayam || 29 ||

tantrāntare (-)

bhāvātītaṃ paraṃ bhāvaṃ dhyānātītaṃ hi dhyānakam |
kriyātītaṃ kriyāyuktaṃ sarvaṃ vyāpyaika saṃsthitam || 30 ||

sarvātītaṃ sarva rūpaṃ nirvikalpañca kalpitam |
nirvikāraṃ vikārāktaṃ sarvaṃ vyāpyaika saṃsthitam || 31 ||

yallābhānnāparaṃ lābhaṃ yat sukhānnāparaṃ sukham |
yajajñānānnāparaṃ jñānaṃ tadbrahme tyavadhārayet || 32 ||

tantrāntare (-)

mahī vilīyate toye toyaṃ vilīyate ravau |
ravirvilīyate vāyau vāyurvilīyate ca khe || 33 ||

vyoma vilīyate satye satyaṃ vilīyate śive |
śivo vilīyate śaktau tato brahma nirūpaṇam || 34 ||

nigamatattvasāre (-)

brahmānandamayaṃ sarvaṃ yadi jānāti tattvataḥ |
tadā muktimavāpno yadā (gh, j: yathā) brahmapravindati || 35 ||

vāme prakṛti rūpā ca dakṣiṇe puruṣākṛtiḥ |
tayoḥ saṅgama (gh, j: saṃyoga) mātreṇa śarīraṃ jāyate dhruvam || 36 
||

<p. 240>

tadicchayā bhojanādi sarvametat tadīcchayā |
sukhecchāpi ca duḥkhecchā paraṃ brahma prakārakam (kh: 
prakāraṇam; gh: prakāśakam) || 37 ||

brahma khelā (j: brahmatvena jagat sarvaṃ doṣādoṣaṃ na cācaret |
doṣo'pi brahmaṇaḥ sarvaṃ guṇameva ca tasya tu (j: 
hāsyakautūhalādikam) || 38 ||

nṛtya gānādikaṃ (k, j: gītā) sarvaṃ aindrajālikavat priye |
līlayā brahmaṇaḥ sarvaṃ hāsya kautūhalādikam || 39 ||

khelārthañca (gh: khelārthaṃ; j: khelārtha hi) paraṃ (gh: paramaṃ) 
brahma sākāro'sti kṣaṇe kṣaṇe (gh: sākāraśca yugeyuge; j: 
sākārohi yugeyuge) |
divye śarīre so'pyasti tathā kīṭādikeṣu ca || 40 ||

sarvaṃ brahmamayaṃ jñātvā sarvakarmāṇi sādhayet |
pītvā tu mohamadirāṃ (gh, j: pītvā mohamadirāñca) unmatteva 
svayaṃ vibhuḥ || 41 ||

mānuṣī tanumāśritya sukhaṃ mokṣañca kāṅkṣati |
bhūta prakṛtimāśritya dehināṃ dehanāśakṛt || 42 ||

dhānināṃ dhana nāśāya dasyurūpadharo'vyayaḥ |
nirmamo (j: nirmalo) nirahaṅkāraḥ sadā jyotirmayaḥ smṛtaḥ || 43 ||

kvacit śokādi vyākrāntaḥ kvacit saukhyādi saṃkulaḥ |
kvaciddhāsyādi saṃyukto dhanavānati (k, g, c: dhana nārīti) kaścana || 
44 ||

kāminī rūpamāśritya kāminīnāṃ kalevare |
kāmonmattā kāmamayī (gh: kāmonmattaḥ kāmayate) paraṃ 
brahmaiva sarvathā |
madanaṃ rūpamāśritya puruṣo vihvalāyate || 45 ||

gururūpaṃ samāśritya lokaḥ mantrāyate bhavāt |
ātmecchayā kṛtaṃ karma doṣādoṣaṃ na cācaret || 46 ||

<p. 241>

brahmarūpamidaṃ sarvaṃ brahmarūpaṃ jaganmayaṃ |
ūrddhaśūnye gatistasya madhyaśūnye vyavasthitaḥ || 47 ||

adhaḥ śūnye ca gamanaṃ ko vā jānāti tattvataḥ |
ūrddha śūnye svapna bhāvaṃ brahma randhraṃ prakīrtitam || 48 ||

madhyaśūnyaṃ (j: -śūnye) bhruvormadhye tasmin jñānādi cintanam 
|
mūlādhāre adhaḥ śūnyaṃ tatra kāmādi cintanam || 49 ||

śūnyānte krīḍati brahma ajño'pi (c, j: ājñā) nahi labhyate |
sa tiṣṭhati paraṃ brahma svecchayā līlayāpi ca || 50 ||

jñānāt siddhimavāpnoti na jñānānna ca siddhibhāk |
brahmajñānamidaṃ vatsa yo na jānāti tattvataḥ |
dhyāna pūjādikaṃ sarvaṃ tasya siddhirna jāyate || 51 ||

brahmajñānaṃ vinā sarvamasiddhikāraṇaṃ smṛtam |
ata eva maheśāna kalau siddhirna jāyate || 52 ||

siddherhi kāraṇaṃ brahma sarvathaiva kuleśvara |
yo vijānāti tattvena dehānte brahmabhāg bhavet || 53 ||

[iti śrīsarvānandanātha viracite sarvollāse triṣaṣṭyullāsaḥ] || 0 ||

(*) [etāvāneva grantha upalabdhaḥ] (*)



